window.SECTOR_DNA={"801010":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the November 2016 to October 2018 peak-to-trough bear leg: same structural pattern of SHCOMP in positive territory, market dominated by a narrow style theme (then deleveraging/quality-value, now AI/growth), Agriculture losing its sector-specific tailwinds (then post-hog-cycle peak with prices entering a multi-year downturn, now the hog glut in its third year with no near-term relief), and the sector stuck in the middle-lower third of Shenwan for an extended duration (nearly 24 months then vs 20+ months now). In 2016-2018, the recovery only came when ASF delivered an exogenous supply shock in August 2018 that reset the entire hog price cycle. Today's analog suggests Agriculture requires either a similarly exogenous livestock-supply catalyst OR a broad policy pivot combining PBOC easing and a food-security-focused No.1 Document to rotate back into leadership.","analog_zh":"当前形态与2016年11月至2018年10月的峰谷下行段高度相似：上证指数维持正区间，市场由窄基风格主题主导（彼时为去杠杆/质量价值风格，当下为AI/成长风格），农林牧渔板块特定顺风完全消散（彼时为生猪周期峰后猪价进入多年下行，当下为生猪过剩周期延续第三年且短期无回转信号），板块在申万中长期处于中低段（彼时约24个月，当下已逾20个月）。2016-2018年的反转仅在非洲猪瘟（2018年8月）带来外生性供给冲击彻底重置生猪价格周期后才到来。当前形态显示，农林牧渔转机同样需要类似外生性牲畜供给催化剂，或宏观政策全面转向（人行降准加粮食安全重点一号文件）。","bottom_signals":["Live-hog prices falling below full-cost line (~11.5-12.5 RMB/kg) for 2+ consecutive quarters with listed farm losses accelerating — historically precedes herd liquidation and eventual supply tightening 6-12 months later","Agriculture sector ranked bottom-3 Shenwan for 6+ months in a risk-on tape while SHCOMP is positive — maximum abandonment and sentiment trough signal","PBOC RRR cut + No.1 Document/food security policy headline in same quarter as first hog-price stabilization signal — the triple combination that preceded the Jul 2021 and Oct 2018 rallies"],"bottom_signals_zh":["生猪价格连续2个季度以上跌破完全成本线（约11.5-12.5元/公斤），上市养殖企业亏损加速——历史上预示6-12个月后去产能启动、供给收紧","农林牧渔连续6个月以上在风险偏好回升期内位居申万后三，且上证指数为正——极度边缘化即情绪谷底信号","人行降准 + 一号文件/粮食安全政策标题 + 猪价企稳信号三重共振——此组合曾先于2021年7月及2018年10月大涨出现"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Hog/livestock commodity price cycle (ASF, over-expansion, environmental culls)","PBOC easing cycles (RRR cuts, LPR reductions)","Beijing food/grain security policy (No.1 Document, seed revitalization)","Broad SHCOMP beta (participates in market-wide rallies as mid-table)","Avian/livestock disease outbreaks (H7N9, ASF, COVID animal-transmission fears)","Market style rotation (abandoned in tech/growth tapes, marginal refuge in value tapes)"],"drivers_zh":["生猪/畜牧商品价格周期（非洲猪瘟、过度扩张、环保清栏）","人行宽松周期（降准、LPR下调）","北京粮食/种业安全政策（一号文件、种业振兴）","上证指数宽基Beta（市场上行期中游跟涨）","禽畜疫病暴发（H7N9、非洲猪瘟、新冠动物传播恐慌）","市场风格轮动（科技/成长行情中彻底出局，价值行情中有限防御）"],"median_cycle_months":10.2,"summary":"China Agriculture (801010) cycles between two overlapping engines: (1) the domestic hog/livestock commodity price cycle, which pivots every 12-24 months as ASF outbreaks, environmental-policy herd culls, industrial-farm over-expansion, and demand shifts alternate between supply destruction (rally) and oversupply glut (selloff); and (2) broad SHCOMP beta — when the index surges on PBOC easing or policy stimulus, Agriculture participates as mid-table follower, and only outperforms when a sector-specific catalyst (ASF, food security, H7N9 recovery) coincides. The most powerful alpha legs — Oct 2018 to Apr 2019 (+82.5%), Sep-Oct 2019 (+20.9%), and Jul 2021 to Jan 2022 (+28.5%) — were all hog/livestock supply-shock driven regardless of the market direction.","summary_zh":"农林牧渔（801010）的周期由两大引擎交替驱动：（1）国内生猪/畜牧商品价格周期，每12-24个月随非洲猪瘟冲击、环保政策清栏、规模化养殖产能过度扩张及需求变化在供给破坏（上行）与产能过剩（下行）之间切换；（2）上证指数的宽基Beta——当指数因人行宽松或政策刺激上涨时，农林牧渔跟随中游，仅当板块特定催化剂（非洲猪瘟、粮食安全、H7N9消退）同步出现时才显著跑赢大市。板块最具Alpha的行情（2018年10月至2019年4月+82.5%、2019年9-10月+20.9%、2021年7月至2022年1月+28.5%）均为生猪/畜牧供给冲击所独立驱动，与指数方向无关。","top_signals":["Live-hog spot prices at record highs / CPI pork component surging above 3% YoY (e.g. Oct 2019 CPI 3.8%, pork +110% YoY) — sector peaks 1-3 months after CPI peak","Hog-farming stocks at 12-month forward P/E above 30x with feed costs rising — earnings upgrade cycle at peak, subsequent revisions turn negative","SHCOMP at multi-year highs in a growth/tech tape while Agriculture has been mid-table laggard for 3+ consecutive months — structural abandonment implies sector at relative peak before the growth rotation deepens"],"top_signals_zh":["生猪现货价格创历史高位/CPI猪肉分项同比超3%（如2019年10月CPI同比3.8%、猪肉+110%）——板块见顶通常滞后CPI高点1-3个月","养殖股12个月远期市盈率超30倍叠加饲料成本上升——盈利上调周期见顶，后续预测转下修","上证指数在成长/科技行情中创多年高位，且农林牧渔连续3个月以上为中游落后——结构性边缘化预示板块相对高点"]},"801030":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the November 2016-to-January 2019 bear leg: both periods followed a policy-stimulus-driven cyclical peak, both saw prolonged multi-sector deleveraging (credit tightening then vs property/rate shock now) that kept defensives ahead for 2+ years, and the eventual recovery trigger in both cases was a combined PBOC rate+RRR easing pivot. The key difference today is the presence of an established new-energy chemical sub-sector that has already re-rated once (2019-21) and may re-rate again if the EV demand cycle recovers — analogous to how PPI reflation in 2016 gave chemicals a second wind after the 2015 crash. If the Sep-2024 stimulus cycle follows a trajectory similar to the 2016 supply-side reform rally, the current post-bazooka pause is consistent with mid-cycle digestion before a second cyclical leg higher.","analog_zh":"当前形态最接近2016年11月至2019年1月的下行阶段：两者均在政策刺激驱动的周期高点后随即经历持续多年的信用收缩（当时是去杠杆，现在是地产/利率冲击），期间防御股持续领先超过两年，最终均由央行降息降准的组合宽松开启复苏。当前的关键差异在于：已有一个成熟的新能源化工子赛道经历过2019-21年一轮重估，若新能源汽车需求周期复苏，存在再度重估的可能——类似于2016年PPI通胀修复为2015年崩盘后的化工板块带来第二春。若2024年9月刺激周期走势与2016年供给侧改革复苏路径相似，当前大招后的阶段性整理符合中段消化再出发的规律。","bottom_signals":["Sector is #27-29/28-31 for two consecutive legs — multi-leg extreme underperformance signals washout (seen at 2019 trough and 2022-2024 trough)","PPI turns from deeply negative (-4% or below) toward flat/positive — the deflation-to-reflation turn has historically been the entry signal","PBOC announces a combined rate + RRR cut (especially >25bp LPR cut or >50bp RRR cut) — every major trough was preceded within 3 months by such a move","Lithium/upstream commodity prices fall 70%+ from peak and producer inventory drawdown begins"],"bottom_signals_zh":["板块连续两轮均排名第27-29/28-31——极度落后持续多轮是洗盘信号（见2019年底和2022-2024年底部）","PPI从深度负值（-4%以下）转向平盘/正值——历史上通缩转再通胀是重要入场信号","央行宣布降息+降准组合（尤其是LPR降幅超25bp或降准超50bp）——每次重要底部前3个月内均有此类操作","锂盐等上游商品价格从高点回落超70%且生产商开始去库存"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC rate/RRR cycle — primary switch for sector entry and exit","China PPI inflation/deflation cycle — direct pricing power driver for bulk chemicals","New-commodity demand shocks (NEV battery materials, semiconductor chemicals) — structural re-rating engine","Credit availability for energy-intensive capex — sector can only expand when credit is cheap","Regulatory/policy shocks (dual-carbon curbs, anti-pollution campaigns) — can override positive macro signals"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息/降准周期——板块进出场的首要开关","中国PPI通胀/通缩周期——大宗化工品定价能力的直接驱动","大宗商品新需求冲击（新能源电池材料、半导体化学品）——结构性重估引擎","能耗密集型资本开支的信贷可得性——宽信用是行业扩张的前提","监管/政策冲击（双碳限电、环保整治）——可凌驾于积极宏观信号之上"],"median_cycle_months":22,"summary":"China Chemicals (Shenwan 801030) is a pure cyclical-beta sector that amplifies the SHCOMP through a persistent mechanism: it rises when policy easing unlocks credit and downstream demand (construction, auto, NEV batteries) and collapses when Beijing tightens credit, imposes regulatory shocks, or commodity supply floods the market after a demand-driven price spike. The sector has a recurring two-layer cycle: a short-term layer driven by PBOC easing/tightening and A-share market sentiment (4-11 month swings), and a longer structural layer driven by new-commodity demand waves — notably the 2012-2015 leverage bubble, the 2019-2021 NEV-materials super-cycle, and the 2024-2026 stimulus reflation. The defining structural feature is that Shenwan Chemicals contains both bulk commodities (PPI-sensitive) and technology-adjacent specialty chemicals (EV and semiconductor materials), so it outperforms most decisively when both the commodity and growth themes align simultaneously, as in 2019-2021.","summary_zh":"申万基础化工（801030）是典型的高Beta周期板块，其涨跌紧密放大上证综指的方向：政策宽松打开信用、刺激建筑/汽车/新能源需求时板块上行；北京收紧信用、出台监管冲击或供给在需求驱动涨价后大量释放时板块下行。板块存在两层周期叠加：一是由央行宽松/收紧及A股情绪主导的短周期（4-11个月）；二是由大宗商品新需求浪潮推动的结构性长周期（如2012-2015杠杆牛市、2019-2021新能源材料超级周期、2024-2026刺激再通胀）。板块的核心结构特征是同时涵盖大宗化工品（PPI敏感）和科技关联型专用化学品（新能源/半导体材料），当商品与成长主题同步共振时（如2019-2021年），板块超额表现最为显著。","top_signals":["Sector reaches top-3 Shenwan ranking after a 100%+ move: past peaks occurred at #3/28 (2015-06) and #3/28 (2021-09) after massive outperformance","Lithium/chemical upstream commodity prices spike to multi-sigma extremes AND new supply capacity announcements surge simultaneously","SHCOMP P/E above 18-20x with growth outperforming value by 30pp+ in the trailing window","Deleveraging or regulatory campaign headline risks appear after an extended credit-expansion phase"],"top_signals_zh":["板块在累涨100%以上后跻身申万行业前三名：历史峰值出现在排名第3/28（2015年6月）和第3/28（2021年9月）之后","锂盐等上游化工品价格飙升至历史极值同时新增产能公告激增","上证综指市盈率升至18-20倍以上，成长股跑赢价值股超30pp","信用扩张周期延长后出现去杠杆或监管整治风险信号"]},"801040":{"analog":"Today's selloff from March 2026 most rhymes with the August 2015 peak (start: 2015-08-17): Steel was again last/second-last, a macro/policy shock drove extreme underperformance versus the index (CNY devaluation then; AI rotation plus tariff escalation now), and the eventual turn required a fundamental supply or demand pivot (the 2016 276-day supply-side reform then; a credible property floor or export-tariff relief now) rather than mere sentiment recovery. The nearer-term April 2024 peak / September 2024 trough sequence is a secondary analog — the same tariff-shock-into-property-glut setup with Steel dead last, followed by a stimulus-driven beta bounce that did not durably re-rate the sector.","analog_zh":"当前2026年3月起的跌势与2015年8月高点（起始日期2015-08-17）最为神似：彼时钢铁同样排名倒数，宏观/政策冲击导致板块相对大盘的极端跑输（当时为人民币贬值，此次为AI轮动叠加关税升级），而最终拐点均需等待实质性的供给或需求转向（当年为2016年276天供给侧改革，当前为有公信力的地产托底或出口关税松绑），而非仅靠情绪修复驱动。较近的2024年4月高点/2024年9月低点序列为次要类比——同样是关税冲击叠加地产积压导致钢铁垫底，随后出现刺激驱动的贝塔反弹，但未能持续重估板块。","bottom_signals":["Steel ranks last or 2nd-last in Shenwan with SHCOMP in drawdown and cyclicals lagging defensives by 10pp+","Iron ore price slumping (e.g. below USD 80/t) with housing starts contracting double-digit year-on-year","Steel export volume surging to multi-year highs while drawing anti-dumping actions in 3+ major markets","Sector below its 200-day moving average with cycle-range position at 0.3x or lower"],"bottom_signals_zh":["钢铁在申万行业中排名倒数一二，上证综指下行且周期板块跑输防御板块10个百分点以上","铁矿石价格走低（如跌破80美元/吨），新开工面积同比两位数萎缩","钢材出口量激增至多年高点，同时在3个以上主要市场遭受反倾销调查","板块低于200日均线，周期分位处于0.3倍或更低"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Beijing infrastructure and property investment cycle (~40-50% of steel demand)","PBOC credit easing/tightening and RRR cycle","supply-side capacity policy (supply-side reform, dual-carbon output cuts)","global commodity reflation/deflation cycle and iron ore price","margin leverage and retail sentiment amplifier in SHCOMP rallies","US/global tariff and anti-dumping regime on Chinese steel exports"],"drivers_zh":["北京基础设施与地产投资周期（约占钢铁需求40-50%）","央行宽信用/收紧周期与存款准备金率调整","供给侧产能政策（供给侧改革、双碳减产限令）","全球大宗商品再通胀/通缩周期与铁矿石价格","A股牛市中融资杠杆与散户情绪放大器","美国及全球对华钢铁出口关税与反倾销制度"],"median_cycle_months":30,"summary":"China Steel cycles structurally around three interacting forces: the Beijing infrastructure and property investment cycle (historically ~40-50% of domestic steel demand), the supply-side policy pendulum (capacity expansion in boom years, forced cuts in supply-side reform or dual-carbon phases), and the SHCOMP-wide risk-appetite cycle driven by PBOC easing/tightening and margin leverage. When all three align — credit loosening, infrastructure stimulus, and supply discipline — Steel becomes a top-3 Shenwan performer (2016-2018 at +67.7%, 2020-2021 at +132%). When they turn negative simultaneously — property bust, export pressure, tariff shocks, and liquidity withdrawal — Steel falls to last or second-last in the universe with drawdowns of 38-49%. The sector has near-zero pricing power in down cycles due to structural overcapacity, making it among the most violent cyclicals in the A-share universe.","summary_zh":"A股钢铁板块的周期结构性地围绕三大交互力量运行：北京的基础设施与地产投资周期（历史上约占国内钢铁需求40-50%）、供给侧政策摆锤（繁荣期产能扩张、供给侧改革或双碳阶段强制去产能），以及由央行宽松/收紧与杠杆资金驱动的上证综指整体风险偏好周期。当三者共振向上时——信用宽松、基建刺激、供给约束——钢铁可跻身申万行业前三（2016-2018年+67.7%、2020-2021年+132%）。当三者同步反转时——地产崩盘、出口受压、关税冲击、流动性收紧——钢铁则沦为全行业末位或倒数第二，跌幅达38-49%。由于结构性产能过剩，该板块在下行周期中定价权近乎为零，是A股市场波动最剧烈的周期板块之一。","top_signals":["Steel ranks top-5 in Shenwan while SHCOMP posts an index surge and value outperforms growth — classic cyclical-euphoria signal","Iron ore price sustained at elevated levels with construction/FAI activity data accelerating","PBOC easing cycle in full swing with social-financing (TSF) growth re-accelerating","Dual-carbon or supply-reform output cuts fully priced while steel-mill margins reach multi-year highs"],"top_signals_zh":["钢铁在申万行业中排名前5，上证综指大涨且价值风格跑赢成长——典型周期泡沫信号","铁矿石价格维持高位，建筑/固定资产投资活动数据加速上行","央行宽松周期全面展开，社会融资总量增速重新加速","双碳或供给侧减产利多已完全定价，吨钢毛利率达多年高点"]},"801050":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup (June 2026 Bottoming at 12.3% percentile) is the October 2018 trough (leg starting 2018-10-18): same deep drawdown following a speculative blow-off and multi-shock combination (trade war + domestic policy shock in 2018; speculative bubble burst + tariff escalation in 2026), same flight-to-safety defensive leadership (Coal, Utilities now vs Food & Bev, Coal then), and the same policy pivot setup — the PBOC had already pivoted easing and Beijing was signaling fiscal support. In 2018, the subsequent 6-month rally delivered +40.6%. The key difference: the current trough is below the 200-day average, exactly as in October 2018, and the growth-beat-value spread (18.2pp currently) mirrors the early 2019 growth rotation that preceded Metals re-leadership.","analog_zh":"当前行情（2026年6月筑底，历史分位数12.3%）最接近2018年10月触底走势（即2018-10-18起始腿）：均为多重冲击后的深度超跌（2018年贸易战+国内去杠杆；2026年投机泡沫破裂+关税升级），均呈现防御股领先（彼时食品饮料、煤炭；当前煤炭、公用事业），且均发生在人民银行已转向宽松、北京明确释放财政支撑信号的政策窗口。2018年10月触底后六个月有色金属上涨40.6%。关键相似之处：当前板块同样跌破200日均线（与2018年10月一致），成长/价值溢价18.2pp也与2019年初成长轮动先于有色再度领涨的结构吻合。","bottom_signals":["Nonferrous Metals ranked in bottom 3 of Shenwan universe for two consecutive legs with sector percentile below 15%","LME copper below $7,500/t with China PMI in contraction and property investment falling double-digits YoY","Defensives strongly outleading cyclicals by 15pp+ while Metals underperforms the defensive average","PBOC pivoting to easing (RRR or LPR cut announced) with copper physical inventory drawdown beginning"],"bottom_signals_zh":["连续两个申万行业下行腿中有色金属排名倒数前三，历史分位数跌破15%","LME铜跌破7500美元/吨，中国PMI处于收缩区间，房地产投资同比跌幅超两位数","防御股领先周期股15pp以上，有色金属甚至跑输防御股均值","人民银行启动宽松转向（公告降准或LPR下调），铜实物库存开始去化"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC monetary easing/tightening cycle (RRR/LPR cuts)","LME copper and aluminum price trends","China supply-side capacity policy (SSSR, production cuts)","structural demand themes (infrastructure, green energy, AI/EV)","USD cycle and global risk appetite (risk-on/risk-off)","speculative leverage cycles (margin accounts, retail commodity futures)"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行货币宽松/紧缩周期（降准/LPR调整）","LME铜铝价格趋势","中国产能政策（供给侧改革、产能压减）","结构性需求主题（基建、绿色能源、AI/新能源汽车）","美元周期与全球风险偏好（风险偏好开/关）","投机杠杆周期（融资融券、散户商品期货）"],"median_cycle_months":10,"summary":"Nonferrous Metals (801050) cycles on the intersection of three recurring engines: (1) China's domestic monetary/credit cycle — PBOC RRR and rate cuts inflate risk appetite and commodity demand, while tightening or shadow-banking crackdowns crush cyclicals hardest; (2) global commodity price regimes — LME copper and aluminum prices, driven by USD strength/weakness, global industrial activity, and supply-side capacity shocks (particularly China's own supply-side structural reform), act as the sector's primary profit amplifier; (3) demand thematics — each major bull leg has been associated with a China-specific structural demand narrative (urbanization 2012-2015, green energy/carbon neutrality 2020-2021, AI/EV 2024-2026). The sector systematically outranks peers when all three align (loose money + rising metals + strong demand narrative) and catastrophically underperforms when any two flip negative simultaneously, making it one of the most volatile and mean-reverting Shenwan industries.","summary_zh":"有色金属（801050）的周期运行由三大引擎交互驱动：①中国国内货币/信用周期——人民银行降准降息推动风险偏好与大宗需求，而收紧或影子银行整顿则对周期股冲击最烈；②全球大宗商品价格机制——LME铜铝价格受美元走强/走弱、全球工业活动、产能供给冲击（尤其中国供给侧改革）主导，是板块利润核心放大器；③需求叙事主题——每轮主要牛市均伴随特定结构性需求逻辑（2012-2015城镇化、2020-2021绿色能源/碳中和、2024-2026 AI/新能源汽车）。三者共振时板块领涨全市场，任意两项转负则深度跑输，是申万行业中弹性最大、均值回归最剧烈的板块之一。","top_signals":["Nonferrous Metals ranked #1 in Shenwan universe for 2+ consecutive legs (seen at 2012, 2016, 2017, 2021, 2024 peaks)","LME copper approaching or exceeding prior cycle highs with heavy domestic retail speculative participation in SHFE futures","Growth-value spread widening sharply (>20pp) while Metals co-leads alongside tech — signals momentum exhaustion","PBOC gold buying streak entering late innings alongside retail gold/silver futures crowding"],"top_signals_zh":["有色金属连续2个以上申万行业排名第一（见于2012、2016、2017、2021、2024年各轮高点）","LME铜价逼近或突破前周期高点，国内散户在上期所期货大幅拥挤","成长/价值风格溢价急剧走阔（超20pp）且有色与科技共同领涨——动量衰竭信号","人民银行增持黄金步入后期，同时散户黄金/白银期货持仓高度拥挤"]},"801080":{"analog":"Closest to the Feb-2020 peak: same structure of Electronics ranked #1/31 after a 100-plus-percent sector-specific re-rating on a structural tech theme (5G then, AI now), with SHCOMP lagging far behind sector returns (+6.6% in that leg vs +1.6% in the current leg), and the sector entering a Topping phase after outperforming the growth cohort by more than 40 pp. In Feb-2020, Electronics then fell 31.8% in five weeks as COVID forced an unwind of the crowded leader. The current analog implies the next catalytic shock (a tariff re-escalation, a geopolitical supply-chain event, or a broader SHCOMP correction) could trigger a comparable 25-40% drawdown from current peak levels, with the most leverage-concentrated names — domestic AI chip plays — as the primary liquidation targets.","analog_zh":"与2020年2月峰值最为相似：电子行业在5G/AI结构性主题驱动下以100%+的板块特定涨幅排名第1/31，上证综指远滞后于行业涨幅（彼时行情段大盘+6.6%，当前+1.6%），且行业在大幅跑赢成长组合40pp以上后进入见顶阶段。2020年2月，电子随后在五周内暴跌31.8%，拥挤龙头遭强制平仓。当前类比意味着下一个催化冲击（关税重新升级、地缘政治供应链事件或上证综指更大范围回调）可能从当前峰值引发25%-40%的类似回撤，杠杆最集中的国产AI芯片标的将成为首要出清目标。","bottom_signals":["Electronics ranked bottom 5 of 31 sectors for 2 or more consecutive legs with defensive sector leaders","Concurrent US tariff/export-control escalation announcement matching ZTE Apr-2018, BIS Oct-2022, Liberation Day Apr-2025 pattern","Cycle position score below 10 with Bottoming phase label","PBOC LPR or RRR cut with simultaneous Central Huijin ETF buying announcement"],"bottom_signals_zh":["电子行业连续2个以上阶段排名倒数5且防御板块领涨","美国关税/出口管制升级公告并发（中兴2018年4月、BIS 2022年10月、解放日2025年4月的历史规律）","周期位置得分低于10且处于筑底阶段标签","央行降LPR或降准同步伴随中央汇金ETF买入公告"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["A-share margin/leverage cycle amplifying sector beta","US export controls and tariffs (proximate cause of every major selloff post-2018)","Domestic semiconductor policy (IC Big Fund, STAR Market, Made in China 2025)","Global tech theme cycle (5G infrastructure, AI inference chip demand)","PBOC liquidity regime (LPR/RRR cuts unlocking growth re-rating)"],"drivers_zh":["A股融资/杠杆周期放大板块贝塔","美国出口管制与关税（2018年后每次大跌的直接原因）","国内半导体政策（大基金、科创板、中国制造2025）","全球科技主题周期（5G基础设施、AI推理芯片需求）","央行流动性周期（降LPR/降准释放成长重估空间）"],"median_cycle_months":10.85,"summary":"China Electronics (SW 801080) cycles on the intersection of two recurring structural forces: (1) the A-share liquidity/leverage cycle — retail margin-debt expansions amplify the sector's beta in bull markets and force catastrophic mean-reversions in bear markets; and (2) the US-China technology decoupling shock — every material US export-control or tariff escalation since 2018 has been the primary proximate cause of Electronics selloffs, while every truce or domestic-substitution breakthrough (IC Fund, STAR Market, 5G licenses, DeepSeek) has ignited the next bull leg. The sector's high-multiple, capital-intensive profile makes it the most growth-style-pure of all 31 Shenwan sectors, so it leads in growth-on tapes and is the first liquidated in value/defensive rotations. The median full cycle peak-to-peak is approximately 11 months, but the distribution is bimodal: crash-bounce sequences (2015, 2018-19) produce 1-5 month micro-cycles, while structural re-ratings (2012-2015, 2019-2020, 2024-2026) span 18-30 months.","summary_zh":"中国电子行业（申万801080）的周期由两大结构性力量交织驱动：（1）A股流动性/杠杆周期——散户融资余额扩张在牛市中放大行业贝塔，在熊市中则引发惨烈均值回归；（2）中美科技脱钩冲击——2018年以来每一次美国出口管制或关税升级都是电子行业下跌的首要直接原因，而每一次休战或国产替代突破（大基金、科创板、5G牌照、DeepSeek）都点燃了下一轮牛市行情。行业高估值、资本密集的特征使其成为31个申万板块中成长风格最纯的板块，在成长行情中率先领涨，在价值/防御轮动中率先被清仓。峰-峰中位周期约11个月，但分布呈双峰形态：崩溃-反弹序列（2015年、2018-19年）产生1-5个月的微周期，而结构性重估行情（2012-2015年、2019-2020年、2024-2026年）则历时18-30个月。","top_signals":["Electronics ranked #1/31 for 2 or more consecutive legs with growth-value gap above 30 pp (current: #1, +72.5 pp)","Cycle position score above 90 with Topping phase label","Margin debt as percentage of market cap approaching prior leverage peaks","SHCOMP at multi-year highs while US-China trade/tech policy risk remains unresolved"],"top_signals_zh":["电子行业连续2个以上阶段排名第1/31且成长-价值差距超30pp（当前：第1名，+72.5pp）","周期位置得分超90且处于见顶阶段标签","融资余额占市值比例接近历史杠杆峰值","上证综指处于多年高位但中美贸易/科技政策风险尚未化解"]},"801110":{"analog":"Closest to the October 2018 trough analog: same growth-tape dominance into sector deep underperformance (ranked 25th-29th), followed by a policy pivot (PBOC easing + subsidy announcement) that drove 18-24 months of outperformance once the growth style faded. The current mid-2026 setup rhymes with late-2018 in that: (a) sector is at a trough (pos 9.0) and deeply lagging (rs_rank 8/31); (b) a growth/tech-style tape is crushing value names (growth +18.2pp over defensives); (c) a policy backstop is in place (2026 yi jiu huan xin continuation) but not yet generating excess demand in a soft property market. In 2018-19, the turning signal was the G20 trade truce; here the analog catalyst would be a confirmed property-completion inflection or a value-style rotation trigger such as a growth-stock earnings disappointment cycle.","analog_zh":"最接近2018年10月底部的历史形态：同样经历成长风格主导下板块严重跑输（排名第25-29位），随后政策转向（人民银行宽松+补贴落地）在成长风格主导消退后推动18-24个月超额表现。当前2026年中格局与2018年底高度相似：（a）板块处于底部（位置评分9.0），深度落后（RS排名8/31）；（b）成长/科技风格行情持续压制价值股（成长领先防御18.2个百分点）；（c）政策底部支撑已在位（2026年以旧换新延续），但在地产疲软环境中尚未形成超额需求。2018-19年的转折信号为G20贸易休战；当前类比催化剂为地产竣工数据拐点确认，或成长股盈利落空周期触发的价值风格轮动。","bottom_signals":["Property new starts turn positive YoY or government announces material completion-support measures","New consumer subsidy program announced covering white-goods categories","Sector falls to bottom quintile (rs_rank below 10/31) while SHCOMP begins to recover -- divergence setup","Value/dividend rotation confirmed: banks, telecoms, staples leading while growth lags by 15pp+"],"bottom_signals_zh":["全国新房开工量同比转正或政府宣布重大竣工支持举措","新消费补贴政策落地（覆盖白电品类）","板块跌至末位五分位（RS排名低于10/31），而上证综指开始回升——背离筑底信号","价值/红利风格确认轮动：银行、通信、消费主导，成长落后15个百分点以上"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Property completion cycle (6-12 month lag to white-goods demand)","Beijing consumer subsidy programs (energy-saving / trade-in yi jiu huan xin)","A-share growth-vs-value style rotation","PBOC easing cycles (RRR / rate cuts unlocking liquidity)","US-China trade war tariff risk (export revenue sensitivity)","Raw material costs (copper, steel margin sensitivity)"],"drivers_zh":["地产竣工周期（滞后6-12个月传导白电需求）","北京消费补贴政策（节能惠民/以旧换新）","A股成长与价值风格轮动","人民银行宽松周期（降准/降息释放流动性）","中美贸易战关税风险（出口收入敏感性）","原材料成本（铜、钢利润率敏感性）"],"median_cycle_months":16.2,"summary":"China Home Appliances cycles structurally around three recurring drivers: (1) the property-completion cycle -- new home starts and completions directly drive white-goods demand (air conditioners, washing machines, refrigerators for new homes), making the sector a leveraged play on China's real estate cycle with a 6-12 month lag; (2) Beijing's periodic consumer subsidy programs (energy-saving jie neng hui min in 2009-13; trade-in yi jiu huan xin launched 2024 and extended 2026) which create short-duration demand surges that temporarily decouple the sector from the broader SHCOMP; and (3) A-share style rotations between growth/tech (when the sector underperforms) and value/dividend quality (when the sector outperforms). Because Midea, Haier, and Gree are among the highest-yielding large-caps in China's consumer universe, the sector amplifies in value-style rallies and is abandoned in growth/tech tapes. The median peak-to-peak cycle is approximately 16 months, consistent with A-share sector rotation cycles.","summary_zh":"中国家用电器板块的结构性周期由三大核心驱动力决定：（1）地产竣工周期——新房开工和竣工直接拉动白电需求（新房空调、洗衣机、冰箱），使板块成为中国房地产周期的杠杆工具，滞后约6-12个月；（2）北京定期推出的消费补贴政策（2009-13年节能惠民、2024年启动并于2026年延续的以旧换新），制造短期需求脉冲，使板块暂时脱离上证综指走势；（3）A股成长/科技（板块跑输期）与价值/红利质量（板块跑赢期）的风格轮动。美的、海尔、格力是中国消费板块中股息率最高的大盘股之一，因此板块在价值风格行情中涨幅放大，在成长/科技行情中被弃置。峰峰周期中位数约16个月，与A股行业轮动周期吻合。","top_signals":["Growth/tech tape dominates by 20pp+ with sector still at elevated position -- valuation overshoot warning","Property new starts turn negative YoY for 2+ consecutive quarters (demand pipeline drying up)","Consumer subsidy program announced wind-down or expiry without replacement","Sector trailing only the most-hated names but still at full price -- crowding risk"],"top_signals_zh":["成长/科技风格主导超20个百分点，而板块仍处于较高分位数——超涨预警","全国新房开工量同比连续2个季度以上转负（需求管道枯竭）","消费补贴政策宣布退出或到期且无接续政策","板块仅跑赢最差名称但仍处高价位——筹码拥挤风险"]},"801120":{"analog":"Closest to the February-2023 selloff start (2023-02-20 leg): same deflation/demand-disappointment bear profile where the reopening catalyst is exhausted, channel inventory overhangs, government austerity pressure re-intensifies, and capital rotates into AI/tech themes leaving defensives stranded. The 2023-2024 leg saw -43.7% over 19 months and ended only when the PBOC bazooka arrived in September 2024. The current 2024-2026 leg mirrors that dynamic with the added structural factor of the DeepSeek/AI megatrend preventing the defensive rotation needed to sustain recovery. The extreme divergence - SHCOMP +15.4% while F&B -34.7% - has multiple historical precedents that resolved via sharp mean-reversion: the January-2016 trough (SHCOMP +16% over 2016-2018 while F&B +138%) and the October-2018 trough (+305%) both followed periods of equally extreme relative underperformance, suggesting the setup is historically ripe for a sector reversal once a policy or regulatory catalyst shifts the tape.","analog_zh":"与2023年2月（2023-02-20）启动的下跌周期高度相似：重开催化剂耗尽、渠道库存积压、政府紧缩压力再度加码（2025年5月宴请禁令+DeepSeek资金轮动），市场向AI/科技主题轮动而防御类被搁置的通缩/需求失望型熊市。2023-2024那轮历时19个月跌43.7%，直至2024年9月央行推出一揽子刺激才终止。当前2024-2026年区间复刻了相同动态，叠加DeepSeek/AI巨型主题这一结构性因素阻碍触发防御轮动。大盘+15.4%而食饮-34.7%的极端背离历史上均以均值快速回归收场：2016年1月低点（此后大盘+16%但食饮+138%）和2018年10月低点（+305%）均跟随同样极端的相对低点出现，历史经验表明一旦政策或监管催化剂触发市场风格切换，板块具备快速均值回归的条件。","bottom_signals":["Anti-corruption enforcement reaches peak: official banquet ban explicitly reinforced with published enforcement statistics","Baijiu wholesale prices at multi-year lows with distributor inventory overhang explicitly acknowledged in company earnings calls","Sector ranked #28-31 Shenwan for 3+ consecutive months while SHCOMP is simultaneously positive (extreme divergence)","PBOC LPR/RRR easing cycle begins + fiscal stimulus package explicitly targeting domestic consumption"],"bottom_signals_zh":["反腐执行力度达到峰值：官方宴请禁令附执法统计数据广泛报道","白酒批价跌至多年低点且经销商库存过剩在业绩电话会中明确承认","板块连续3个月以上申万排名28-31而大盘同期为正（与指数极度背离）","央行开启降准降息周期+财政刺激明确指向国内消费"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Anti-corruption campaign cycles (Eight-Point Regulation, banquet bans, enforcement waves)","Premium baijiu pricing power and channel inventory dynamics","China equity style rotation: defensive/value vs growth/cyclical dominance","Global rate cycle: high-PE sector de-rates when US Treasuries surge","PBOC easing cycles (RRR/LPR cuts) unlocking liquidity for quality consumer names","Consumption upgrade (升级) vs consumption downgrade/deflation (降级) macro narrative"],"drivers_zh":["反腐运动周期（八项规定、禁宴禁酒令、执法浪潮）","高端白酒定价权与渠道库存动态","A股风格轮动：防御/价值与成长/周期主导的交替","全球利率周期：美债收益率上行压制高PE板块估值","央行宽松周期（降准/降息）为优质消费龙头释放流动性","消费升级与消费降级/通缩宏观叙事的切换"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"China Food & Beverage (dominated by baijiu at >70% of sector market cap) cycles on two interlocked engines: (1) A POLITICAL/REGULATORY pulse - government anti-corruption campaigns directly suppress the gift and banquet demand that is the lifeblood of premium baijiu pricing; when campaigns intensify the sector re-rates violently downward (2012-2014, 2024-present), and when they fade consumption upgrades re-establish pricing power (2016-2018, 2020-2021); (2) A STYLE/VALUATION pulse - because baijiu leaders (Moutai, Wuliangye) carry consistently high PEs (40-70x), the sector is acutely sensitive to the global rate cycle and A-share style rotation: it leads defensively in risk-off/value-scarce environments (Jan-2012, 2015 crash, Jan-2016) but is the first dumped when global rates surge or growth-thematic capital floods in (Feb-2021, Jun-2021, Dec-2021, Oct-2024 to now). SHCOMP direction is secondary: the sector can rally 34-138% with the index flat (2012, 2016-2018) and fall 26-36% harder than the market when the crowded long unwinds (2018, Feb-2021).","summary_zh":"中国食品饮料板块（白酒市值占比超70%）的周期由两大互锁引擎驱动：（1）政策/监管脉冲——政府反腐运动直接压制高端白酒的礼赠和宴请需求，运动加强则板块估值暴跌（2012-2014年、2024年至今），退潮则消费升级重建定价权（2016-2018年、2020-2021年）；（2）风格/估值脉冲——由于白酒龙头（茅台、五粮液）PE长期维持40-70倍，板块对全球利率周期和A股风格轮动极度敏感：在Risk-Off/价值稀缺环境中扮演防御领跑者（2012年1月、2015年崩盘、2016年1月），但当全球利率上行或成长/主题资金主导时率先遭到抛售（2021年2月、6月、12月、2024年10月至今）。大盘方向是次要驱动，板块可以在大盘持平时累计涨34-138%（2012年、2016-2018年），也可以在共识拥挤多头瓦解时跌幅远超大盘（2018年、2021年2月）。","top_signals":["Anti-corruption enforcement relaxes or baijiu channels restock to excess, with wholesale prices at multi-year highs","Sector ranked #1 Shenwan 3+ consecutive months while growth-over-value gap narrows toward zero","Moutai PE exceeds 55-60x while wholesale channel inventory is simultaneously rising","US 10-yr Treasury yields rising sharply + A-share cyclicals outperforming defensives by 10pp+"],"top_signals_zh":["反腐执法边际放松或白酒渠道过度备货、批价飙涨至多年高点","板块连续3个月以上申万第一且成长/价值差收窄趋近于零","茅台PE超55-60倍且渠道库存同时攀升","美债10年期收益率快速上行+A股周期类跑赢防御超10个百分点"]},"801130":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current post-Feb-2026 trough is the Oct-2018 trough (start date 2018-10-18): both follow an extended bear leg (-55.8% in 2016-2018 vs -57.0% in 2024-2026) driven by a combination of trade-war tariff exposure and SHCOMP-wide deleveraging, both see the sector ranked in the bottom quarter of Shenwan, and both are succeeded by a PBOC easing cycle that had already fired its first major shot (Jan-2019 100bps RRR cut then; Sep-2024 bazooka now). In 2018-2019 the bounce reached +39% over 6 months before stalling; the current setup echoes this with growth-tech leading while Textiles participates weakly — suggesting the initial bounce has already occurred (Sep-2024 to Feb-2026 +57%) and the sector now faces the same stall-and-retest dynamic seen in Apr-2019 as trade-war uncertainty remains unresolved.","analog_zh":"当前2026年2月后的低谷与2018年10月低谷（起始日2018-10-18）最为相似：两段均跟随一轮因贸易战关税冲击叠加上证综指全面去杠杆而导致的大熊市（2016-2018年跌55.8%，2024-2026年跌57.0%），板块均长期处于申万行业排名末四分位，且均处于央行宽松周期已率先发力之后（2019年1月降准100BP，本次为2024年9月大炮组合）。2018-2019年，板块在6个月内反弹39%后高位停滞；当前格局与此呼应——成长科技领涨而纺织服饰跟涨乏力——意味着初段反弹（2024年9月至2026年2月+57%）已告完成，板块正面临与2019年4月相似的高位震荡、二次探底格局，背景同为贸易战不确定性尚未化解。","bottom_signals":["Textiles ranks 26-31 in Shenwan for 3+ consecutive months while SHCOMP stabilises","PBOC announces RRR cut or major swap/relending facility targeted at equities","US-China trade-war truce or tariff-pause announcement","Cotton futures rolling over from multi-year highs with RMB strengthening"],"bottom_signals_zh":["纺织服饰在申万行业中连续3个月以上排名26-31且上证综指企稳","人民银行宣布降准或针对股市的重大互换/再贷款工具","中美贸易休战或关税暂停宣布","棉花期货从多年高点回落叠加人民币走强"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["A-share margin/leverage cycle","US-China trade-war tariff cycle","PBOC RRR / liquidity cycle","domestic cotton price cycle","CNY/USD exchange rate","zero-COVID and domestic retail channel disruption"],"drivers_zh":["A股融资融券杠杆周期","中美贸易战关税周期","央行降准/流动性周期","国内棉价周期","人民币/美元汇率","动态清零与国内零售渠道扰动"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"Textiles & Apparel is structurally one of the most SHCOMP-correlated and policy-sensitive Shenwan sectors: it offers zero defensive qualities (no dividends, thin margins, no state-ownership backstop) and its cycle is dominated by four recurring forces: (1) the A-share margin/leverage cycle (the sector peaked at #1 in the 2015 bubble and ranked last in the unwind), (2) the US-China trade-war tariff cycle (export-revenue exposure means tariff headlines create outsized selloffs), (3) the PBOC liquidity/RRR cycle (rate cuts and RRR reductions reliably trigger broad beta bounces in which Textiles participates mid-table), and (4) the domestic cotton-price cycle (input cost swings directly compress or expand mill margins). Peaks tend to cluster at bubble extremes and post-crisis bounces; troughs follow liquidity crises, trade-war shocks, or COVID-type demand collapses. The median full cycle peak-to-peak is approximately 12 months, but with wild variance from 2 months (the 2015 double-crash) to 29 months (the 2016-2019 trade-war bear).","summary_zh":"纺织服饰是申万行业中与上证综指相关性最高、政策敏感性最强的板块之一：无防御属性（无高股息、利润率薄、无国有背书），其周期由四大核心驱动力主宰：（1）A股融资杠杆周期（2015年泡沫中该板块排名第一，去杠杆时居倒数）；（2）中美贸易战关税周期（出口收入高度依赖使关税标题消息对板块产生超额冲击）；（3）人民银行流动性/降准周期（降息降准可靠地触发大盘贝塔反弹，纺织服饰表现居中游）；（4）国内棉价周期（原料价格波动直接压缩或扩张纺纱/织造利润率）。峰值多集中于泡沫极端阶段或危机后反弹高点，谷值跟随流动性危机、贸易战冲击或新冠式需求崩塌。峰峰间中位数周期约为12个月，但方差极大，从2015年双崩盘的约2个月，到2016-2019年贸易战熊市的约29个月不等。","top_signals":["Textiles reaches #1-#5 in Shenwan ranking across a multi-quarter rally (bubble exhaustion)","Margin loan outstanding YoY greater than 100% and small-cap A-share P/E above 60x","SHCOMP up more than 50% over 12 months with growth-minus-value spread above 40pp (over-extended tape)","Cotton spot near multi-year highs with no producer-price pass-through visible"],"top_signals_zh":["纺织服饰在申万行业多季度排名跻身前五（泡沫耗尽信号）","融资余额同比增速超100%且小盘A股市盈率超60倍","上证综指12个月涨幅超50%且成长价值利差超40个百分点（超买行情）","棉花现货价近多年高点且无法向下游传导成本"]},"801140":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current (2026-02-25) selloff leg is the Nov-2016 peak-to-Oct-2018 trough: same combination of narrow market leadership away from consumer cyclicals (Food & Bev then, now Tech/Telecoms/Electronics), value-over-cyclicals rotation in the broader Shenwan tape, Light Manufacturing ranking in the bottom quartile for multiple consecutive months, and an external trade-friction headwind (financial deleveraging 2016-18 vs US tariffs 2025-26) compressing multiples on export-and-consumer names. The 2016-2018 bear lasted ~23 months and cost the sector -50.8%; the current setup carries similar structural compression but with a trade-truce wildcard (the May 2025 90-day truce) that the 2016-2018 bear lacked as a potential circuit-breaker.","analog_zh":"与当前行情（2026年2月25日起下跌腿）最为接近的历史类比是2016年11月顶部至2018年10月底部行情：相同之处在于市场领涨面极度收窄并远离消费周期（彼时为食品饮料，当前为科技/通信/电子）、申万行业整体向价值/防御轮动、轻工制造连续多月排名后四分之一，以及外部贸易摩擦逆风（2016-18年金融去杠杆 vs 2025-26年美国关税）压制出口型消费板块估值。2016-2018年熊市历时约23个月，板块累计下跌50.8%；当前格局面临相似的结构性压缩，但存在贸易停火变量（2025年5月90天停火协议）作为潜在转折点——这是2016-2018年熊市所不具备的。","bottom_signals":["Sector ranks in bottom 5 of Shenwan for 2+ consecutive months AND SHCOMP is oversold -- washout exhaustion","PBOC announces RRR cut of 50bp+ or benchmark rate reduction -- primary reflation signal","US-China trade ceasefire or tariff reduction announced -- direct export-sensitivity catalyst","Margin finance collapses to multi-year lows -- forced sellers exhausted"],"bottom_signals_zh":["板块连续2个月以上位列申万行业后5名且上证综指超卖——筹码出清信号","央行宣布降准50bp以上或下调基准利率——核心再通胀信号","中美贸易停火或关税削减落地——出口敏感性直接催化剂","融资余额跌至多年低位——强制卖盘出清"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC RRR/LPR easing cycles (primary liquidity driver)","US-China trade-friction cycle (export-tariff sensitivity)","A-share margin/leverage cycle (amplifies both up and down legs)","China consumer confidence and domestic-demand oscillation","Growth-vs-value style rotation in the Shenwan universe","CNY/USD exchange rate (export competitiveness and capital flows)"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准/降息周期（核心流动性驱动）","中美贸易摩擦周期（出口关税敏感性）","A股融资杠杆周期（放大上下两端行情）","中国消费信心与内需周期性波动","申万行业内成长-价值风格轮动","人民币/美元汇率（影响出口竞争力与资本流动）"],"median_cycle_months":14.25,"summary":"Light Manufacturing (Shenwan 801140) cycles as a high-beta, export-and-consumer-discretionary proxy within the A-share universe. Its peaks consistently coincide with peak-liquidity, margin-fuelled growth phases (when small/mid-cap consumer multiples expand fastest), while its troughs align with macro risk-off events: deleveraging, COVID lockdowns, trade-war shocks, or deflation that disproportionately hit export-sensitive and domestic-demand-exposed names. The sector's structural engine is the interplay of PBOC liquidity cycles (RRR/LPR changes) and the US-China trade-friction cycle, layered on China's consumer-confidence oscillation. When all three are positive simultaneously (easing PBOC, trade calm, consumer recovery), the sector can rank in the top decile of Shenwan; when all three are adverse, it ranks in the bottom decile.","summary_zh":"轻工制造（申万801140）在A股市场中是高贝塔出口型兼消费可选代理板块，周期性波动显著。其历次顶部均与流动性峰值、融资杠杆驱动的成长行情叠合（中小盘消费品估值扩张最快阶段），而历次底部则对应宏观风险厌恶事件——去杠杆、新冠封控、贸易战冲击或通缩。板块的结构性驱动引擎是央行流动性周期（降准/降息）与中美贸易摩擦周期的交织叠加，再加上中国消费信心的周期性波动。当三者同时向好（央行宽松、贸易平稳、消费复苏），该板块可跻身申万行业前十分位；三者同时逆向时，则会沦落至末尾十分位。","top_signals":["Margin finance (rong zi yu e) exceeds 2.5-3x its 12-month average -- leverage peak precedes selloff within 1-3 months","Sector ranks in top 5 of Shenwan for 3+ consecutive months -- relative strength exhaustion","SHCOMP has surged 20%+ from its last trough without meaningful correction -- late-cycle beta","US-China trade tensions re-escalate (tariff news, entity-list expansions) -- direct export headwind"],"top_signals_zh":["融资余额超出过去12个月均值2.5-3倍——杠杆峰值，往往在1-3个月内迎来下跌","板块连续3个月以上位列申万行业前5名——相对强势耗尽信号","上证综指自上一低点已大涨20%以上且未经历有效回调——周期末端贝塔特征","中美贸易紧张关系再度升级（关税新闻、实体清单扩容）——直接出口逆风"]},"801150":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the Oct-2024 to Jan-2025 post-stimulus fade leg (start date 2024-10-08): same structure of pharma ranking near-last (30th/31) during a policy-disappointment/defensive-rotation episode, with BIOSECURE and CXO-specific sector risk adding idiosyncratic drag beyond the macro. The current leg (Sep-2025 to present) is that analog scaled up in severity — the SHCOMP is positive (+5.2%) but defensives are being crushed (-16.1%) by extreme AI/semiconductor growth rotation (growth +24.7pp), which is more intense than the Oct-2024 episode. History suggests the turn comes when the growth-style spread compresses from extremes, or a defensive catalyst appears (VBP relief announcement, NHIS expansion round, or PBOC easing shifting A-share style). The Jan-2025 to Sep-2025 rally (+37.8%) that immediately followed the Oct-2024 leg is the template for the mean-reversion trade when conditions rotate.","analog_zh":"与当前结构最相近的历史类比是2024年10月至2025年1月的政策刺激退潮腿（对应2024-10-08起始腿）：相同的结构——医药在防御轮动/政策失望行情中接近垫底（第30/31位），叠加BIOSECURE/CXO特定行业风险形成超额拖累。当前腿（2025年9月至今）是该类比的放大升级版——上证综指正收益（+5.2%）但防御股遭AI/半导体极端轮动碾压（-16.1%，成长+24.7pp），烈度甚至超过2024年10月行情。历史规律显示，当成长-价值利差从极端收窄，或出现防御类催化剂（集采松绑公告、医保扩目录、PBOC宽松推动A股风格切换）时，行情将迎来拐点。紧随2024年10月腿之后的2025年1月至9月反弹（+37.8%）正是均值回归交易的历史模板。","bottom_signals":["new VBP round announced with >50% average price cuts across key therapeutic areas","SHCOMP in broad bear market (>15% drawdown) + growth/tech sectors dominating for >6 months while defensives lag","anti-graft campaign intensification with multi-billion-dollar market cap destruction in 2-week windows","pharma ranked bottom-5 of 31 Shenwan industries with rs_rank below 20 and price below 200-day MA"],"bottom_signals_zh":["新一轮集采公告且主要治疗领域平均降幅超50%","上证综指处于大熊市（跌幅>15%）+成长/科技板块连续主导超6个月且防御落后","医疗反腐整治强化+两周内数十亿美元市值蒸发","医药在申万31个行业中排名垫底5位，相对强度排名低于20，股价低于200日均线"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["VBP/NRDL price-control cycles every 2-4 years","PBOC easing and A-share liquidity cycles","innovation narrative: CXO outsourcing, license-out deals, AI drug discovery","regulatory crackdown cycles: anti-graft, BIOSECURE, platform","global risk appetite and US rate cycle (high rates crush high-PE defensives)","growth-vs-value A-share style rotation"],"drivers_zh":["带量采购/医保目录控价周期（每2-4年）","PBOC宽松与A股流动性周期","创新叙事：CXO外包、对外授权交易、AI辅助药物研发","监管整治周期：反腐、BIOSECURE、平台监管","全球风险偏好/美国利率周期（加息压制高PE防御股）","A股成长vs价值风格轮动"],"median_cycle_months":10.4,"summary":"China Pharma & Biotech (SW 801150) cycles between regulatory-reset troughs and innovation-rerating peaks, driven by three recurring forces: (1) Beijing's VBP/NRDL price-control cycles compress margins and trigger sector selloffs every 2-4 years, periodically offset by NRDL volume gains and drug list inclusion tailwinds; (2) global and domestic liquidity cycles — when PBOC eases and growth/risk-on dominates the A-share tape, pharma outperforms on its innovation premium, while when global rates rise or the A-share tape rotates to value/cyclicals, pharma de-rates sharply as a high-multiple defensive; (3) regulatory crackdown waves (anti-graft campaigns, BIOSECURE-type decoupling pressure, platform regulation) hit the sector asymmetrically and beyond pure beta. Pharma consistently ranks as a laggard in pure cyclical risk-on tapes and a leader in quality-defensive environments. Its peaks coincide with peak-liquidity plus peak-innovation-narrative moments; troughs coincide with policy-shock plus deflationary or growth-dominant tape moments.","summary_zh":"中国医药生物（申万801150）在监管重置底部与创新重估高点之间循环，三大周期性驱动力反复出现：（1）北京的带量采购/医保目录控价周期每2-4年压缩利润率并触发行业抛售，但医保目录放量和纳入品种可周期性对冲；（2）国内外流动性周期——PBOC宽松且A股成长/风险偏好主导时，医药凭借创新溢价跑赢；全球利率上行或A股切换至价值/周期时，医药作为高估值防御股大幅折价；（3）监管整治浪潮（反腐运动、BIOSECURE式脱钩压力、平台监管）对行业产生超越纯贝塔的非对称冲击。医药在纯周期风险偏好行情中始终落后，在质量防御行情中则往往领跑。板块高点往往与流动性高峰+创新叙事顶点吻合；低点则与政策冲击+通缩/成长主导行情时点吻合。","top_signals":["VBP silence (no new round) + PBOC easing + growth-style tape (growth/value spread >15pp for 3+ months)","CXO and license-out deal volume at record high with market pricing in innovation premium","pharma ranking top-5 of 31 Shenwan industries for 2+ consecutive legs","A-share margin leverage at multi-year high + defensives outperforming cyclicals for 6+ months"],"top_signals_zh":["集采静默期（无新轮公告）+PBOC宽松+成长风格行情（成长/价值利差>15pp持续3个月以上）","CXO/授权交易量创历史新高且市场已普遍对创新溢价定价","医药在申万31个行业中连续2轮以上排名前5","A股融资融券余额创多年新高+防御股持续6个月以上跑赢周期股"]},"801160":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2018 trough setup: the current 2024-02-05 trough emerged after an 18-month bear market driven by risk-off macro forces (property crisis plus foreign outflows) rather than sector-specific failure, exactly mirroring the Oct-2018 bottom which followed the trade-war/deleveraging bear. In both cases the sector lagged sharply in the subsequent relief rally as growth themes (tech/AI in 2024-26, agriculture/telecom in 2018-19) captured the risk-appetite rebound while Utilities delivered a pedestrian mid-table result — confirming the durable pattern that Utilities cannot outperform during pure risk-on recovery legs regardless of the macro rescue catalyst.","analog_zh":"与2018年10月低谷最为相似：当前的2024年2月低点同样出现在由宏观风险规避因素（地产危机加外资撤离）而非行业自身问题所驱动的18个月熊市之后，与2018年10月贸易战/去杠杆熊市后的筑底逻辑如出一辙。两种情形下，公用事业在随后的修复行情中均大幅跑输——2024-26年的AI/科技主题与2018-19年的农业/通信主题先后主导风险偏好反弹，而公用事业仅交出平庸的中游表现——印证了一个持久规律：在纯粹的风险偏好修复腿中，无论救市催化剂如何，公用事业均无法实现超额收益。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP hitting multi-year lows with defensives outperforming cyclicals by 10+pp","sector dividend yield well above the 10-year CGB yield","Beijing announcing RRR cuts or new green infrastructure spending plans","coal/fuel prices falling sharply (relieves generator margin squeeze)","national team ETF intervention signals (Central Huijin public announcements)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指触及多年低位且防御类跑赢周期类10个百分点以上","板块股息率显著高于10年期国债收益率","北京宣布降准或新增绿色基础设施投资","煤炭/燃料价格大幅下跌（缓解发电企业利润压缩）","国家队ETF干预信号（中央汇金公开宣布增持）"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["PBOC easing cycle (rate/RRR cuts)","regulated utility dividend yield vs bond yield spread","green energy policy mandates (dual carbon/Five-Year Plans)","SHCOMP broad beta (risk-on/risk-off)","coal/fuel cost vs regulated tariff squeeze"],"drivers_zh":["央行宽松周期（降息降准）","受监管公用事业股息率与国债收益率利差","绿色能源政策（双碳目标/五年规划）","上证综指全面贝塔（风险偏好涨跌）","燃料成本与受管制电价的剪刀差"],"median_cycle_months":16.6,"summary":"China Utilities cycles as a defensive-beta lever on the SHCOMP, not as a standalone catalyst sector. Its rallies are anchored by three recurring forces: (1) PBOC easing cycles that lower the discount rate and make regulated dividend yields attractive relative to bonds; (2) state-driven green-infrastructure mandates (dual carbon, Five-Year Plans) that raise capex and earnings visibility for power SOEs; and (3) broad SHCOMP risk-on waves where Utilities participates at below-market beta. Conversely, selloffs are driven by SHCOMP-wide risk-off events (leverage unwinds, trade shocks, property crises) that overwhelm the sector's defensive premium, compounded by sector-specific squeezes (coal-price vs regulated-tariff margin compression in 2021, deleveraging funding cost pressure in 2017-18). The sector consistently ranks mid-table in up-legs and upper-mid in down-legs, confirming its low-beta defensive character across the full 14-year record.","summary_zh":"公用事业的周期本质是上证综指的防御贝塔杠杆，而非具备独立催化剂的进攻性板块。其上行腿受三大周期性驱动力锚定：（1）央行宽松周期压低贴现率，使受监管的股息收益率相对债券更具吸引力；（2）国家主导的绿色基础设施政策（双碳目标、五年规划）提升电力国企的资本开支与盈利能见度；（3）上证综指全面风险偏好上行时，公用事业以低于市场的贝塔系数参与上涨。反之，下跌腿由全市场风险规避事件（去杠杆踩踏、贸易冲击、地产危机）主导，压倒该板块的防御溢价，并叠加行业特有的挤压（2021年煤价与受管制电价的剪刀差、2017-18年去杠杆推高融资成本）。在全部14年的记录中，公用事业在上行腿中持续排名中游、在下行腿中排名中上，印证了其低贝塔防御性格。","top_signals":["SHCOMP parabolic advance with extreme margin leverage (2015 pattern)","sector rank falling into bottom tercile of an up-leg (rank 23-24 of 28 signals no remaining upside premium)","policy catalyst exhaustion after Five-Year Plan targets are priced in","bond yields rising, narrowing the dividend-yield appeal of regulated utilities"],"top_signals_zh":["上证综指抛物线上涨叠加极端融资杠杆（2015年模式）","板块在上行腿中排名跌入后三分之一（排名23-24/28，显示无剩余溢价）","五年规划目标被充分定价后政策催化剂耗尽","国债收益率上行，压缩受监管公用事业股息率的相对吸引力"]},"801170":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct-2018 trough leg (start 2018-10-18): same setup of post-selloff PBOC easing igniting a cyclical-beta rebound where Transportation participates but does not lead — in 2018-2019, PBOC RRR cuts and G20 trade truce drove SHCOMP +30.6% but Transport ranked 15th of 28 (+40.4%), trailing growth leaders by wide margins. Today's Bottoming phase (pos=0.1, rs_rank=20) mirrors that setup: policy-driven floor (national-team buying in 2024, 924 stimulus package) has arrested the decline but the tape remains growth/AI-led, leaving Transport as a mid-pack cyclical awaiting the rotation when AI premium compresses and freight-demand recovery themes re-emerge.","analog_zh":"与2018年10月底部腿（2018-10-18起始）最为相似：同样是央行降准宽松在大跌后点燃周期贝塔反弹，交通运输参与但并不领涨——2018-2019年，央行降准与G20贸易休战推动上证综指上涨30.6%，但交通运输仅排名第15（涨40.4%），大幅落后成长领头羊。当前底部阶段（pos=0.1，相对强度排名第20）与彼时如出一辙：政策托底（2024年国家队买入、924一揽子政策）已阻止继续下跌，但市场主线仍由成长/AI主导，交通运输维持中游周期地位，等待AI溢价收窄、货运需求复苏主题重新浮现后的板块轮动机会。","bottom_signals":["Transport ranks 25th-27th of 28+ Shenwan industries in a broad market selloff","Aviation revenue collapse coincides with mobility restrictions or trade-driven freight recession","SHIBOR or credit spreads spike and interbank liquidity tightens sharply","Transport below 200-day moving average with historical position below 0.15 and relative strength rank below 8th"],"bottom_signals_zh":["交通运输在申万行业大面积下跌中排名末尾（第25-27位）","航空收入崩塌叠加出行管制或贸易驱动的货运衰退","SHIBOR或信用利差骤升，银行间流动性急剧收紧","交通运输跌破200日均线，历史分位pos<0.15且相对强度排名低于第8位"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["A-share margin/leverage cycle","Beijing infrastructure capex cycle and freight demand policy","PBOC monetary easing and credit availability","US-China trade war impact on freight volumes","COVID and mobility shocks to aviation and logistics","SOE re-rating events (rail reform, national-team buying)"],"drivers_zh":["A股融资融券杠杆周期","北京基础设施资本开支与货运需求政策","央行货币宽松与信贷可得性","中美贸易战对货运量的冲击","新冠/出行管控对航空及物流的冲击","国有运输资产重估事件（铁路改制、国家队托底）"],"median_cycle_months":23.7,"summary":"China's Shenwan Transportation index cycles are structurally driven by two interlocking engines: the A-share leverage-and-liquidity cycle (retail margin expansion and contraction), and Beijing's infrastructure/freight-demand policy cycle. Transport is a high-beta cyclical that amplifies SHCOMP moves in both directions — it ranked number one in the 2013-2015 mega-bull (+321%) but ranked 26th-27th in major selloffs. At peaks, the sector is typically priced for peak freight volumes and infrastructure capex; at troughs, it is punished by credit crunch (SHIBOR 2013), leverage unwind (2015), trade war (2018-2019), or COVID demand collapse (2020). A secondary cycle driver is Beijing's periodic re-rating of SOE transport assets (railway restructuring 2013, national-team buying 2024) that can catalyze discrete re-ratings independent of the broad index. Because of its SOE-heavy composition and regulatory sensitivity, Transport tends to underperform in growth/theme-driven tapes and outperform only in broad cyclical re-ratings.","summary_zh":"申万交通运输指数的周期性受两大结构性引擎共同驱动：A股杠杆-流动性周期（散户融资余额的扩张与收缩），以及北京的基础设施/货运需求政策周期。交通运输是典型的高弹性周期板块，双向放大上证综指波动——在2013-2015年大牛市中以+321%高居申万行业榜首，在重大下跌周期中则跌入排名第26-27位。板块见顶时通常已充分定价货运量高峰与基建资本开支峰值；见底时则因信贷危机（2013年SHIBOR冲击）、杠杆清算（2015年）、贸易战（2018-2019年）或新冠需求崩塌（2020年）遭受多重打压。第二层周期驱动力是北京定期对国有运输资产进行重估（2013年铁路改制、2024年国家队托底），可触发独立于大盘的离散性估值重评。由于板块以国有企业为主且监管敏感度高，交通运输在成长/主题驱动行情中普遍落后，仅在宏观周期板块整体重估时才能实现超额收益。","top_signals":["Transport sector reaches top-3 Shenwan rank in a leverage-fueled SHCOMP surge","Rail capex and NDRC project approvals hit cyclical highs and are widely priced in","Margin balances near multi-year highs with broad cyclicals outperforming defensives by over 20pp","SOE restructuring announcements fully digested and sector P/E at multi-year premium to historical average"],"top_signals_zh":["交通运输在杠杆驱动的上证综指飙升中跃升申万行业前三","铁路资本开支/国家发改委项目批复达到周期高位且已被市场充分定价","融资余额接近多年高位，周期板块较防御板块超额收益超过20pp","国有企业改制公告被市场完全消化，板块市盈率升至历史均值显著溢价"]},"801180":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current mid-2026 trough setup is the November 2022 to June 2023 leg: Real Estate ranked dead last for 7 consecutive months while the broader market rotated aggressively into the initial AI theme (Media +44.9%, Telecoms +42.0%, Computers +27.0%) and SHCOMP was essentially flat. Both periods share identical structural features — a narrow growth-theme tape where developer solvency fears override all policy-hope signals, leaving RE as an isolated laggard. The key difference is that the June 2023 leg ended with a genuine Politburo policy pivot (dropping 'housing for living'); the current setup similarly awaits a decisive, credible catalyst — whether an LPR cut, a Politburo signal, or visible inventory clearance — to break the bottoming impasse.","analog_zh":"当前（2026年中筑底、AI成长主导、房地产落后）最接近的历史镜像为2022年11月至2023年6月区间：房地产连续7个月排名垫底，而市场激进切入初期AI主题（传媒+44.9%、通信+42.0%、计算机+27.0%），上证综指基本持平。两个时期共享完全相同的结构特征——窄基成长主题行情中，开发商偿债危机恐惧压制一切政策预期信号，使房地产成为孤立的落后板块。关键差异在于2023年6月区间以政治局会议真实政策转向（删去\"房住不炒\"定调）告终；当前局面同样等待决定性、可信的催化剂——无论是LPR下调、政治局信号还是可见的库存去化——以打破筑底僵局。","bottom_signals":["PBOC announces LPR cut or RRR cut explicitly citing 'reasonable financing needs of property developers'","State Council or Politburo directive explicitly drops 'housing for living' language — policy pivot confirmed","Real Estate ranks dead last (#28-31) for 3+ consecutive months while SHCOMP is flat or positive — extreme underperformance exhaustion","Developer bond spreads compress 100bp+ from cycle widest on policy backstop signal"],"bottom_signals_zh":["央行明确提及\"开发商合理融资需求\"的LPR或降准措施","国务院或政治局会议明确删去\"房住不炒\"定调——政策转向确认","房地产连续3个月以上排名垫底（第28-31位）而上证综指持平或上涨——极端落后耗尽","开发商债券利差较周期最高点收窄100bp以上，源于政策背书信号"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["PBOC RRR and benchmark/LPR rate cuts — primary easing catalyst","Property purchase restriction cycles (tightening/relaxation)","Developer credit access (Three Red Lines, shadow banking, loan-to-value rules)","Margin lending cycles amplifying A-share beta (2014-15 cycle)","Trade war / external demand shocks dampening growth expectations","Inventory overhang and developer solvency (post-2020 structural drag)"],"drivers_zh":["央行降准及基准/LPR降息——主要宽松催化剂","房产限购政策周期（收紧/放松）","开发商信贷渠道（三条红线、影子银行、贷值比规定）","两融杠杆周期放大A股贝塔（2014-15年牛市周期）","贸易战/外部需求冲击压制增长预期","库存积压与开发商偿债能力（2020年后的结构性拖累）"],"median_cycle_months":9,"summary":"China Real Estate (801180) is structurally the most policy-sensitive and leverage-amplified sector in China's A-share universe. Its cycles are driven by a repeating sequence: PBOC credit easing (rate/RRR cuts) expands developer financing access and compresses mortgage rates, triggering sector outperformance; PBOC or regulatory tightening (purchase restrictions, leverage caps, shadow banking crackdown) contracts that access, triggering severe underperformance that regularly exceeds 30-45%. The sector consistently leads in easing rallies (ranking #1 in five of the eight major up-legs with confirmed policy catalysts) and lags catastrophically in tightening selloffs (ranking #27-31 in six of the eight major down-legs). Since August 2020, the structural deleveraging regime (Three Red Lines, developer defaults, inventory overhang) has added a persistent negative layer, meaning each policy relief bounce is shorter-lived and smaller than the prior cycle.","summary_zh":"中国A股房地产板块（801180）是申万行业中政策敏感度最高、杠杆放大效应最强的板块。其周期遵循规律性序列：央行信用宽松（降息/降准）扩大开发商融资渠道、压低按揭成本，触发板块跑赢；而政策/监管收紧（限购、杠杆上限、影子银行整治）则收缩融资，触发惨烈的跑输，跌幅屡次超30%-45%。在历史上有明确政策催化剂的主要上涨腿中，房地产五次排名第一；而在主要下跌腿中，六次排名第27-31位。2020年8月以来，\"三条红线\"、开发商密集违约及库存积压叠加，引入了持续性负面底色，导致每次政策救市反弹的持续时间更短、幅度更弱。","top_signals":["Real Estate ranks #1-3 for 2+ consecutive weeks while SHCOMP is flat or declining — exhaustion of policy-hope re-rating","SHCOMP approaches prior cycle high while RE diverges lower (non-confirmation = sector peak)","Property sales volume turns negative MoM despite active policy support — policy inefficacy confirmed","Margin debt or broad speculative leverage spikes (2015 analog) alongside RE leadership"],"top_signals_zh":["房地产连续2周以上排名前三而上证综指持平甚至下跌——政策预期重估耗尽","上证综指接近前期高点而房地产持续背离下行（不确认=板块顶部）","尽管有政策支撑，楼市成交量环比转负——政策失效信号","两融杠杆或投机杠杆宽基飙升叠加房地产领涨（类比2015年）"]},"801200":{"analog":"Closest to the Dec-2022 peak leg (Dec-2022 to Feb-2024): same structure of a stimulus-triggered blow-off top (zero-COVID exit then, PBOC bazooka now) followed immediately by a structural selloff where the sector ranks last despite a broadly resilient SHCOMP, with AI/tech rotation now replacing the green-energy rotation as the winning theme that absorbs capital at retail's expense. In both cases the catalyst that drove the prior leg proved insufficient to sustain consumption fundamentals, and the sector's idiosyncratic concentration in consumer platform names with property-wealth-effect exposure created a far deeper drawdown than the index implied.","analog_zh":"与2022年12月高点腿（2022年12月至2024年2月）最为相似：同为政策催化吹顶（2022年退出清零 vs 2024年人行大招）后立即进入结构性回调，板块在上证综指相对抗跌的背景下持续垫底，AI/科技轮动现在取代绿色能源轮动成为吸走商贸资金的主角。两段腿中，上一轮驱动因素均未能持续支撑消费基本面，而板块对消费互联网平台股的集中持仓叠加地产财富效应暴口，导致跌幅远深于指数所示。","bottom_signals":["sector ranks #28-31 of 31 for 3+ consecutive months with SHCOMP near flat (idiosyncratic trough)","defensive sectors lead while retail is worst laggard in a flight-to-safety rotation","Beijing announces targeted consumption stimulus (vouchers, LPR cuts, trade-in programs) after a 30%+ drawdown"],"bottom_signals_zh":["板块连续3个月以上居申万后3位且上证综指近平盘（内生筑底信号）","防御类领涨而商贸垫底的避险轮动（超卖信号）","商贸累跌30%以上后北京推出定向消费刺激（消费券、LPR下调、以旧换新）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC easing/RRR cuts unlock retail-investor margin flows","domestic consumption policy stimulus (LPR cuts, subsidies, trade-in programs)","property wealth effect on household confidence","platform regulatory risk (antitrust, data, fintech crackdowns)","US-China trade war tariff impact on consumer sentiment","ecommerce structural theme (O2O, Singles Day, COVID pivot, AI displacement)"],"drivers_zh":["人行降准/降息打开散户融资通道","国内消费政策刺激（LPR下调、消费补贴、以旧换新）","地产财富效应影响居民消费信心","互联网平台监管风险（反垄断、数据安全、金融科技整治）","中美贸易战关税冲击消费情绪","电商结构性主题（O2O、双十一、疫情转线上、AI替代）"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"Retail & Commerce cycles as a high-beta amplifier of China's domestic consumption/credit cycle, with three recurring structural features: (1) it surges explosively when Beijing pivots to consumption stimulus or liquidity easing unlocks retail-investor margin flows into discretionary/ecommerce names; (2) it crashes hardest and longest in risk-off rotations because its index composition is dominated by small-cap discretionary and ecommerce names that carry the highest leverage sensitivity and lowest defensive qualities; (3) it suffers from an additional idiosyncratic layer vs the SHCOMP: regulatory risk (antitrust crackdowns on platforms), anti-corruption campaigns suppressing gifting/luxury sub-segments, and the property-wealth-effect channel that directly links household consumer confidence to real estate. The sector consistently ranks among the weakest during value/defensive regimes and among the strongest during liquidity-driven growth-tilt rallies or reopening re-ratings.","summary_zh":"商贸零售板块是中国国内消费/信用周期的高贝塔放大器，具有三大循环结构性特征：（1）当北京政策转向消费刺激或流动性宽松打开散户融资融券通道时，板块呈现爆发性领涨；（2）避险轮动中跌幅最深、周期最长，因指数成分以小盘可选消费及电商股为主，杠杆敏感性最高、防御属性最弱；（3）相较上证综指存在叠加性内生风险：平台反垄断整治、反腐压制礼品/奢侈品子板块、地产财富效应直接传导居民消费信心。板块在价值/防御主导环境中持续居于弱势，而在流动性驱动的成长行情或重开预期重估中常居领先。","top_signals":["sector ranks #1-5 in Shenwan universe for 2+ consecutive months after a liquidity-pivot rally","SHCOMP growth-beat-value exceeds 15pp while retail leads with over 40% gain (over-extension signal)","A-share margin debt approaches prior peak levels alongside retail sector re-rating"],"top_signals_zh":["申万排名连续2个月以上居前5后的流动性刺激行情顶部信号","成长跑赢价值超15pp且商贸涨超40%（过度拉伸信号）","A股融资余额接近前期高位同时商贸板块重估"]},"801210":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2022 trough leg (Oct 2022 to Mar 2023): same post-stimulus-fade setup where an initial sharp rally (post-Sep-24-2024 bazooka vs post-zero-COVID exit) gave way to a structural demand-disappointment selloff when the consumption supercycle failed to materialise, leaving Services near the bottom of Shenwan. One caveat: today's trough is style-led (AI/growth leadership with cyclicals beating defensives), whereas the classic Services bottom is a defensive-flight, deflation-fear capitulation -- so the present setup is a rotation-out trough more than a max-fear one. The Oct-2022 analog resolved with a +33% rally once the reopening catalyst became undeniable (Dec 7 zero-COVID exit); today's equivalent trigger would be a credible consumer-demand reflation policy (broad fiscal transfer, property stabilisation) or a broadening of the AI tape, rather than another monetary easing already tested.","analog_zh":"最接近2022年10月底部腿（2022年10月至2023年3月）：同为刺激消退后的格局——首轮强劲反弹（2024年9.24宽松类比2022年底清零退出）过后，消费超级周期未能兑现，随即进入结构性需求失望的回调，社会服务申万排名接近垫底。一点须注意：当前底部由风格主导（AI/成长领涨、周期跑赢防御），而典型的社会服务底部是防御避险、通缩恐慌的投降式见底——故当前更像轮动离场型底部而非极度恐慌型底部。2022年10月底部最终以+33%反弹告终，触发条件是不可置疑的重开催化（12月7日清零退出）；当前等效触发应为可信的消费再通胀政策（大规模财政转移、房地产企稳）或AI行情扩散，而非已被验证效果有限的货币宽松。","bottom_signals":["Services ranked #28-31 (dead last or near-last) in Shenwan -- extreme relative underperformance historically precedes sharp reversals","COVID/lockdown forced-closure or regulatory crackdown fully in market price (Double Reduction aftermath; zero-COVID bottom Oct 2022)","SHCOMP at -20%-plus drawdown from prior peak with defensives leading by >8pp -- max-fear/capitulation environment","National-team intervention (Central Huijin ETF buying) combined with a PBOC RRR/rate cut"],"bottom_signals_zh":["社会服务在申万排名倒数第一至第四（28-31名）——历史上极端相对弱势往往预示强力反弹","COVID/封控停业或监管整治风险被市场充分定价（双减冲击后期、清零政策底部2022年10月）","上证综指较前期高点回撤逾20%且防御股领先优势>8pp——极度恐慌/投降环境","国家队入场（汇金大举买入ETF）叠加央行降准降息"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["China domestic demand cycle (consumption / holiday pre-loading)","PBOC rate/RRR easing cycles driving liquidity-fuelled growth re-rating","COVID lockdown/reopening binary (unique 2020-22 structural driver)","Beijing regulatory policy shock (Common Prosperity, education crackdown)","A-share style rotation: growth vs value, driven by institutional/foreign flows"],"drivers_zh":["国内消费需求周期（消费复苏/节假日提前布局）","央行降息降准周期驱动流动性成长重估","新冠封控/解封二元结构（2020-22年独特驱动）","北京监管政策冲击（共同富裕、教培整治）","A股成长/价值风格轮动（机构/外资流向驱动）"],"median_cycle_months":8.9,"summary":"Consumer Services cycles around a core tension between China's domestic consumer-demand cycle and the A-share market's dominant style rotations. Its peaks cluster when pandemic/holiday reopening momentum is fully priced or when growth-style rallies top out (the sector benefits from growth tapes but is rarely the lead dog); its troughs mark maximum regulatory/policy shock, pandemic demand destruction, or structural deflation fear. The sector is uniquely exposed to Beijing policy risk -- the Common Prosperity / education crackdown (2021-22) was more damaging than any macro cycle -- and to the literal lockdown/reopening cycle of COVID-era China. On the upside it is a high-beta beneficiary of domestic-demand reflation and holiday pre-loading, generating the most dramatic single-leg rallies (+318% 2012-15, +130% Q2 2020, +68.5% Q4 2020) when the demand catalyst is clear and uncontested.","summary_zh":"社会服务板块的周期核心矛盾在于：中国国内消费需求周期与A股市场主导风格轮动的持续博弈。板块顶部往往出现在疫后/假日复工溢价被充分定价、或成长风格行情见顶时（板块受益于成长行情但鲜为领涨主力）；底部则标志着监管/政策冲击、疫情需求毁灭或结构性通缩恐慌的极值。板块对北京政策风险高度敏感——'共同富裕'与教培整治（2021-22年）造成的损害超过任何宏观周期——同时与COVID时代实际意义上的封控/解封周期直接挂钩。在上行方向，板块是国内需求再通胀与节假日布局交易的高Beta受益方，在需求催化清晰且无争议时能产生历史最大单腿涨幅（2012-15年+318%、2020年Q2 +130%、2020年Q4 +68.5%）。","top_signals":["Holiday/reopening pre-loading fully priced: complete pricing of Spring Festival, Golden Week, or COVID reopening demand typically marks the precise peak","Services ranked #1 in Shenwan for two consecutive legs -- relative-leadership exhaustion","PBOC easing cycle fully in force with growth-minus-value spread >15pp -- liquidity peak coincides with sector peak","SHCOMP well above prior trough with margin balances elevated -- broad-bubble exhaustion"],"top_signals_zh":["节假日/复工行情充分定价：春节、黄金周或疫后复工需求被完全消化，往往精确标志板块顶部","社会服务连续两轮位列申万第一——相对领涨耗尽信号","央行宽松周期全力发力且成长/价值溢价>15pp——流动性峰值与板块顶部同步","上证综指较前期底部大幅上涨且融资余额高企——泡沫耗尽"]},"801230":{"analog":"Closest to the July-2024 trough (post-March 2024 selloff, rank 30/31): same pattern of Conglomerates as worst Shenwan performer on deflation/risk-off, followed by an explosive #1-ranked recovery driven by a surprise PBOC liquidity bazooka (Sep-2024). The current Jun-2026 trough rhymes with that setup -- sector is again dead last after the May-Jun selloff, still above its 200-day MA, and the tape is beginning to show growth leadership (Electronics/Telecoms leading). If a macro catalyst comparable to Sep-2024 emerges, the sector's historical pattern suggests a 30-70% snap-back is plausible within 3-6 months.","analog_zh":"与2024年7月低谷最为相似（2024年3月下跌后，排名30/31）：综合板块同为申万最差板块（通缩/风险规避背景），随后受央行意外'大招'（2024年9月）驱动，以排名第一的姿态实现爆发性反弹。当前2026年6月低谷与该形态高度吻合——板块再度在5至6月抛售后垫底，仍处于200日均线上方，且市场开始呈现成长领涨（电子/通信主导）。若出现可比2024年9月的宏观催化剂，历史规律显示3至6个月内30-70%的急速反弹具有充分可能性。","bottom_signals":["Conglomerates rank dead last (#28-31) in Shenwan for the selloff leg -- over-punishment signals trough proximity","SHCOMP reaches deep valuation support (P/B near 1x for broad index, PE below 12x) coinciding with defensive leadership","Policy pivot confirmed: PBOC RRR cut or extraordinary Politburo meeting pledging market stabilisation","Forced deleveraging exhaustion: margin balance falls 30-40% from peak, open interest in leveraged products normalises"],"bottom_signals_zh":["综合板块在下行腿中持续垫底（排名倒一）——过度惩罚信号暗示接近低谷","沪综指触及深度估值支撑（宽基市净率接近1倍，市盈率低于12倍），同时防御板块领跑","政策转向确认：央行降准或政治局召开特别会议承诺稳定市场","强制去杠杆耗尽：融资余额从高峰下降30-40%，杠杆产品持仓趋于正常化"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["A-share margin/leverage cycle expansion and contraction","PBOC monetary regime shifts (RRR cuts, rate cuts, deleveraging campaigns)","SHCOMP sentiment beta amplification","Regulatory crackdowns on conglomerate/cross-holding structures","Global risk-on/risk-off via trade war and commodity cycles"],"drivers_zh":["A股融资融券杠杆周期扩张与收缩","人民银行货币政策转向（降准、降息、去杠杆）","沪综指情绪贝塔放大效应","对综合类/交叉持股结构的监管整治","贸易战与大宗商品周期带来的全球风险偏好波动"],"median_cycle_months":14.7,"summary":"Conglomerates (Shenwan 801230) are structurally the highest-beta sector in A-shares, amplifying every major SHCOMP move by 1.5-3x. The sector has no coherent fundamental earnings driver -- it is a catch-all for diversified holding companies, conglomerates with cross-sector exposures, and theme-concept shells. This makes it hypersensitive to two recurring macro forces: (1) A-share margin/leverage cycles, where expanding retail leverage floods the most liquid speculative vehicles (often conglomerate-wrapped) and then triggers violent forced selling on the way down; and (2) PBOC liquidity regime shifts, where RRR cuts or rate easing catalyse immediate rallies while deleveraging campaigns deliver outsized collapses. The sector predictably leads at both extremes -- ranking #1 in the sharpest up-legs (Oct-2018, Apr-2022, Jul-2024, Apr-2025) and dead last in the most severe risk-off legs (Nov-2016, Dec-2015, May-2026).","summary_zh":"申万综合板块（801230）是A股结构性贝塔最高的行业，对沪综指每次大幅波动的放大倍数达1.5至3倍。该板块缺乏连贯的基本面盈利驱动逻辑，是多元化控股公司、跨行业综合体及主题概念壳体的集合，因此对两大周期性宏观力量极为敏感：（1）A股融资融券杠杆周期——散户杠杆扩张时大量资金涌入流动性最高的投机载体（往往以综合类包装），去杠杆时则引发剧烈的强制平仓；（2）人民银行流动性政策转换——降准或降息立即催生涨势，而去杠杆行动则带来超比例崩塌。该板块可预期地在两个极端表现突出——在最剧烈的上行腿中排名第一（2018年10月、2022年4月、2024年7月、2025年4月），在最严峻的风险规避腿中则稳居末位（2016年11月、2015年12月、2026年5月）。","top_signals":["Conglomerates rank #1-3 in Shenwan for 2+ consecutive months -- historically the final euphoria phase before sharp reversal","SHCOMP margin balance at cycle highs with retail participation surging (peak leverage equals peak for this sector)","Growth-minus-value premium exceeds 20pp (overheated liquidity/theme tape favouring speculative vehicles)","Post-stimulus policy window closes: NDRC/MoF detail disappoints after initial bazooka announcement"],"top_signals_zh":["综合板块在申万排名连续2个月以上位列前三——历史上为大幅反转前的最终亢奋阶段","沪综指融资余额处于周期高位、散户参与度激增（杠杆峰值=板块峰值）","成长超越价值溢价超过20个百分点（流动性/主题过热，投机载体受益）","刺激政策窗口关闭：发改委/财政部细节在初期'大招'公告后令市场失望"]},"801710":{"analog":"Closest analog is the Jan-2016 to Apr-2017 supply-side reform launch leg (starting 2016-01-28): a major Beijing policy pivot (supply-side reform in 2016 mirroring the PBOC bazooka in September 2024) ignited a catch-up beta rally where Building Materials rapidly climbed from deep underperformance to a top-3 Shenwan ranking. Both entries share the 'policy pivot from stress' template — distressed sector at cycle trough, major policy announcement, rapid re-rating. The key difference is that in 2016-2017 cement prices and profits genuinely recovered (structural fix to overcapacity), whereas in the current 2024-2026 leg cement volumes remain structurally impaired, making the current rally more fragile and more dependent on beta and optionality rather than fundamental earnings recovery.","analog_zh":"与2016年1月28日启动的供给侧改革主升浪最为相似：重大政策转向（2016年供给侧改革类比2024年9月人民银行一揽子刺激）触发补涨Beta行情，建材板块迅速从深度跑输攀升至申万前三。两者均属于从困境出发的政策转向进场模板，即板块处于周期低谷、重大政策宣布、快速重估。关键差异在于：2016至2017年水泥价格与盈利确实实质性改善，去产能从根本上修复了供需；而2024至2026年当前周期水泥实物需求仍受结构性损伤，使本轮反弹比历史类比更为脆弱，更依赖Beta与期权价值而非基本面盈利复苏。","bottom_signals":["Building Materials ranked #25-31 Shenwan for 2+ consecutive legs (maximum pessimism)","Cement utilisation rates at or below 50% with large-scale operator losses accelerating","Property policy pivot announced (LPR cuts, developer rescue package, mortgage relaxation)","SHCOMP at multi-year low with national team or PBOC deploying large-scale stabilization measures"],"bottom_signals_zh":["建材连续2个以上周期排名申万25至31位（悲观情绪极致化）","水泥产能利用率降至50%及以下且大型企业亏损加速","地产政策转向信号出现（LPR下调、开发商救助方案、按揭松绑）","上证综指处于多年低位，国家队或人民银行启动大规模稳定措施"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing property and infrastructure policy cycle (stimulus vs. curbs)","cement/glass supply-side capacity cuts vs. overcapacity","SHCOMP leverage/liquidity cycle (margin bull vs. credit crunch)","trade-war and external macro shock sensitivity","property developer solvency cycle (Three Red Lines, Evergrande, rescue packages)"],"drivers_zh":["北京地产与基建政策周期（刺激vs调控）","水泥/玻璃供给侧去产能vs产能过剩","上证综指杠杆/流动性周期（融资牛市vs信用收紧）","贸易战/外部宏观冲击敏感性","房地产开发商偿债周期（三条红线、恒大、救助方案）"],"median_cycle_months":8.25,"summary":"Building Materials (Shenwan 801710) is structurally a high-beta property-and-infrastructure cyclical that amplifies SHCOMP moves by roughly 1.5 to 2x on the downside during risk-off legs. Its recurring causal engine is a three-force interaction: (1) Beijing's property and infrastructure policy cycle (stimulus drives cement/glass demand booms; deleveraging and curbs cause demand busts); (2) cement supply-side capacity discipline (when capacity is cut, prices rise sharply and the sector generates exceptional alpha as in 2016-2017; when overcapacity persists, price deflation destroys margins as in 2022-2024); and (3) the SHCOMP liquidity and style cycle (leverage-driven bulls inflate the sector via beta; credit-tightening or trade-shock bears destroy it via beta plus fundamental demand headwinds). The sector consistently leads Shenwan peers during property-policy-easing legs and consistently lags during property-demand-collapse legs, making it a high-conviction policy-cycle barometer.","summary_zh":"建筑材料申万801710在结构上是高Beta的地产与基础设施周期板块，风险规避下行期对上证综指跌幅的放大系数约为1.5至2倍。其周期的核心驱动机制由三股力量交互构成：第一，北京的地产与基建政策周期，刺激推动水泥玻璃需求繁荣，去杠杆与调控导致需求崩塌；第二，水泥供给侧产能纪律，去产能阶段价格大幅上涨、板块产生超额Alpha如2016至2017年，产能过剩持续时价格通缩吞噬利润如2022至2024年；第三，上证综指流动性与风格周期，杠杆牛市通过Beta推升板块，信用收紧或贸易冲击熊市通过Beta叠加需求基本面双重打压板块。板块在地产政策松绑周期中持续领跑申万同业，在地产需求崩塌周期中持续垫底，使其成为高确定性的政策周期温度计。","top_signals":["Building Materials ranked #1-3 Shenwan for 2+ consecutive legs (over-owned setup signaling reversal risk)","Cement prices at multi-year highs with supply-side reform narrative fully priced in","Property FAI growth turning negative or developers beginning to report cash-flow stress","SHCOMP cycle position above 80% with cyclicals outperforming defensives by 40pp+ over the leg"],"top_signals_zh":["建材连续2个以上周期排名申万前三（筹码集中，反转风险信号）","水泥价格创多年新高且供给侧改革叙事已充分定价","地产固定资产投资增速转负或开发商开始出现现金流压力","上证综指周期位置超80%且周期股跑赢防御股超40个百分点"]},"801720":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup (late-June 2026 trough) is the October-2022 bottom: both followed a major policy-shock-driven selloff in which Construction ranked in the bottom quintile for two consecutive legs (2023-05 selloff rank #26 and 2024-11 selloff rank #28 vs 2022-02 rank #21 and pre-Oct-2022 rank #26), and both immediately preceded a policy-rescue catalyst (Nov-2022 16-point property measures vs. a potential 2026 infrastructure special-bond quota expansion). The key difference is that the 2022 trough had a clean, verifiable reopening catalyst (zero-COVID dismantled within six weeks); the 2026 setup lacks an equivalently definitive trigger and the property sector's structural overhang is deeper, making the re-rating path slower and more conditional on fiscal confirmation.","analog_zh":"当前（2026年6月底）筑底形态最接近2022年10月低点：两次均发生在重大政策冲击主导的连续下跌之后，建筑板块均连续两轮行情腿处于末五分位（2023年5月腿排名第26、2024年11月腿排名第28，对比2022年2月腿排名第21与此前排名第26），且两次均在政策救市催化剂前夕筑底（2022年11月十六条 vs 潜在的2026年专项债扩容）。关键区别在于：2022年低点拥有「清零六周内拆除」这一明确且可验证的再开放催化剂；2026年当前形态尚缺乏等效的确定性触发点，地产行业结构性积压更为深重，重估路径更依赖财政信号的明确落地。","bottom_signals":["PPP project suspension or LGFV debt audit freeze coincides with SHCOMP at multi-year lows","Construction ranks bottom-quintile (rank #25-28/31) for 2+ consecutive legs","Property-rescue policy package with direct project-completion funding announced (analogous to Nov-2022 16-point plan)","Large-scale RRR cut plus infrastructure special-bond pre-announcement by NDRC/MOF within the same month"],"bottom_signals_zh":["PPP项目暂停/城投债审计冻结叠加上证处于多年低位","建筑连续2+行情腿排名末五分位（第25-28/31名）","出台以保交楼专项资金为核心的地产救市政策组合（类比2022年11月十六条）","央行大幅降准与国家发改委/财政部专项债预下达在同月落地"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC monetary policy cycle (RRR/rate cuts drive liquidity beta)","Beijing fiscal infrastructure toggle (PPP project approvals, special-bond quotas)","Property-sector health (developer orderbooks: Three Red Lines, Evergrande/Country Garden defaults)","A-share margin financing and leverage cycle (amplifies beta on both sides)","US-China trade war / tariff cycle (suppresses domestic capex confidence)"],"drivers_zh":["央行货币政策周期（降准降息驱动流动性贝塔）","北京财政基建切换（PPP项目审批与专项债额度）","地产行业健康度（开发商订单：三道红线、恒大/碧桂园违约）","A股融资融券与杠杆周期（双向放大贝塔波动）","中美贸易战与关税周期（抑制国内资本开支信心）"],"median_cycle_months":16.2,"summary":"China Construction (Shenwan 801720) cycles on three overlapping engines: (1) the SHCOMP leveraged-bull/deleveraging-bear cycle, which Construction amplifies as a persistently high-beta cyclical; (2) Beijing's fiscal policy toggle between PPP infrastructure expansion and debt-containment crackdowns, which directly gates orderbook visibility for large SOE contractors (CSCEC, CRCC, CCCC); and (3) the property-sector linkage, where developer financial health (Three Red Lines, Evergrande, Country Garden defaults) determines the private-side construction orderbook. Peaks coincide with peak policy stimulus narrative or peak A-share liquidity; troughs align with policy reversal (deleveraging, PPP suspension, property developer default), macro shock (US tariffs, COVID), or liquidity withdrawal. The sector consistently leads Shenwan in value-rotation cycles tied to infrastructure capex acceleration and systematically underperforms in growth-led tapes or when the property-developer channel is impaired.","summary_zh":"申万建筑装饰（801720）受三重叠加引擎驱动：（1）上证融资牛市/去杠杆熊市周期——建筑凭借持续高贝塔属性放大该周期波动；（2）北京财政政策在PPP基建扩张与债务管控收紧之间的切换，直接决定中建、中铁建、中交建等央企龙头的订单能见度；（3）地产行业联动——开发商财务健康度（三道红线、恒大、碧桂园违约）决定民间端建筑订单规模。板块高点对应政策刺激叙事顶点或A股流动性峰值；低点对应政策逆转（去杠杆、PPP清库、地产开发商违约）、宏观冲击（中美关税、疫情）或流动性收紧。板块在基建资本开支提速的价值轮动周期中持续领跑申万，在成长主导行情或地产开发商渠道受损时系统性跑输。","top_signals":["PPP/special-bond policy narrative peaks: Ministry announcements followed by 6-12 months of no incremental policy surprise","Margin-financing balances surge to cycle highs with SHCOMP above 4,500-5,000","Construction leads Shenwan universe (rank #1-3) for 2+ consecutive legs — mean-reversion warning","Property developer credit spreads widen while Construction is still rallying"],"top_signals_zh":["PPP/专项债政策叙事见顶：财政部公告后6-12个月无增量政策惊喜","融资余额飙升至周期高位，上证突破4500-5000点区间","建筑连续2+行情腿领跑申万全市场（排名第1-3）——均值回归预警","地产开发商信用利差走阔但建筑仍处上涨阶段"]},"801730":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2022 peak: the sector has just completed a +100% structural bull leg (rank 5/31) driven by compounding policy and thematic catalysts (AI power demand + dual-carbon + tariff truce), comparable to the Aug-2022 peak that followed the +62% post-lockdown rebound. In both cases, Power Eqp achieved its move while carrying the heaviest growth premium in Shenwan, and both followed a prior deep value-led selloff. The key risk, as in Aug-2022, is that the structural bull narrative (solar/EV then, AI power now) masks an impending supply-side correction or macro risk-off that will hit the highest-beta sector hardest. The 18-month, -57% bear that followed Aug-2022 serves as the cautionary analog for the current Downturn phase.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月高点最为相似：本轮电力设备完成了由AI用电需求+双碳+关税停火多重催化剂驱动的+100%结构性大牛市（排名5/31），与2022年8月高点后的+62%封控后反弹高度相似。两种情形下，电力设备均以申万行业中最高的成长溢价完成行情，且都是在经历前一轮深度价值主导的大跌后启动。核心风险与2022年8月如出一辙：结构性牛市叙事（彼时为光伏/EV，今为AI用电）掩盖了潜在的供给侧修正或宏观避险压力，而这恰恰会对贝塔最高的板块造成最沉重的打击。2022年8月后长达18个月、-57%的熊市，正是当前下行阶段的历史警示参照。","bottom_signals":["Power Eqp ranks #28-31/31 in a value-led rotation (happened at 2021-01-27, 2022-04, 2022-08 troughs)","Value beats growth by >7pp AND defensives clearly outperform cyclicals (flight-to-safety context)","Sector-specific fundamental distress: NEV subsidy cut, solar module price collapse, or tariff shock","Policy trough: PBOC RRR cut AND fiscal stabilization package announced near SHCOMP lows"],"bottom_signals_zh":["价值领先行情中电力设备排名垫底（28-31/31）（2021年1月、2022年4月、8月低点均有此特征）","价值跑赢成长超过7pp且防御板块明显优于周期板块（避险背景）","板块特异性基本面困境：新能源汽车补贴削减、光伏组件价格崩塌或关税冲击","政策低点：央行降准+财政稳增长一揽子措施在上证综指低位附近宣布"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["China green energy capacity policy (Five-Year Plans, dual-carbon)","extreme growth-style beta (amplifies SHCOMP moves 2-4x in growth tapes)","EV/battery/solar commodity input cycles (lithium carbonate, module prices)","US-China trade war tariff cycles targeting Made in China 2025","A-share margin/leverage cycles driving retail crowding and forced deleveraging","AI power demand structural re-rating (emerging from 2024)"],"drivers_zh":["中国绿色能源产能政策（五年规划、双碳目标）","极端成长风格Beta（成长主导行情中放大上证综指涨幅2-4倍）","EV/电池/光伏大宗原料周期（碳酸锂、组件价格）","美中贸易战关税周期（精准打击中国制造2025）","A股融资杠杆周期（驱动散户扎堆与强制去杠杆）","AI用电需求结构性重估（2024年起浮现）"],"median_cycle_months":10.5,"summary":"Power Equipment (电力设备) cycles around a recurring three-force engine: (1) China's policy-directed green energy capacity mandates (Five-Year Plans, dual-carbon targets, storage quotas) create episodic demand surges; (2) the sector's extreme growth-style beta means it amplifies every SHCOMP up-leg by 2-4x when growth leads and suffers the deepest drawdowns when risk-off or value rotations hit; (3) commodity input cycles — particularly lithium carbonate and solar module prices — drive sharp swings between margin-expansion rallies and overcapacity/cost-squeeze selloffs that are independent of the index. Peaks have consistently coincided with peak growth-style leadership and crowded positioning (Power Eqp ranked #1 in three consecutive bull tops), while troughs have been set by the most extreme risk-off episodes (trade war, COVID policy shock, Fed rate cycles) combined with genuine fundamental distress (subsidy cuts, oversupply). The sector's structural position at the intersection of China's carbon transition, global AI power demand, and geopolitical supply chain rebalancing ensures continued high-amplitude cycles.","summary_zh":"电力设备的周期运行围绕三大核心驱动力：（1）中国政策主导的绿色能源容量指标（五年规划、双碳目标、储能配额）周期性制造需求浪潮；（2）板块极高的成长风格Beta意味着在成长领先的上证综指行情中涨幅放大2-4倍，而在避险或价值轮动时遭受最深回撤；（3）原材料价格周期——尤其是碳酸锂和光伏组件价格——在不依赖大盘指数方向的情况下，驱动利润率扩张式行情和产能过剩/成本压缩式下跌之间的剧烈切换。历史高点一致出现在成长风格领先度最强、持仓最拥挤之时（电力设备在连续三个牛市顶部均排名第1），而底部则由最极端的避险事件（贸易战、疫情政策冲击、美联储加息周期）叠加真实基本面困境（补贴削减、供给过剩）共同确立。板块处于中国能源转型、全球AI用电需求及地缘政治供应链重构三大交叉点的结构性定位，决定了未来仍将维持高振幅周期波动。","top_signals":["Power Eqp ranks #1 in Shenwan for consecutive legs (happened at 2021-01 and 2021-11 peaks)","Growth-minus-value spread exceeds +17pp AND sector gain runs 2.5x+ the SHCOMP return","Lithium carbonate / solar module prices at cycle highs with sector margin calls priced in positively","Post-major-policy-announcement (dual-carbon, PBOC bazooka) euphoria with breadth narrowing"],"top_signals_zh":["电力设备连续多个行情腿蝉联申万行业第1（2021年1月和11月高点均呈现此特征）","成长-价值利差超过+17pp且板块涨幅为上证综指的2.5倍以上","碳酸锂/光伏组件价格处于周期高点，市场已将利润率利好定价","重大政策公告后（双碳目标、央行大招）市场情绪亢奋、市场宽度收窄"]},"801740":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2018 trough analog (Oct 2018 to Apr 2019): same setup of a post-spike sector at the bottom of a broad selloff, with geopolitical re-rating having already run its course and the sector now needing a new cycle catalyst. In 2018, the catalyst was the US-China trade truce plus PBOC RRR cut; in mid-2026, the analog catalyst would be a 15th Five-Year Plan procurement announcement or a fresh geopolitical escalation. Then, Defense rallied 52% in 6 months from a laggard position once the macro floor was clear. Shared characteristics with current 2026 trough: defense ranked last/near-last in the preceding selloff, growth style recently dominant but defense underperforming, valuation near decade lows, and a resolved geopolitical event (India-Pak ceasefire) having cleared the sentiment overhang.","analog_zh":"最接近2018年10月低点类比（2018年10月至2019年4月）：同为地缘政治重估行情已充分演绎后的板块底部，需要新的周期催化（2018年当时靠中美贸易休战+央行降准触发；2026年类比催化剂为十五五采购公告或新地缘事件）。彼时军工从落后位置出发，在宏观底部明确后6个月内反弹52%。当前2026年底部的共同特征：前轮下跌中军工排名靠后、成长风格近期主导但军工跑输、估值接近十年低位、地缘政治事件（印巴停火）解除后情绪压力已释放。","bottom_signals":["Defense ranked last or second-last of all 28-31 Shenwan industries in a broad market selloff: signals maximum capitulation and extreme oversold positioning (occurred at every major trough)","Sector P/E at or below 35th percentile of decade range AND FYP delivery cycle accelerating into final year (2024 analog produced 71% rally)","Major style reversal from value back to growth beginning: growth-minus-value turns positive after sustained 10+pp value lag","Post-purge/post-scandal normalization: first clean quarterly earnings after PLA anti-corruption chapter closes (H2 2024 earnings confirmed purge complete, preceded Feb 2024 trough recovery)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["大盘下跌中军工排名申万全行业最后或倒数第二：表明充分出清/极度悲观（每次重要低点均出现）","板块市盈率低至十年区间35百分位以下，且五年规划交付周期加速进入最后一年（2024年案例产生71%涨幅）","价值向成长的重大风格切换启动：成长-价值利差在持续落后10pp+后转正","整肃/丑闻后正常化：解放军反腐篇章结束后首个干净季报（2024年下半年财报确认整肃结束，先于2024年2月低点的修复行情）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Five-Year Plan procurement cycle (delivery urgency peaks in final 1-2 years of each FYP)","PLA annual budget growth rate (>7% y/y sustained = bullish structural; cuts/freeze = headwind)","A-share style factor: growth vs value rotation (defense amplifies growth moves, collapses in value rotations)","A-share leverage/liquidity cycle (margin finance expansion = defense beta amplifier)","Geopolitical event premium (Taiwan Strait, US-China decoupling, arms export news = short-burst re-rating)","PLA governance/anti-corruption cycle (purges disrupt procurement; conclusions normalize and re-rate)"],"drivers_zh":["五年规划采购周期（交付紧迫性在每个五年规划最后1-2年达峰）","解放军年度预算增速（持续>7% = 看涨结构性支撑，削减/冻结 = 逆风）","A股风格因子：成长vs价值轮动（军工放大成长行情，价值轮动中崩溃）","A股杠杆/流动性周期（融资融券扩张=军工贝塔放大器）","地缘政治事件溢价（台海、中美脱钩、武器出口新闻=短期脉冲重估）","解放军治理/反腐周期（整肃扰乱采购；整肃结束后正常化并重估）"],"median_cycle_months":10.7,"summary":"China Defense and Military cycles around three structural forces: (1) Beijing policy regime - PLA budget hikes and Five-Year Plan procurement cycles drive multi-year bull phases (peaks in final 1-2 years of each FYP when order books are at maximum urgency); (2) A-share style factor - as a high-beta, high-PE SOE cluster, defense is systematically amplified in growth/liquidity rallies (leverage bull, PBOC stimulus recovery) and crushed in risk-off or value rotations (deleveraging, reflation, Fed tightening), consistently ranking last or near-last of 28-31 Shenwan industries in broad selloffs; (3) geopolitical event-driven spikes - Taiwan Strait tensions, India-Pakistan conflicts, and US-China decoupling rhetoric create idiosyncratic short-burst re-ratings of 10-40% within days that are reliably mean-reverting once events resolve. A fourth cycle overlaid intermittently is the PLA governance/corruption cycle: anti-corruption purges (most severely 2023) can extend bear phases well beyond market-cycle norms by disrupting procurement channels.","summary_zh":"中国国防军工板块的循环围绕三大结构性力量：（1）北京政策周期——解放军预算增速和五年规划采购周期驱动多年牛市（每个五年规划最后1-2年订单紧迫性最高时达峰）；（2）A股风格因子——作为高贝塔、高市盈率的国有企业集群，军工在成长/流动性行情中系统性被放大，在风险规避或价值轮动中则被系统性压制，在大盘下跌中几乎始终排名申万全行业倒数；（3）地缘政治事件驱动的短期脉冲——台海紧张、印巴冲突、中美脱钩叙事能在数日内创造10-40%的特异性重估，但事件平息后均值回归高度可预期。第四个间歇性叠加周期为解放军治理/反腐周期：整肃（最严重为2023年）能通过扰乱采购渠道将熊市显著延长至市场周期常规时限以外。","top_signals":["SHCOMP parabolic with defense up 40-80%+ in a leg and growth-minus-value >15pp: valuation stretched, risk-off rotation imminent (preceded crashes in Jun 2015, Jan 2021, Nov 2021, Nov 2024)","FYP final-year delivery peak fully priced: procurement bookings visible in SOE earnings but next-cycle catalyst absent (late 2021 and mid-2022 analog)","Geopolitical event spike (+10-40% in days on Taiwan/arms news) followed by ceasefire or resolution: mean-reversion nearly certain within weeks (Aug 2022 Pelosi spike and May 2025 India-Pakistan spike both reversed)","Defense P/E above 70-80x historical range: preceded major drawdowns in mid-2015, early 2021, and late 2021"],"top_signals_zh":["上证综指抛物线，军工单腿上涨40-80%+且成长-价值利差>15pp：估值透支，风险规避轮动临近（2015年6月、2021年1月、2021年11月、2024年11月崩盘前均出现）","五年规划最后一年交付高峰已充分定价：国企财报中采购订单可见但下一周期催化尚未出现（2021年底、2022年中类比）","地缘政治事件脉冲（台海/军贸消息引发数日内+10-40%）后停火/解决：数周内均值回归几乎确定（2022年8月裴洛西访台脉冲、2025年5月印巴冲突脉冲均已反转）","军工市盈率高于70-80倍历史区间：2015年中、2021年初、2021年底大幅回撤前均出现"]},"801750":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2022 trough + ChatGPT ignition (start 2022-10-10): same structure of a maximum-drawdown reset (Computers ranked last, high-percentile historical undervaluation) followed by a transformational AI narrative catalyst that drove +69% in six months. The current 2026 trough shares: (a) Computers at sub-5th historical percentile; (b) a global tech narrative shock (SaaSpocalypse software disruption) creating the oversold condition; (c) the next rally ignition will likely require either a new domestic AI application breakthrough or a policy package that re-channels flows back from hardware/Telecoms into software/IT services -- mirroring how ChatGPT in late 2022 ended the prior regulatory-crackdown-era bear.","analog_zh":"与2022年10月低点+ChatGPT点燃行情（2022-10-10起始）最为相似：同样是计算机排名垫底、历史分位极度低估后的最大回撤重置，随后由变革性AI叙事催化剂驱动六个月+69%的涨幅。当前2026年低点具备相同结构：（a）计算机历史分位跌至5%以下；（b）全球科技叙事冲击（SaaS末日软件颠覆）制造超卖条件；（c）下一轮上涨引燃可能需要国内AI应用重大突破或政策一揽子计划将资金从硬件/通信重新引导回软件/IT服务——正如2022年底ChatGPT终结了此前监管整改时代的熊市。","bottom_signals":["Computers ranks #27-#31 of 31 Shenwan sectors AND historical percentile falls below 5th percentile","PBOC announces meaningful RRR cut or LPR reduction within a selloff context -- historically marks the turn within 1-2 months","Major new AI/tech policy catalyst: new IT industrial plan, major domestic model launch, or domestic substitution announcement","National Team (Central Huijin/state funds) publicly commits to equity market stabilisation buys"],"bottom_signals_zh":["计算机在申万31行业中排名第27至第31且历史分位跌破第5百分位","央行在下跌背景下宣布有实质意义的降准或LPR下调——历史上标志1-2个月内的转折","重大AI/科技政策催化剂：新IT产业规划、国内重大模型发布或国产替代政策宣布","国家队（中央汇金/国有基金）公开承诺入市维稳买入"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing IT/AI industrial policy announcements (Internet Plus, AI Plan, domestic substitution)","PBOC RRR cuts and liquidity cycles driving retail margin leverage","US-China trade war/tariff escalation as primary macro risk-off trigger","SHCOMP margin leverage cycle: Computers is maximum-beta amplifier in both directions","Global AI/tech theme waves (ChatGPT, DeepSeek, 5G, cloud) as super-cycle ignition","China regulatory cycles (tech crackdown, COVID lockdowns, circuit breaker) accelerating drawdowns"],"drivers_zh":["北京IT/AI产业政策发布（互联网+、AI规划、国产替代）","央行降准与流动性周期驱动散户融资杠杆","中美贸易战/关税升级为首要宏观避险触发器","上证综指融资杠杆周期：计算机为双向最大贝塔放大器","全球AI/科技主题浪潮（ChatGPT、DeepSeek、5G、云计算）作为超级周期引信","中国监管周期（科技整改、新冠封控、熔断机制）加速下行"],"median_cycle_months":13,"summary":"China Computers (SW801750) cycles on three recurring engines: (1) Beijing's IT policy calendar -- Internet Plus, AI Development Plan, Made in China 2025, New Infrastructure, domestic substitution -- which each spark multi-month growth-premium rallies whenever a credible new tech narrative is issued; (2) the SHCOMP margin/leverage cycle, with Computers as maximum-beta amplifier both up and down (it ranked #1 or #2 in every major rally and #25-#31 in every major selloff); (3) global macro risk-on/risk-off shocks (trade wars, Fed tightening, currency shocks) that rotate the tape from growth to value, always hitting Computers hardest among Shenwan sectors. The cycle DNA is therefore: policy-narrative ignition -> leverage inflow -> growth leadership -> macro or policy shock -> maximum drawdown -> oversold reset -> repeat.","summary_zh":"计算机板块（申万801750）呈现三大周期驱动引擎：（1）北京IT政策日历——互联网+、AI发展规划、中国制造2025、新基建、国产替代——每逢可信新科技叙事出台即触发数月成长溢价行情；（2）上证综指保证金/杠杆周期，计算机为双向最大贝塔放大器（每次主要上涨均排名第1或第2，每次主要下跌均排名第25至第31）；（3）全球宏观风险偏好/规避冲击（贸易战、美联储收紧、汇率冲击）将市场从成长轮动至价值，申万各板块中计算机总是受冲击最重。板块周期DNA为：政策叙事点燃 -> 杠杆资金流入 -> 成长领涨 -> 宏观/政策冲击 -> 最大回撤 -> 超跌重置 -> 循环重复。","top_signals":["Computers reaches #1 ranking among 31 Shenwan sectors AND growth-vs-value spread exceeds +20pp -- historically a peak proximity signal","Policy narrative exhaustion: second/third derivative of major IT policy (implementation detail vs announcement) triggers profit-taking","Margin leverage at cycle highs: retail account opening surge and margin balance acceleration precede peaks by 1-3 months","SHCOMP approaches prior resistance levels while Computers P/E re-rates above 60-70x trailing earnings"],"top_signals_zh":["计算机在申万31行业中跻身第1且成长-价值利差超过+20pp——历史上为接近顶部信号","政策叙事衰竭：主要IT政策的落实细节（vs发布公告）触发获利了结","融资杠杆处于周期高位：散户开户热潮与融资余额加速往往在顶部前1-3个月出现","上证综指逼近前期阻力位，同时计算机市盈率重估至60-70倍历史市盈率以上"]},"801760":{"analog":"Closest to the June-2023 peak and subsequent Jul-Oct 2023 trough: the same pattern of AIGC/AI narrative exhaustion after a large surge (91.8% then, 72.7% now), with Media ranking dead last while the broader market is flat or slightly positive and value/defensives lead. In that analog, the trough lasted approximately 4 months before a new catalyst (Huawei Mate 60 Pro launch + RMB 1tr fiscal stimulus in Oct 2023) triggered a fresh +24.7% Media rally. The current setup (post-Jan 2026 peak, -35.8% already recorded) mirrors that configuration: the AI-content narrative has burned out, hardware has assumed growth leadership, and the sector sits near maximum relative underperformance. A new domestic AI-content model launch or an AIGC monetization milestone would be the analog trigger for a sharp mean-reversion.","analog_zh":"与2023年6月峰值及随后7-10月低谷最为相似：同样是AIGC/AI叙事在大涨（彼时91.8%、本次72.7%）后耗尽，传媒排名垫底，大盘持平或小涨，价值/防御板块领先。彼时低谷历时约4个月，直至华为Mate 60 Pro发布+万亿财政刺激（2023年10月）才触发新一轮+24.7%反弹。当前情形（2026年1月峰值后已跌35.8%）与之高度吻合：AI内容叙事燃尽，硬件板块接棒领涨，传媒接近最大相对超跌位置。一旦国内AI内容新模型发布或AIGC商业变现里程碑出现，类似2023年10月的急速均值回归行情将成为首要参考情景。","bottom_signals":["Media ranked last (#28-31) for 3+ consecutive months while SHCOMP is positive or inflecting upward (max underperformance vs index)","A new AI-content platform catalyst emerges (new LLM, text-to-video model, AIGC tool) not yet reflected in sector prices","PBOC announces RRR cut or LPR reduction (unlocks growth-sector re-rating)","Content regulation eases (game license resumption, IP cost cap removal, platform rules relaxed)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["传媒连续3个月以上排名申万垫底（第28-31），同期上证综指为正或出现拐点（相对指数最大超跌）","全新AI内容平台催化剂涌现（新大模型、文生视频工具、AIGC平台），尚未被板块估值消化","央行宣布降准或降LPR（打开成长板块重估空间）","内容监管放松（游戏版号恢复、IP成本管控取消、平台规则优化）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["AI/AIGC content-generation catalysts (ChatGPT, Sora, DeepSeek, Internet Plus)","PBOC liquidity cycle (RRR/LPR cuts unlock growth multiples)","Beijing content regulation cycles (game licenses, IP cost caps, platform rules)","Growth-vs-value style rotation (risk-on favors Media; risk-off punishes it)","Trade policy and macro risk-off shocks (CNY devaluation, US tariffs, COVID)"],"drivers_zh":["AI/AIGC内容生成催化剂（ChatGPT、Sora、DeepSeek、互联网+）","央行流动性周期（降准/降LPR打开成长估值空间）","北京内容监管周期（游戏版号、IP成本管控、平台规则）","成长vs价值风格轮动（风险偏好利好传媒；避险行情重创传媒）","贸易政策与宏观冲击（人民币贬值、美国关税、疫情）"],"median_cycle_months":4.7,"summary":"China Media (Shenwan 801760) is the most AIGC/AI-content-sensitive sector in the A-share universe, cycling violently between speculative growth surges and brutal de-ratings. Its recurring engine: it leads the growth complex when a technology narrative creates a credible new revenue/monetization story for content creators (Internet Plus 2014, ChatGPT/AIGC 2022-23, Sora 2024, DeepSeek 2025), then reverses sharply when either the narrative exhausts without earnings proof, policy regulation tightens content monetization, or macro risk-off sends liquidity fleeing into defensives. The SHCOMP direction is necessary but not sufficient: Media's biggest moves are both above and below SHCOMP beta, driven by the presence or absence of a live AI-content catalyst. Regulatory crackdowns (gaming licensing, content cost controls, platform regulation) are the structural recurring bear-driver alongside each deleveraging cycle.","summary_zh":"申万传媒（801760）是A股市场对AIGC/AI内容叙事最敏感的板块，在投机性成长浪潮与残酷去估值之间剧烈震荡。其核心驱动引擎：每当新技术叙事为内容创作者构建出可信的新收入/变现故事时（2014年互联网+、2022-23年ChatGPT/AIGC、2024年Sora、2025年DeepSeek），传媒就领涨成长板块；一旦叙事在没有业绩验证的情况下耗尽，或政策监管收紧内容变现渠道，或宏观风险规避令流动性出逃至防御资产，就会急速反转。上证综指方向是传媒行情的必要条件但非充分条件：有无AI内容催化剂才是传媒能否独立跑赢/跑输的核心变量。游戏版号监管、内容成本管控、平台监管是伴随每轮去杠杆周期反复出现的结构性熊市根因。","top_signals":["Media ranked #1/31 Shenwan sectors for 2+ consecutive months while SHCOMP is flat or falling (narrative detached from fundamentals)","Growth-minus-value spread compressed below +5pp after an extended AIGC rally (liquidity rotation complete)","CSRC or regulators issue explicit warnings about AI stock speculation or content-sector valuations","Media P/E premium vs SHCOMP exceeds 3x historical average (extreme multiple expansion)"],"top_signals_zh":["传媒连续2个月以上排名申万第1/31，同期上证综指走平或下跌（叙事与基本面脱钩）","AIGC行情持续后成长-价值利差收窄至+5pp以下（流动性轮动接近尾声）","证监会/监管层明确发出AI炒作或传媒板块估值过高警示","传媒市盈率溢价较上证综指历史均值高出3倍（极端估值扩张）"]},"801770":{"analog":"Closest to the June-2023 peak: same sequence of a major policy/AI narrative driving Telecoms to top-2 Shenwan ranking with 80%+ gains, followed by a topping signal as growth-vs-value premium exceeds 40pp, the sector hits pos 95+, and the next risk catalyst (then: property deflation; now: potential growth-style exhaustion or macro shock) waits in the wings. The Oct-2018 trough analog also rhymes for the downside entry: after a 25-38% drawdown driven by US-China tech-geopolitics, Telecoms historically leads the subsequent recovery when the next infrastructure-policy catalyst is announced.","analog_zh":"最接近2023年6月峰值：同样是重大政策/AI叙事驱动通信板块进入申万前2名、涨幅80%+，随后当成长vs价值溢价超过40pp、板块位置达95+时出现见顶信号。下一个风险催化剂（彼时：地产通缩；此刻：成长风格耗尽或宏观冲击）伺机待发。2018年10月低点的类比则适用于下行入场逻辑：在中美科技地缘政治驱动的25-38%回撤后，历史上通信板块在下一个基础设施政策催化剂公告时往往率先领涨。","bottom_signals":["Telecoms ranked bottom 3-5 of 28-31 Shenwan industries in a risk-off drawdown","Policy catalyst approaching but not yet officially announced (5G licenses pending, AI-infra plan in draft)","SHCOMP in flight-to-safety rotation with defensives leading by 10pp or more and growth-vs-value below -15pp","Sector has just experienced a 25%+ drawdown with no new policy catalyst announced"],"bottom_signals_zh":["通信在申万28-31个行业中排名倒数3-5位，处于风险规避下跌中","政策催化剂临近但尚未正式公告（5G牌照待批、AI基建计划处于草案阶段）","上证指数处于避险轮动，防御板块领先10pp以上，成长vs价值利差低于-15pp","板块刚经历25%+回撤且尚无新政策催化剂落地"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["policy-infrastructure-cycle-4G-5G-AI-compute","growth-vs-value-style-regime","SHCOMP-beta-amplification","margin-leverage-cycle","US-China-tech-geopolitics","PBOC-easing-vs-tightening"],"drivers_zh":["政策基础设施周期（4G/5G/AI算力）","成长vs价值风格轮动","上证指数贝塔放大","杠杆/配资周期","中美科技地缘政治","央行宽松vs收紧"],"median_cycle_months":11.1,"summary":"China Telecoms (Shenwan 801770) cycles through a recurring engine: policy-designated infrastructure buildout cycles (4G, 5G, AI/cloud) drive multi-month growth-style leadership phases, which then collapse when macro risk-off events (margin crashes, trade wars, Fed tightening, deflation) or style rotations into value/defensives hit. Telecoms moves roughly in-phase with the broad SHCOMP but with amplified beta to growth-vs-value regime shifts - it outperforms acutely in growth-style waves and underperforms brutally in value/defensive rotations. The sector dual character as both a state-owned infrastructure monopoly and a growth/tech-theme vehicle creates sharp reversals when macro regimes shift.","summary_zh":"申万通信板块（801770）的循环驱动引擎具有清晰的结构性规律：政策指定的基础设施建设周期（4G、5G、AI/云计算）驱动多月成长风格领先行情，随后在宏观风险规避事件（配资崩盘、贸易战、美联储加息、通缩）或向价值/防御风格切换时急剧逆转。作为国有基础设施垄断与成长/科技主题的双重载体，宏观风格切换时呈现尖锐的反转特征。","top_signals":["Telecoms ranked top 3 of 31 Shenwan industries with growth-vs-value premium exceeding +18pp","Policy infrastructure buildout fully priced: 5G licenses issued or AI-infra plans released and stocks already up 50% or more","SHCOMP at cycle highs with margin balances elevated and retail sentiment euphoric","Sector position indicator near 95-100 with 12-month trailing return exceeding 80%"],"top_signals_zh":["通信在申万行业排名前3，成长vs价值溢价超+18pp","政策基础设施周期充分定价：5G牌照发放或AI基建计划落地后股价已涨50%+","上证指数处于周期高位，融资余额高企，散户情绪亢奋","板块位置指标接近95-100，12个月滚动涨幅超80%"]},"801780":{"analog":"Closest to the Jul-2018 trough: same growth-over-value rotation structure where banks underperformed SHCOMP by ~30pp as technology/growth themes dominated, followed by a PBOC-driven mean-reversion. In 2018, the trough was confirmed by a PBOC RRR cut (July 2018) when the sector hit extreme underperformance vs peers; today's setup shows the same positioning extreme (rank 27/31, pos 7.4) with the added parallel of a prior multi-year bull having exhausted its narrative (2016-18 value rally vs 2022-25 dividend rally). The 2018 trough resolved into a 28% rally over 9 months -- a template for the current bottoming setup if policy eases.","analog_zh":"与2018年7月低点最为相似：同为成长压制价值的轮动结构，银行跑输上证综指约30个百分点，科技/成长主题主导市场，随后由央行宽松驱动均值回归。2018年底部由央行降准（2018年7月）确认，彼时板块相对同业极度落后；当前同样呈现极端配置偏差（排名27/31，位置分位7.4），且上一轮多年牛市叙事同样耗尽（2016-18年价值牛市对应2022-25年股息牛市）。2018年低点后9个月反弹28%，为当前触底格局提供参照模板。","bottom_signals":["bank P/B at or below 0.5x book (historical trough valuation)","dividend yields >6-8% vs 10yr CGB <2% (extreme yield gap)","national team / Huijin publicly disclosed buying","PBOC RRR or LPR cut announcement following a 20%+ drawdown"],"bottom_signals_zh":["银行市净率降至或低于0.5倍（历史底部估值）","股息率>6-8%而10年期国债<2%（极端利差）","中央汇金等国家队公开披露增持","下跌20%+后央行宣布降准或降息"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC rate and RRR cycles (easing = bull catalyst, tightening via regulatory = bear)","SOE dividend policy mandates and national team buying","property sector NPL contagion risk on/off","bond yield compression making dividend yields attractive vs bonds","US-China trade/geopolitical risk crimping GDP outlook","growth-vs-value style rotation driven by technology/AI themes"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息降准周期（宽松=牛市催化，监管收紧=熊市）","国企分红政策及国家队增持","房地产不良贷款传染风险开关","债券收益率压缩凸显股息率吸引力","中美贸易/地缘风险压制GDP预期","科技/AI主题驱动的成长与价值风格轮动"],"median_cycle_months":26,"summary":"China Banks cycle structurally between two recurring regimes: (1) value/dividend-yield bull phases driven by PBOC easing, SOE reform mandates, or NIM stabilisation, during which banks lead the SHCOMP as capital seeks quasi-fixed-income equity proxies; and (2) selloff/underperformance phases driven by leverage deleveraging, property NPL shocks, trade-war GDP fears, or market rotations into growth/tech themes, during which banks underperform cyclicals by wide margins. The key structural driver is that Chinese state-owned banks function as policy instruments -- their valuations are compressed during credit-support mandates (NIM sacrificed for growth loans) and re-rated when dividends rise and bond yields fall. SHCOMP direction is necessary but not sufficient: banks require a value-over-growth style environment AND a stable NIM/credit cycle to lead.","summary_zh":"中国银行板块在两种周期性格局之间结构性切换：（1）价值/高股息牛市阶段，由央行宽松、国企改革分红要求或净息差企稳驱动，银行作为类固定收益股权替代品引领上证综指；（2）下行/跑输阶段，由杠杆去化、房地产不良贷款冲击、贸易战GDP担忧或成长/科技主题轮动驱动，银行大幅落后于周期股。核心结构性逻辑：国有大行兼具政策工具属性，信贷支持任务期净息差被动收窄、估值承压；分红提升、债券利率下行时则估值重估。上证综指方向是必要非充分条件，银行领涨还需价值风格占优且净息差/信贷周期稳定。","top_signals":["growth-vs-value spread narrows to near-zero (banks no longer lagging growth names)","PBOC signals end of easing / moves to tighten (NIM expansion imminent)","bank dividend yields compress toward CGB yields (yield gap closes)","momentum exhaustion after 50%+ rallies with SOE reform narrative fully priced"],"top_signals_zh":["成长与价值价差收窄至接近零（银行不再落后成长股）","央行暗示宽松周期结束/转向收紧（净息差扩张在即）","银行股息率向国债收益率压缩（利差收窄）","国企改革叙事充分定价后50%+涨幅后的动能衰竭"]},"801790":{"analog":"Closest to the Nov-2024 peak into the Jan-2026 trough: the Dec-2015 peak into the Jan-Feb 2016 selloff leg. Both followed a regulatory or exogenous shock that cut short a momentum-driven broker rally (circuit breaker plus RMB shock in 2015-2016; Trump tariffs followed by CSRC slow-bull controls in 2024-2026) and both saw brokers collapse from top-ranked to bottom-ranked across consecutive legs. The 2016 analog resolved with a fresh easing cycle and a 21-month broad-market recovery where brokers ranked 4th. The current setup implies a similar resolution requires a new PBOC easing package or capital-market stimulus round comparable to September 2024.","analog_zh":"与当前形势最为相似的历史段是2015年12月峰值至2016年2月下跌段：两者均发生在政策性或外生冲击打断动量驱动的券商强势行情之后（2015-2016年为熔断叠加人民币贬值；2024-2026年为特朗普关税叠加证监会慢牛管控），且两个时期券商均经历了从行业排名第一到垫底的急剧反转。2016年类比最终以新一轮宽松周期和长达21个月的宽基市场复苏告终，券商排名回升至第4位。当前形势的化解同样有赖于新一轮人民银行宽松或类似2024年9月规模的资本市场组合拳。","bottom_signals":["Broker sector ranked 28th-31st for one full leg while the prior leg was also weak: consecutive underperformance","PBOC announces RRR cut AND a new direct equity-market support facility within the same policy package","SHCOMP more than 20% drawdown from cycle peak while broker sector is down more than 40% (relative overshooting)","Politburo or CSRC explicitly calls for invigorating capital markets or announces a multi-instrument capital-market package"],"bottom_signals_zh":["券商板块在整整一个下跌段中排名第28-31位，且前一轮同样偏弱（连续跑输信号）","央行同一次政策包中同时宣布降准和新设股票市场直接支持工具","上证综指自周期顶部回撤超20%，券商板块累计跌超40%（相对超调）","政治局或证监会明确提出活跃资本市场或发布多工具资本市场组合拳"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["PBOC monetary easing cycle (RRR/LPR cuts) expanding broker balance sheets and market volumes","Direct capital-market policy tools (swap facilities, state-rescue-fund purchases via brokers)","Margin financing leverage cycle: expansion boosts broker interest income; forced unwind crushes it","Regulatory regime shift (asset-management rules, fintech crackdowns, slow-bull controls)","SHCOMP broad-market beta: brokers have high correlation to index with amplified magnitude","Foreign inflow episodes (MSCI inclusion, Stock Connect quota increases) improving market liquidity"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行货币宽松周期（降准/降LPR）扩张券商资产负债表和市场交投","资本市场直接政策工具（互换便利、国家队通过券商入市）","融资融券杠杆周期：扩张期拉动券商利息收入，强制平仓则急剧压缩","监管制度转向（资管新规、金融科技整治、慢牛管控）","上证综指宽基贝塔：券商与指数高度相关且弹性显著放大","外资流入事件（MSCI纳入、沪港通额度提升）改善市场流动性"],"median_cycle_months":15,"summary":"Non-bank Financials (dominated by A-share brokers) are the purest high-beta play on the SHCOMP cycle: they outperform in every major policy-stimulus-driven bull market (2014-2015, Aug-Dec 2015, 2018-2019, 2022-2023, Sep 2024) and underperform in every deleveraging or regulatory crackdown period (Jun-Aug 2015, 2020-2022, 2026). The recurring engine is the leverage cycle: when Beijing eases (RRR cuts, swap facilities, state-media bull calls), broker revenues inflate via commission volume and margin interest, and when Beijing tightens (asset-management rules, slow-bull controls, fintech crackdowns), broker revenues deflate faster than the market. Value-style environments (2016-2017) produce moderate broker performance via insurance-equity flows; growth-style stimulus environments combined with direct policy transmission through securities firms (Sep 2024 swap facility, Aug 2015 CSF rescue) produce maximum broker outperformance.","summary_zh":"非银金融（以A股券商为主）是上证综指最纯粹的高贝塔行业：每一轮政策刺激驱动的牛市（2014-2015、2015年8-12月、2018-2019、2022-2023、2024年9月）中无不领涨，而每一轮去杠杆或监管收紧（2015年6-8月、2020-2022、2026年）中无不领跌。核心驱动机制是杠杆周期：北京放松（降准、互换便利、官媒背书），券商通过交易量和两融利息暴增；北京收紧（资管新规、慢牛管控、金融科技整治），券商收入的收缩速度往往快于大盘。价值风格环境（2016-2017）下保险资金入市维持券商表现中规中矩；成长风格叠加政策直接传导至证券机构时（2024年9月互换便利、2015年8月中证金入场）非银金融超额收益最为显著。","top_signals":["SHCOMP trading volume at multi-year highs AND margin balances approaching or exceeding CNY2tn","CSRC announces tightening on shadow lending, margin financing, or HFT after consecutive months of record turnover","Broker sector ranking top-1 to top-3 for two or more consecutive rally legs (momentum exhaustion signal)","State media shifts from healthy bull endorsement language to rational investment or slow-bull cautionary language"],"top_signals_zh":["上证综指成交量创多年新高且融资余额接近或超过2万亿元","证监会在连续多月成交量创纪录后宣布收紧场外配资/两融/高频交易","券商板块连续两轮或以上保持行业排名前1-3（动量趋于衰竭的信号）","官媒措辞从健康牛市转向理性投资或慢牛等警示性表述"]},"801880":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2022 peak cycle: same subsidy-expiry-into-price-war setup — in 2022, NEV subsidies expired Dec 31, Tesla launched a price war, and Autos ranked 30th/31 (-27.3%) over 9 months in a near-flat SHCOMP. The Jan 2026 leg mirrors this precisely: the NEV purchase-tax exemption was halved, passenger car sales plunged 19.5%, below-cost selling became endemic with over 70% of brands unprofitable, and Autos ranked 24th/31 (-23%) while the index only fell 2.6% — confirming sector-specific rather than macro-driven pressure. As in 2022-2023, the bottoming catalyst will likely be a targeted policy reversal; in 2023 it was the Huawei smart-car theme plus export surge, while in 2026 the equivalent trigger may be an anti-price-war regulation with teeth or a fresh NEV trade-in scheme.","analog_zh":"最接近2022年8月峰值后的周期：同为补贴退坡引发价格战的组合——2022年新能源补贴于12月31日到期，特斯拉发动价格战，汽车板块9个月内排名第30/31（-27.3%），同期大市近乎平盘。2026年1月的本轮下跌与此高度类似：新能源购置税减免减半，乘用车销量骤降19.5%，低于成本价销售成常态（70%以上品牌亏损），汽车排名第24/31（-23%），而指数仅跌2.6%——确认为行业特有压力而非宏观驱动。与2022-2023年类似，筑底催化剂可能来自针对性政策反转；2023年为华为智能车主题加出口激增，2026年的等效触发点或为国务院出台具有约束力的反价格战规定或新一轮以旧换新补贴方案。","bottom_signals":["Beijing announces targeted auto demand stimulus (purchase tax cut, NEV trade-in subsidy launch/renewal)","Sector ranking at or near bottom (27th-31st/31) with oversold technical conditions","US-China trade truce or tariff rollback confirmed","National Team CSI300 ETF intervention alongside PBOC RRR/rate cut"],"bottom_signals_zh":["北京宣布汽车需求专项刺激（购置税减免、新能源以旧换新补贴启动/续期）","板块排名接近垫底（第27-31/31）且技术面超卖","中美关税休战或回调确认","国家队沪深300 ETF入场叠加央行降准/降息"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["PBOC monetary easing (rate/RRR cuts) lifting broad cyclical beta","Beijing vehicle purchase tax cuts and NEV subsidy programmes","US-China trade war tariff escalation/de-escalation cycles","NEV EV adoption S-curve: subsidy regime expansions and expirations","A-share deleveraging/margin cycles (2015 crash, 2018 credit crunch)","Domestic auto sales volume cycle (18-month contraction 2018-2019, 2026 plunge)"],"drivers_zh":["央行货币宽松（降息降准）提升周期贝塔","北京购置税减免及新能源补贴政策","中美贸易战关税升降周期","新能源渗透率S型曲线：补贴扩张与到期","A股去杠杆/融资周期（2015年崩盘、2018年信用紧缩）","国内汽车销量周期（2018-2019年连续萎缩、2026年暴跌）"],"median_cycle_months":13.2,"summary":"China Automobiles (Shenwan 801880) cycles through three overlapping engines: (1) index-beta amplification — as a high-beta cyclical, Autos rises and falls more than SHCOMP in broad bull/bear phases, typically lagging when the tape is growth-led but outperforming in value-cyclical recoveries; (2) policy-catalyst episodes — specific Beijing demand-side interventions (purchase tax cuts, NEV subsidies, trade-in programmes) create legs of genuine sector alpha that decouple Autos from the broader index; and (3) NEV-industry-cycle dynamics — since 2020, the sector's rhythm has been driven by the EV adoption S-curve, with booms on policy/subsidy expansion and busts on subsidy expiry, margin compression, or price-war escalation. The recurring pattern is: a broad market selloff takes Autos down with the cyclical cohort, a policy stimulus specifically targeting autos triggers a sector-specific rebound that outperforms SHCOMP, the rebound overshoots, then a rotation out of growth or an auto-fundamental shock ends the leg.","summary_zh":"中国汽车板块（申万801880）周期由三重引擎驱动：（1）指数贝塔放大——作为高贝塔周期股，汽车在大盘牛熊中涨跌幅均超上证综指，成长风格行情中相对落后，价值-周期修复中相对领先；（2）政策催化行情——北京针对汽车行业的需求端专项政策（购置税减免、新能源补贴、以旧换新方案）触发与大盘解耦的行业超额行情；（3）新能源产业周期——2020年以来板块节奏受电动车渗透率S型曲线主导，补贴扩张或政策加持时行情爆发，补贴到期、利润承压或价格战升级时行情终结。典型模式：大盘下跌带动汽车随周期板块整体回落，北京出台汽车专项刺激政策触发行业跑赢大盘反弹，反弹过度后，成长风格切换或行业基本面冲击结束行情。","top_signals":["Subsidy programme approaching expiry or scheduled reduction (NEV Dec 2022, purchase tax end-2016)","Sector ranking in top 2-3/31 Shenwan for 2+ consecutive months — overextension signal","EV price war escalation with margin data showing sector-wide losses across more than 50% of brands","Trade war tariff shock: US tariff announcements on autos or broad Chinese goods"],"top_signals_zh":["补贴政策临近到期或计划削减（如新能源补贴2022年12月、购置税减免到期）","板块在申万行业中连续2个月以上排名前2-3名——超涨预警信号","新能源价格战升级，行业数据显示超50%品牌亏损","贸易战关税冲击（美国对汽车或中国商品加税公告）"]},"801890":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current Topping phase is the November 2016 peak: both followed a major macro-policy-driven surge (2016: FAI/supply-side reform; 2025: DeepSeek/humanoid + tariff truce), both arrived with Machinery ranked 3rd-5th in the Shenwan table, and both preceded a prolonged defensive/value rotation. The 2016-2018 selloff (-50%) lasted 23 months as trade-war and deleveraging headwinds compounded; the current risk is similar — tariff truce expiry (Nov 2026) and structural overcapacity in industrial equipment could extend the downside if the Geneva deal unravels.","analog_zh":"当前顶部阶段与2016年11月峰值最为相似：两者均发生在重大政策驱动行情之后（2016年固投/供给侧改革；2025年DeepSeek/人形机器人+关税休战），机械均排名申万行业第3至5位，随后均进入长达12至24个月的防御/价值主导回调。2016至2018年的下跌行情（-50%）历时23个月，因贸易战和去杠杆叠加而加剧；当前面临的风险类似——若日内瓦协议破裂（2026年11月到期），关税休战终止叠加工业设备结构性产能过剩，可能延长下行周期。","bottom_signals":["PBOC announces RRR cut and/or LPR cut with explicit growth-support framing","State Council issues large-scale equipment upgrade or infrastructure stimulus with special bond allocation","US-China tariff truce or trade de-escalation agreement","Sector ranking reaches 24th-29th of 31 in a 20-35% drawdown with cyclicals broadly underperforming defensives"],"bottom_signals_zh":["央行宣布降准和/或降低LPR并明确表示支持增长","国务院发布大规模设备更新或基础设施刺激计划并配套特别债券额度","中美达成关税休战或贸易降级协议","行业排名跌至31个行业第24至29位，下跌20至35%且周期股普遍弱于防御股"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC credit cycle (RRR/rate cuts)","Fiscal-FAI waves and Five-Year Plan capex mandates","Industrial policy themes (MIC2025, green capex, AI/robotics)","US-China trade tension / tariff cycle","SHCOMP margin/liquidity cycle (leverage-driven amplification)"],"drivers_zh":["央行信用周期（降准/降息）","财政-固投浪潮与五年规划资本开支任务","产业政策主题（中国制造2025、绿色资本开支、AI/机器人）","中美贸易摩擦/关税周期","A股融资/流动性周期（杠杆驱动放大效应）"],"median_cycle_months":11.9,"summary":"Machinery (Shenwan 801890) is a pure-beta growth-cyclical: it amplifies SHCOMP moves by 1.5-2x on the upside and is consistently punished in risk-off rotations. Its recurring causal engine is a three-force interaction: (1) China's credit/liquidity cycle (PBOC rate/RRR actions open or close the lever), (2) fiscal-capex waves (FAI surges, Five-Year Plan equipment mandates, and large-scale equipment-upgrade programs drive order books), and (3) successive industrial frontier themes that revalue machinery sub-segments (MIC2025 automation, EV supply chain, green capex, AI/humanoid robotics). Peaks consistently arrive when SHCOMP breadth narrows and growth-cyclical leadership exhausts; troughs are set by policy inflection (PBOC easing announcements, State Council stimulus, tariff truce agreements).","summary_zh":"机械设备（申万801890）是典型的纯贝塔成长周期品：上涨时对上证综指有1.5至2倍的放大效应，在风险规避轮动中则持续垫底。其循环驱动的核心逻辑由三力交织组成：（1）中国信用/流动性周期（央行降息降准打开或关闭杠杆闸门）；（2）财政-资本开支波浪（固投激增、五年规划设备任务及大规模设备更新计划驱动订单）；（3）历代工业前沿主题对机械细分赛道的估值重估（中国制造2025自动化、新能源供应链、绿色资本开支、AI/人形机器人）。顶部往往在上证综指赚钱效应收窄、成长周期股领涨动能衰竭时形成；底部则由政策拐点触发（央行宽松公告、国务院刺激方案、关税休战协议）。","top_signals":["SHCOMP breadth narrows: growth-cyclical leadership fades while Machinery's sector ranking slips from top-3 to 4th-8th","Margin debt or leverage sentiment peaks (preceded all 2015 crash legs)","Tariff escalation or major regulatory shock announced after a multi-month rally","Value/defensive rotation begins: Banks, Coal, Utilities leading while growth lags by 8pp or more"],"top_signals_zh":["上证综指赚钱效应收窄：成长周期领涨动能减弱，行业排名从前3退至第4至8位","融资余额/杠杆情绪见顶（历史上先于所有2015年崩盘段出现）","多月上涨后关税升级或重大监管冲击落地","价值/防御轮动启动：银行、煤炭、公用事业领涨而成长股滞涨超过8个百分点"]},"801950":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current June 2026 downturn is the Mar-May 2016 pullback (-18.9%): same post-catalyst-rally digestion pattern where Coal had led sharply for one quarter, the physical price catalyst (276-day rule in 2016; Indonesia export controls in 2026) began to fade, SHCOMP weakened modestly (-6.2% in 2016, -0.8% in 2026), and defensives/growth outperformed. In both cases the structural bull (supply-constrained coal in 2016; AI-driven power demand in 2026) remained intact but the market needed to consolidate. The Mar-May 2016 pullback was followed by the June 2016 to June 2022 supply-side-reform/energy-crisis super-cycle; the current analog suggests watching for the next structural demand catalyst — AI/data-centre power demand confirmation, winter heating demand surge, or fresh NDRC capacity constraint signal — to determine whether a new up-leg begins.","analog_zh":"与当前2026年6月回调最接近的历史类比是2016年3-5月的回调（-18.9%）：同为催化剂驱动行情后的整固——煤炭此前领涨一个季度，商品价格催化剂（2016年276工作日令 / 2026年印尼出口管制）开始退潮，沪指温和走弱（2016年-6.2%，2026年-0.8%），防御/成长相对跑赢。两次均处于结构性牛市之中（2016年供给受限；2026年AI驱动用电需求），但市场需要消化后再起。2016年3-5月回调之后紧接着是2016年6月至2022年6月的供给侧改革/能源危机超级周期；当前类比提示需关注下一个结构性需求催化剂——AI/数据中心用电需求明确、冬季供暖需求高峰或发改委新一轮产能约束信号——以判断新一轮上涨是否开启。","bottom_signals":["QHD benchmark near or below RMB 600/t with elevated port inventories (above 8-week coverage)","Coal ranked #28-31 in Shenwan for 3+ consecutive months while defensives (banks/food) hold flat or positive","Dividend yield above 6.5% on forward earnings (historically marks deep value entry for institutional rotation)","PBOC RRR/rate cut cycle beginning while NDRC signals fresh de-capacity or output-limit policy"],"bottom_signals_zh":["秦港基准价逼近或低于600元/吨，港口库存处于高位（超过8周覆盖量）","煤炭连续三个月以上在申万行业排名倒数，而银行/食饮等防御板块持平或微涨","基于预期盈利的股息率高于6.5%（历史上对应机构高股息轮动的深度价值买入区间）","央行启动降准/降息周期，同时发改委释放新一轮去产能或产量上限政策信号"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["NDRC supply policy: de-capacity mandates and working-day caps (2016 276-day rule)","Energy security shocks: domestic power shortages, hydro droughts, global energy crises (2021-2022)","SHCOMP liquidity regime: margin financing/retail leverage cycles amplify beta in both directions","Physical coal price cycle: QHD 5500kcal benchmark as the primary earnings and re-rating signal","Dividend yield rotation: coal SOEs (Shenhua, Yankuang) attract institutional rotation when growth is scarce"],"drivers_zh":["发改委供给政策：去产能令及工作日限制（2016年276工作日令）","能源安全冲击：国内电力短缺、水电干旱、全球能源危机（2021-2022）","沪指流动性周期：两融杠杆周期双向放大贝塔","煤炭现货价格周期：秦港5500大卡基准价为核心盈利及估值重估信号","高股息轮动：神华/兖矿等央企国企在成长匮乏时吸引机构配置"],"median_cycle_months":17,"summary":"China Coal (Shenwan 801950) cycles between two distinct regimes: (1) high-beta amplification of broad SHCOMP moves — up to 2x the index in both directions — driven by its status as the most liquid, highest-beta cyclical proxy for China's industrial economy; and (2) idiosyncratic commodity-price super-cycles driven by NDRC supply policy (de-capacity mandates) or energy security shocks, during which Coal diverges sharply from the market and leads Shenwan peers by 20-40pp. The transition between regimes is triggered by coal physical price inflections: when QHD benchmark prices are rising and supply is constrained, Coal leads; when prices are falling and financial liquidity themes dominate, Coal lags. SHCOMP direction is a necessary but not sufficient condition: Coal outperforms only when a commodity catalyst coincides with a market up-leg. The sector reliably ranks #28-31/31 (worst laggard) in every SHCOMP risk-off episode and ranks #1-2 in every genuine commodity re-rating window.","summary_zh":"申万煤炭（801950）在两种截然不同的周期模式之间切换：（1）宽基沪指行情的高贝塔放大器——无论涨跌均可达到大盘的两倍波动——源于其作为中国工业经济最具流动性的高贝塔周期代理品的定位；（2）由发改委去产能政策或能源安全冲击驱动的特异性商品超级周期，此时煤炭与大盘显著背离，领跑申万同行20-40百分点。两种模式之间的切换由煤炭现货价格拐点触发：当秦港基准价上涨且供给受限时，煤炭领涨；当价格回落且流动性主题主导市场时，煤炭落后。沪指方向是必要而非充分条件：只有在商品催化剂与市场上行共振时，煤炭才能实现超额收益。每次沪指风险规避事件中，煤炭均可靠地排名倒数第一至第三；而在每次真正的商品重估窗口中，煤炭均跻身前一至二名。","top_signals":["QHD 5500kcal benchmark price approaching or above RMB 900/t on weakening trading volumes","Coal ranked #1-3 in Shenwan for 2+ consecutive months while SHCOMP has not set new highs","Sector dividend yield compressed below 4% as price rises outrun earnings","Beijing signalling capacity expansion (not reduction): state coal mine output mandates issued without corresponding demand growth"],"top_signals_zh":["秦港5500大卡基准价在量能萎缩背景下逼近或突破900元/吨","煤炭连续两个月以上居申万行业前三，但沪指未创新高","板块股息率因股价上涨压缩至4%以下","北京发出产能扩张信号（非去产能）：国有煤矿增产令下达且需求增长未能同步跟进"]},"801960":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Mar-2026 peak is the Jun-2022 peak: same post-geopolitical-crude-spike rollover into a growth/tech leadership rotation, with Oil & Gas going from a top-2 Shenwan leader to a bottom-3 laggard in a single cycle turn. In both cases the catalyst was a supply-shock crude spike (Russia-Ukraine/Brent $114 in 2022; Iran-Hormuz/Brent $120+ in 2026) followed by demand-destruction fears and a style-rotation from value/commodity into growth/tech as the supply premium deflated. The 2022 analog took 4.5 months to reach its trough (-21.8%); the current leg has already dropped -32.6% over roughly 4 months, suggesting trough proximity — but the key difference is the 2022 trough was resolved by a fundamental reopening catalyst (zero-COVID exit) whereas the current trough resolution requires either a Brent price floor re-anchoring above $85/bbl or a new PBOC/SOE re-rating policy catalyst.","analog_zh":"当前最接近的历史类比是2022年6月峰值：同为地缘政治推动原油价格急涨后的回调，石油天然气从申万行业前2名骤降至倒数3名之内。两轮行情的逻辑完全一致——供给冲击推动原油飙涨（2022年俄乌战争/布伦特114美元，2026年伊核战争/布伦特120美元以上），随后需求破坏担忧叠加成长/科技风格切换，供给溢价消散驱动资金从价值/商品撤离。2022年类比历时4.5个月触底（-21.8%）；当前腿已下跌32.6%，历时约4个月，筑底在即——但关键差异在于：2022年筑底是由退出动态清零这一根本性催化剂驱动，而当前筑底则需布伦特油价重新企稳于85美元/桶以上，或出现新一轮PBOC/国企政策重估催化。","bottom_signals":["Brent crude at multi-year lows ($60-70/bbl) or in rapid mean-reversion after a spike — sector has bottomed 1-4 months after crude trough","Oil & Gas ranked #25-31/31 in Shenwan for 2+ consecutive months, with growth/electronics leading by >15pp","PBOC policy pivot signals (RRR/LPR cuts) or State Council SOE dividend/buyback guidance — historically triggers re-rating of state energy SOEs","China oil import demand stabilization or strategic reserve refilling announcements alongside a Brent crude floor"],"bottom_signals_zh":["布伦特油价处于多年低位（60-70美元/桶）或急剧冲高后迅速回归均值——板块通常在原油低点后1-4个月内筑底","石油天然气在申万行业连续2个月以上排名第25-31/31，成长/电子领先超15个百分点","PBOC政策转向信号（降准/降息LPR）或国务院国企分红/回购指引——历史上是国有能源巨头重估的催化剂","中国石油进口需求企稳或战略储备补库声明，叠加布伦特油价见底确认"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["Global crude price direction (Brent/WTI) — primary earnings lever for PetroChina, CNOOC, Sinopec","China domestic oil demand cycle — zero-COVID shocks, reopening pulses, EV substitution acceleration","A-share value vs. growth style rotation (18pp+ swings driven by Fed/PBOC policy divergence)","PBOC/State Council SOE reform and dividend/market-value management policy cycles","Geopolitical supply shocks (Russia-Ukraine 2022, Iran-Hormuz 2026) driving crude spike/collapse cycles"],"drivers_zh":["全球原油价格方向（布伦特/WTI）——中石油、中海油、中石化盈利的首要驱动","中国国内石油需求周期——动态清零、重开脉冲、新能源车替代加速","A股价值/成长风格轮动（受美联储/PBOC政策分歧驱动，振幅超18个百分点）","PBOC/国务院国企改革与分红/市值管理政策周期","地缘政治供给冲击（2022年俄乌战争、2026年伊核战争）引发原油价格剧烈波动"],"median_cycle_months":9,"summary":"China Oil & Petrochem cycles are structurally governed by three interlocking forces: global crude price direction (Brent/WTI), China's domestic demand cycle (zero-COVID policy shocks, post-lockdown reopening pulses, accelerating EV substitution, and property sector health), and the A-share style rotation between value (banks/energy/cyclicals) and growth (tech/AI/electronics). When crude rises and value outperforms, the sector punches above its weight regardless of SHCOMP direction; when growth re-dominates or crude falls, energy becomes a confirmed Shenwan laggard. The sector trades as a high-beta commodity proxy on the SHCOMP with systematic value-rotation amplification: it outperforms in risk-off market falls only when those falls are growth-driven (not commodity-driven), and underperforms sharply whenever growth/tech style reasserts.","summary_zh":"石油石化板块的周期结构由三个力量主导：全球原油价格方向（布伦特/WTI）、中国国内需求周期（动态清零政策冲击、重开脉冲、新能源车替代加速、房地产周期）以及A股价值/成长风格轮动。油价上涨叠加价值风格主导时，板块超额收益显著；反之，成长风格回归或油价下跌时，板块在申万行业中沦为落后者。板块本质上是上证综指的高beta商品代理，具有系统性价值轮动放大效应：仅在市场下行由成长驱动（而非商品驱动）时才相对抗跌，成长/科技风格强势重回时则大幅跑输。","top_signals":["Brent crude approaching multi-year highs ($90-120/bbl) after a geopolitical supply shock — sector tends to peak within weeks of crude peak","Oil & Gas ranked #1-3/31 in Shenwan relative performance for multiple consecutive months, with value outperforming growth by >10pp","Consecutive limit-up sessions for PetroChina/CNOOC — historically mark speculative exhaustion within 1-4 weeks","Growth/tech style beginning to reassert (growth-minus-value flipping positive) while crude stalls near highs"],"top_signals_zh":["布伦特油价在地缘政治供给冲击后接近多年高点（90-120美元/桶）——板块通常在油价高点后数周内见顶","石油天然气连续多月在申万行业相对排名前1-3/31，且价值跑赢成长超10个百分点","中石油/中海油连续涨停——历史上往往是1-4周内见顶的投机衰竭信号","成长/科技风格开始重新主导（价值/成长轮动从负转正），同期原油价格停滞于高位"]},"801970":{"analog":"Closest to the 2022-07-22 post-peak selloff entry: today's setup rhymes with the exhaustion phase that followed the July 2022 cycle peak, when Environmental had completed a relative outperformance leg but then spent 18 months grinding lower as LGFV stress metastasized and no dedicated policy catalyst emerged. The current post-May-2026 peak environment shares the same three features: a completed beta rally (79% vs 9% prior), re-emerging local-government fiscal tightness, and a style rotation that has left Environmental behind in favor of AI/tech growth names - the key difference being the prior selloff's depth (-38%) was amplified by zero-COVID; this cycle's correction magnitude will depend on whether LGFV stress re-intensifies.","analog_zh":"与2022年7月22日顶部后下跌行情最为相似：环保完成一轮相对性反弹后，在缺乏专项政策催化、城投压力持续发酵的背景下进入长达18个月的磨底。当前2026年5月顶部后的环境呈现相同三大特征：贝塔行情已完成（本轮+79% vs 上轮+9%）、地方财政再度趋紧、风格轮动转向AI/科技成长令环保落于领涨之外。关键差异在于：上轮-38%跌幅被新冠封控所放大，本轮回调幅度将取决于城投压力是否重新激化。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP reaches a multi-year low with national team intervention (Central Huijin ETF buying) announced","Environmental underperforms even defensives (ranks 24+/31) while LGFV payment stress is widely reported - exhaustion of sellers","PBOC delivers simultaneous multi-instrument easing (RRR + MLF + swap facility) signaling a liquidity regime shift"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指触及多年低点，国家队（中央汇金）ETF入市消息公告","环保甚至跑输防御板块（申万排名倒数）、LGFV回款压力广泛报道——卖方力量衰竭","央行同步推出多工具宽松（降准+MLF+互换便利），信号流动性机制切换"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC rate-cut / RRR-cut liquidity cycles (broad beta driver)","National team / Central Huijin ETF buying (market rescue trigger)","LGFV and local-government fiscal health (PPP payment chain)","Environmental policy credibility (ETS launches, Five-Year Plan mandates)","Property sector revenue cycle (municipal budget capacity)","Value-vs-growth style rotation within SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["央行降息/降准流动性周期（大盘贝塔驱动）","国家队/中央汇金ETF入市（市场救援触发器）","城投与地方财政健康度（PPP回款传导链）","环保政策信用度（碳市场启动、五年规划支出指引）","房地产收入周期（地方政府财政容量）","上证综指内部价值/成长风格轮动"],"median_cycle_months":22.9,"summary":"Environmental (801970) cycles as a hybrid between a policy-gated infrastructure play and an LGFV-credit-sensitive quasi-utility sector. Its rallies are triggered by two recurring forces: (1) broad A-share beta waves when PBOC liquidity floods or national team buying lifts all cyclicals, and (2) environmental policy credibility inflections (carbon ETS launches, Five-Year Plan spending mandates) that attract relative flows in value-rotation tapes. Its selloffs are structurally amplified by LGFV/local-government fiscal stress - when property revenue collapses, municipal payment delays cascade through the PPP operators that dominate the sector, causing Environmental to underperform even the broad index drawdown. The sector consistently ranks mid-pack (9-14/31) in cyclical rallies but can fall to 24/31 in risk-off selloffs, reflecting asymmetric beta to local-government fiscal health.","summary_zh":"环保板块（801970）兼具政策驱动基础设施主题与城投信用敏感类公用事业的双重周期属性。其上涨周期由两类力量触发：（1）大盘贝塔行情——当央行降准/国家队大规模入市引发流动性泛滥时，所有周期股受益上涨；（2）环保政策信用拐点——碳市场启动、五年规划支出指引等在价值风格主导行情中引发相对增量资金流入。其下跌行情在结构上被LGFV/地方财政压力所放大：当土地出让收入骤降，市政付款拖延沿PPP产业链传导至运营商，致使环保板块跌幅超过大盘。环保在周期性上涨行情中通常排名中段（第9-14），在风险规避抛售中可跌至第24，呈现出对地方政府财政健康度的非对称贝塔特征。","top_signals":["Environmental peaks when it has surged 60-80%+ from trough yet SHCOMP momentum is stalling and growth/tech leadership narrows to a few names","LGFV stress re-emerges (payment deadline extensions, local bond spread widening) after a stimulus-driven beta peak","Policy silence: no new Five-Year Plan environmental spending mandate or ETS expansion announced after a major rally"],"top_signals_zh":["环保自低点涨幅达60-80%以上、上证综指动能趋弱且成长/科技领涨行情收窄时，板块见顶信号增强","刺激驱动贝塔高点后城投压力再现（付款延期、地方债利差走阔）","政策真空：大涨后无新的五年规划环保支出指引或碳市场扩容政策出台"]},"801980":{"analog":"Closest to the Feb 2023-Feb 2024 trough formation: same deflationary consumption trap (CPI near zero), same structural growth-over-value rotation absorbing all SHCOMP liquidity, and same pattern of Beauty sitting dead last for two consecutive legs with no sector-specific policy support. The 2023-24 selloff ended only when the national team intervened with ETF buying (Feb 5, 2024); the current leg ends when either Beijing announces a targeted consumption/beauty sector stimulus or the AI-infrastructure rally exhausts and rotation forces a catch-up in the most-lagging consumer names — as happened in Oct 2024 after the 9.24 blitz.","analog_zh":"与2023年2月至2024年2月的见底形态最为相似：同样的通缩性消费陷阱（CPI近零）、同样的成长相对价值结构性轮动吸走所有上证综指流动性、且美容护理连续两轮垫底无板块特定政策支撑。2023-24年那轮下跌直至2024年2月5日国家队ETF入场才结束；当前轮次的终结条件是：北京宣布消费专项刺激，或AI基础设施行情见顶后资金被迫轮回至超跌消费品种（正如2024年九二四后所发生的那样）。","bottom_signals":["Beauty ranked #31/31 for two consecutive legs with CPI in deflation and property sales still contracting","Growth-over-value style spread >20pp sustained for 6+ months while Beauty lags by 30%+ vs SHCOMP","Beauty retail sales contracting YoY for multiple consecutive months with no policy catalyst on horizon"],"bottom_signals_zh":["美容护理连续两轮排名第31/31，CPI通缩且房地产销售持续萎缩","成长相对价值风格利差>20个百分点持续6个月以上，美容护理累计跑输上证综指30%+","美妆零售连续多月同比负增长且前方无政策催化剂"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing stimulus policy pivot cycle (RRR/LPR/Politburo)","Domestic consumption confidence and CPI cycle","Property wealth effect (negative = beauty sell, positive = beauty buy)","Shenwan style rotation: growth/AI vs consumer/value","Margin/leverage cycle on A-shares (amplifies both legs)"],"drivers_zh":["北京刺激政策转向周期（降准/LPR/政治局）","国内消费信心与CPI周期","房地产财富效应（负面=抛售美容，正面=买入美容）","申万风格轮动：成长/AI vs 消费/价值","A股两融杠杆周期（放大双向波动）"],"median_cycle_months":8,"summary":"Beauty & Care cycles structurally as a high-beta, optionality-on-consumer-confidence play whose turns are dictated almost entirely by three forces: (1) Beijing's policy pivot cycle — stimulus announcements compress decades of underperformance in weeks (Sep 2024 +58% in 15 days); (2) the consumption-confidence cycle — when CPI is positive and households feel wealth effects from property and employment, Beauty leads consumer discretionary; when deflation bites and property wealth erodes, Beauty is the first name sold; (3) style rotation between growth/AI themes and value/consumer names on the SHCOMP — when tech themes dominate liquidity (2021-22 coal, 2025 AI), Beauty lags structurally even in up-markets. The sector has no commodity-price floor, no dividend support, and heavy reliance on discretionary spend, making it the highest-volatility non-leveraged sector in the Shenwan universe over this period.","summary_zh":"美容护理周期本质上是消费信心的高弹性期权：其转折点几乎完全由三大力量决定：（1）北京政策转向周期——刺激宣告可将多年跌幅在数周内压缩（2024年9月+58%历时15天）；（2）消费信心周期——CPI为正且居民有地产/就业财富效应时美容领涨消费，通缩+地产财富缩水时率先被抛售；（3）上证综指成长/AI主题与价值/消费风格的资金轮动——科技主题吸收流动性时（2021-22年煤炭，2025年AI），美容护理即使在上涨市场中也结构性落后。该板块无大宗商品价格托底、无高股息保护，高度依赖可选消费支出，是本周期申万宇宙中波动率最高的非杠杆板块之一。","top_signals":["SHCOMP at multi-year high with growth/AI style premium >15pp while Beauty leads sector rankings (as in Oct 2024 after 9.24 blitz)","Stimulus announcement with real monetary easing (RRR+LPR+Politburo combination) — Beauty front-runs and over-extends within days","Beauty ranked #1-5/31 with defensives lagging — euphoric consumer reopening or stimulus-flush positioning"],"top_signals_zh":["上证综指处于多年高位，成长相对价值溢价>15个百分点，且美容护理领跑行业排名（如2024年10月九二四后）","刺激政策同步落地（降准+降息+政治局组合拳）——美容护理在数日内领涨过度拉伸","美容护理排名第1-5/31，防御类落后——反映消费复苏预期狂热或刺激冲击下的拥挤仓位"]},"b-cn_ai_compute":{"analog":"Closest to the Apr-2022 trough and subsequent supercycle (Leg 3, Apr 2022 to Jun 2023, +247.5%): both legs were launched from a macro-shock-induced selloff (tariff shock in 2025, COVID lockdown in 2022) into a policy-driven liquidity reboot (15th Five-Year Plan AI mandate in 2025, fiscal stimulus and zero-COVID exit in 2022) combined with a concurrent AI narrative catalyst (Huawei Ascend self-reliance in 2025, ChatGPT global frenzy in 2023). In both cases, Telecoms, Electronics, and Computers led Shenwan by 40-72pp over value, and the basket delivered multiples of the SHCOMP return. The key difference is scale: the current leg (460%+) has already far exceeded the 2022-23 run (247.5%), suggesting either that the structural demand base (800G module revenues, government mandate spending) is larger, or that the tape is at greater risk of a narrowing rotation as the cycle matures.","analog_zh":"与2022年4月触底后的超级行情（第三段，2022年4月至2023年6月，+247.5%）最为相似：两段行情均从宏观冲击引发的下跌（2025年为关税冲击，2022年为清零封控）中启动，随即迎来政策驱动的流动性重启（2025年为十五五规划AI算力强制目标，2022年为财政刺激与清零退出），并叠加AI叙事催化剂（2025年为华为昇腾国产自强，2023年为ChatGPT全球热潮）。两次行情中，通信、电子、计算机均以40-72个百分点的成长溢价领涨申万，板块收益率均为上证综指涨幅的数倍。最大差异在于规模：当前行情（460%+）已远超2022-23年行情（247.5%），意味着或许结构性需求基础（800G模块营收、政府强制投入）更为厚实，或意味着随着周期成熟、轮动收窄的风险正在加大。","bottom_signals":["Defensive sectors (Coal, Banks, Utilities) lead Shenwan while Electronics/Computers are the worst laggards (flight-to-safety confirmed)","SHCOMP draws down 15%+ with value leading growth by 15pp or more","Beijing announces policy catalyst: RRR cut, fiscal stimulus, or AI infrastructure mandate","Global AI capex guidance from hyperscalers re-accelerates optical module order flow"],"bottom_signals_zh":["煤炭、银行、公用事业等防御板块领涨申万，电子/计算机垫底（确认避险轮动）","上证综指下跌15%以上，价值跑赢成长15个百分点或以上","北京发布政策催化剂：降准、财政刺激或AI基础设施投资强制指引","超大规模云厂商AI资本开支指引上调，光模块订单重新加速"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing semiconductor self-reliance policy and Big Fund deployment","Global AI capex cycle and 800G/1.6T optical module order flow","SHCOMP risk-on/risk-off rotation growth vs value spread","PBOC monetary easing and liquidity injections","US export controls and domestic substitution urgency"],"drivers_zh":["北京半导体自主化政策及大基金布局","全球AI资本开支周期与800G/1.6T光模块订单流","上证综指风险偏好转换（成长/价值利差）","央行宽松货币政策与流动性投放","美国出口管制加速国产替代需求"],"median_cycle_months":17,"summary":"AI Compute and Optics cycles on a three-layered structural engine: (1) Beijing policy liquidity injections and technology self-reliance mandates that directly fund STAR Market chip and optics names; (2) the global AI capex cycle, which drives 800G/1.6T optical module and data-center silicon orders to Chinese manufacturers who dominate 55%+ of the global market; and (3) A-share growth-versus-value style rotation, where the basket is the highest-beta expression of growth-on-SHCOMP -- it rallies hardest when the SHCOMP rises in a risk-on tape (cyclicals over defensives, growth over value 40-72pp) and corrects most violently when the market turns defensive. Structurally, each trough has been set by a macro shock (Fed tightening, geopolitical risk, property crisis, tariff shock) that flips the rotation to defensive/value, and each peak has been set when AI narrative or policy euphoria has fully priced in and the rotation begins to narrow. Median peak-to-peak cycle is 17 months.","summary_zh":"AI算力与光模块板块的周期运行由三重结构性引擎驱动：一是北京政策资金注入与科技自主化强制目标，直接为STAR市场芯片及光器件名称提供资本弹药；二是全球AI资本开支周期，推动800G/1.6T光模块及数据中心硅器件订单流向已占据全球55%以上市场份额的中国制造商；三是A股成长/价值风格轮动，本板块是上证综指成长风格的最高贝塔表达——行情风险偏好抬升（周期跑赢防御、成长跑赢价值40-72个百分点）时弹性最强，市场转入防御时跌幅最深。每一轮底部均由宏观冲击触发（美联储紧缩、地缘风险、地产危机、关税冲击），令轮动转向防御/价值；每一轮顶部均在AI叙事或政策预期充分定价、轮动开始收窄时形成。峰峰中位周期约17个月。","top_signals":["Growth-over-value spread narrows below 20pp after a 40pp+ leg (rotation exhaustion)","AI narrative stocks flagged for abnormal trading by Shanghai or Shenzhen exchanges","Defensives (Agriculture, Food and Bev, Utilities) begin outperforming cyclicals on a rolling 4-week basis","SHCOMP reverses from a policy-euphoria spike without sustaining gains above prior resistance"],"top_signals_zh":["经历40pp+的成长行情后，成长/价值利差收窄至20pp以下（轮动衰竭）","AI概念股因异常交易被上交所或深交所发出问询函","防御板块（农业、食品饮料、公用事业）开始在4周滚动区间内跑赢周期板块","上证综指在政策预期催生的急涨后无法持续守住前期阻力位"]},"b-cn_appliances":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Jun-2024 selloff trough (2024-07-25) entry setup: the Oct-2022 bottom (2022-10-31). Both troughs share three structural features — SHCOMP down double-digits from a prior peak, rs_rank in the lower quartile of the Shenwan universe, and sector trading below its 200-day MA. Both also occurred during periods where the preceding negative catalyst (property mortgage-boycott wave in 2022; deflation/Third-Plenum-disappointment in 2024) had fully crystallized in price while a policy reversal was building beneath the surface. The key difference: the 2022-10-31 bottom was followed by a once-in-a-decade 103% leg because the COVID-zero exit was a structural demand unlock not merely a cyclical bounce. The current 2025-present bottoming phase has analogous potential via the 以旧换新 continuation and possible property-market stabilization, but the US tariff overhang and growth/AI rotation create a higher bar for leadership to re-emerge.","analog_zh":"与当前设置最接近的历史原型：2022年10月31日底部。两个低点均呈现三大共同特征：上证综指从前高深度回调、板块申万排名处于末位四分位、股价低于200日均线。二者前期负面催化剂（2022年断供潮、2024年通缩/三中全会预期落空）均已在价格层面充分反映，政策底蓄势待发。核心差异在于：2022年10月31日触底后，新冠清零退出带来了结构性需求解锁而非纯粹周期反弹，推动板块实现历史性的103%涨幅。当前以旧换新补贴延续及地产企稳可能提供类似支撑，但美国关税压制和成长/AI风格轮动吸血使家电重获领涨地位的门槛明显更高。","bottom_signals":["Sector ranks in bottom quartile of Shenwan universe (rs_rank <= 8/31) with price below 200-day MA (current setup)","Growth-minus-value spread exceeds +20pp for sustained period (liquidity exhausted in growth, value mean-reversion near)","Beijing announces incremental trade-in subsidy expansion or LPR cut within 1-2 months of cyclical trough in index"],"bottom_signals_zh":["板块申万排名处于末位四分位（rs_rank≤8/31）且股价低于200日均线（当前状态）","成长/价值利差持续超+20pp（成长流动性耗尽，价值均值回归临近）","北京在指数周期底部后1-2个月内宣布追加以旧换新补贴或下调LPR"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["China property cycle (renovation/household-formation demand linkage)","Beijing consumption stimulus policy (LPR cuts, trade-in subsidies 以旧换新)","A-share style rotation (value vs growth, growth-minus-value spread)","Global risk-on/risk-off and Fed rate-cycle spillover via yuan pressure","US tariff cycle on white-goods exports (Midea/Haier North America exposure)"],"drivers_zh":["中国地产周期（装修/置业需求联动）","北京消费刺激政策（LPR下调、以旧换新补贴）","A股风格轮动（价值vs成长，成长/价值利差信号）","全球风险偏好与美联储加息周期溢出（经由人民币汇率传导）","美国对华白色家电关税周期（美的/海尔北美业务敞口）"],"median_cycle_months":15.4,"summary":"Home Appliances (cn_appliances) cycles structurally on three interlocking engines: (1) the China property cycle — renovation and household-formation demand creates sharp peaks when property is stable/recovering and troughs when the sector contracts or triggers mortgage crises; (2) Beijing consumption-stimulus policy pulses — LPR cuts, trade-in subsidy programs (以旧换新), and consumer-goods vouchers create step-function demand inflections that the sector, as a policy-sensitive consumer-discretionary, amplifies directly; and (3) A-share style rotation — the sector is a value/dividend play (Midea/Haier/Gree carry 40-60% dividend payout ratios) that outperforms during value/policy-recovery regimes and deeply underperforms when liquidity floods into growth/tech themes, making the Shenwan growth-minus-value spread a leading indicator of relative momentum. Peaks cluster when prior catalysts are priced, consumer confidence stalls, or growth/tech narratives dominate; troughs occur when policy response is priced in at the index bottom and the sector benefits from both beta recovery and specific subsidy catalysts.","summary_zh":"家电板块（cn_appliances）的周期结构由三大引擎共同驱动：（1）中国地产周期——地产稳定/复苏时装修及置业需求推动板块见顶，地产下行或引发断供危机时板块同步筑底；（2）北京消费刺激政策脉冲——LPR下调、以旧换新补贴及消费券等政策推出，为该板块带来阶跃式需求拐点；（3）A股风格轮动——家电是典型的价值/红利品种（美的/海尔/格力股息支付率40-60%），价值/政策复苏风格占优时领涨，成长/科技主题主导时则深度跑输，申万成长/价值利差是家电相对动量的前瞻指标。板块见顶往往出现在前期催化剂充分定价、消费信心停滞或成长/科技叙事主导之时；底部确立则常伴随政策底在指数层面被定价，板块同时受益于beta修复与专项补贴催化的双重驱动。","top_signals":["Growth-minus-value spread compresses to below +5pp after sustained growth leadership (style reversal imminent)","Trade-in policy or property-support announcements arrive after 15-20%+ prior decline (stimulus has maximum lift when sector is already depressed)","Sector re-rates to P/E above 20x or relative P/E premium versus SHCOMP broad >1.3x (priced for perfection)"],"top_signals_zh":["成长/价值利差在持续成长行情后收窄至+5pp以下（风格切换信号）","以旧换新或地产托底政策在前期涨幅15-20%+后出现（刺激政策在板块低位时拉动效果最大）","板块估值升至市盈率20倍以上，或相对上证综指估值溢价超1.3倍（利多完全定价）"]},"b-cn_autos":{"analog":"Closest to the Aug-2022 selloff peak (2022-08-01 leg): same structure of sector rallying into a policy/stimulus peak (2022: purchase-tax cut; 2025: record NEV sales + PBOC bazooka), then hitting a post-peak air-pocket as the policy catalyst exhausts and a style rotation away from the sector accelerates — in 2022 the rotation was growth-to-value, today it is Autos-to-AI. Both legs saw the sector rank among the worst Shenwan performers while the index itself remained relatively contained. The Aug-2022 leg took 3 months and -27.4% to find a durable trough; the current leg is already 9 months and -26.1%, suggesting the washout may be maturing.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月峰值腿（2022-08-01起）最为相似：同样是板块在政策/刺激达到顶峰后（2022年为购置税减半，2025年为新能源销量创纪录+央行放水）出现见顶，随后在政策催化力衰竭、风格轮动加速离场的背景下进入震荡下行——2022年是成长转价值，当前是汽车转AI。两轮行情均呈现板块沦为申万最弱板块之一、而指数整体相对平稳的特征。2022年8月那轮历时3个月、跌幅-27.4%方才筑底；当前这轮已历时9个月、累计-26.1%，底部洗盘或已进入尾声。","bottom_signals":["Autos rank in bottom-5 of 31 Shenwan sectors while SHCOMP is stabilizing or recovering","NEV purchase-tax cliff/hangover fully absorbed into YoY comparables (2-3 months post cut)","State Council announces new purchase-tax cut or subsidy top-up package","PBOC monetary easing signal (RRR or LPR cut) combined with stabilizing upstream lithium prices"],"bottom_signals_zh":["汽车板块连续位列申万31行业后五，同期上证指数逐步稳定或修复","新能源购置税悬崖效应充分反映入同比基数（政策切换后2-3个月）","国务院宣布新一轮购置税减免或补贴加码方案","央行宽松信号（降准或降息）叠加上游碳酸锂价格企稳"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing NEV subsidy and purchase-tax policy cycle","SHCOMP broad-beta growth amplification","COVID/supply-chain production shocks","China vehicle export volume growth cycle","PBOC monetary easing / tightening cycles","NEV penetration rate and price-war intensity"],"drivers_zh":["北京新能源补贴及购置税政策周期","上证宽基成长Beta放大效应","新冠/供应链产量冲击","中国整车出口量增长周期","央行货币宽松/收紧周期","新能源渗透率与价格战激烈程度"],"median_cycle_months":14,"summary":"Autos & NEV Makers cycles on the intersection of three recurring forces: (1) Beijing's policy pulse — NEV subsidies, purchase-tax cuts, and carbon mandates set the fundamental demand floor; when policy turns supportive the sector leads; when it withdraws (subsidy cliffs, tax-exemption step-downs) the hangover is severe. (2) SHCOMP broad-beta amplification — the sector carries a high growth-beta and behaves as a leveraged version of the index; in bull markets it outperforms, in bear markets it underperforms disproportionately. (3) Exogenous supply shocks — COVID lockdowns (2022 Shanghai), chip shortages, and geopolitical events (Pelosi Taiwan visit, 20th Party Congress) can abruptly truncate rallies by hitting production volumes. Cycle turns tend to be sharp and policy-dated rather than gradual.","summary_zh":"汽车整车板块的周期性由三股周期性力量交织驱动：（1）北京政策节奏——新能源补贴、购置税减免及碳达峰政策奠定基本面需求底部，政策转为宽松时板块往往领涨，政策收紧（补贴悬崖、购置税减半）时则面临严重的后续调整；（2）上证宽基Beta放大效应——板块具有较高的成长Beta属性，表现为指数的杠杆版本，牛市超涨、熊市超跌；（3）外生供给冲击——新冠封控（2022年上海）、芯片短缺、地缘政治事件（佩洛西访台、二十大）可骤然截断反弹，直接打击产量。周期拐点往往政策时点清晰、转折迅速而非渐进式演变。","top_signals":["Autos rank in top-5 of 31 Shenwan sectors for 3+ consecutive months while SHCOMP is extended","Monthly NEV sales hitting new records concurrently with subsidy-policy peak (approaching expiry)","Broad policy shift from 'expand subsidy' to 'taper subsidy' announced by State Council","Export volumes reaching monthly records while EU/US tariff risk is escalating"],"top_signals_zh":["汽车板块连续3个月以上位列申万31行业前五，同期上证指数明显拉伸","月度新能源销量创历史新高，同时补贴政策处于顶峰（临近到期）","国务院宣布补贴政策由扩大转向收缩","出口量创月度纪录，同时欧美关税风险持续升温"]},"b-cn_baijiu":{"analog":"Closest to the January 2023 to January 2024 trough leg: same structural combination of deflationary consumption disappointment, channel inventory bloat, and capital flowing into SOE-value/tech themes rather than premium-brand consumer staples. Both legs feature a SHCOMP that is roughly flat while baijiu underperforms by 30-43pp, with no defensive bid (defensives also negative in the 2023-24 leg), confirming the selloff is sector-structural rather than macro risk-off. The 2023 leg lasted 12 months and printed -33.8%; the current leg (Aug 2025-present) is already 10 months old with -43.4% erased. The key difference is the 2025-26 leg is additionally penalised by the widest growth-vs-value style gap in the series (26.3pp), suggesting a deeper structural re-rating. Historical precedent implies proximity to a trough but absent a clear liquidity/policy catalyst (PBOC bazooka or major consumption stimulus), reversal could remain muted.","analog_zh":"与2023年1月至2024年1月底部腿最为相近：同样呈现通缩型消费落空、渠道库存积压与资金流入国企价值/科技主题而非高端消费品牌的结构性组合。两段腿均为沪综指持平而白酒跑输30-43pp，且防御亦为负收益，印证回调为板块结构性问题而非宏观风险规避。2023年那段腿历时12个月，跌幅-33.8%；当前腿（2025年8月至今）已运行约10个月，跌幅-43.4%。关键差异在于2025-26腿叠加了本系列最宽的成长-价值风格利差（26.3pp），暗示更深的结构性重估。历史规律提示接近底部，但在明确的流动性/政策催化剂（央行放水或重大消费刺激）出现之前，反转力度或较为有限。","bottom_signals":["Baijiu underperforms SHCOMP by 30pp+ over a 6-month window despite index stability (structural selling distinct from macro risk-off)","Food & Bev is the worst or second-worst Shenwan laggard while Banks/Coal/Utilities/Telecoms hold positive or flat","Growth-minus-value style spread exceeds 20pp in favour of tech/AI while SHCOMP is flat-to-positive (capital rotating to tech, not fleeing macro risk)","Industry annual reports confirm universal revenue/profit declines; wholesale Feitian price off 25%+ from peak; channel inventory turnover beyond 12 months"],"bottom_signals_zh":["白酒在指数稳定期6个月内跑输沪综指30pp以上（结构性抛售，有别于宏观风险规避）","食品饮料为申万最差或第二差行业，而银行/煤炭/公用事业/通信持平或守正","成长-价值利差在科技/AI主导下超过20pp而沪综指持平至微涨（资金流向科技而非因恐慌出走）","行业年报确认营收/净利普跌；飞天批价从峰值下跌25%以上；渠道库存消化周期超过12个月"],"confidence":"high","drivers":["SHCOMP liquidity cycle (broad market beta amplifier, both directions)","China consumption-confidence regime (zero-COVID cycles, reopening, property wealth effects)","Growth vs value style cycle (AI/tech vs quality-franchise multiples)","PBOC and fiscal policy shock timing (RRR cuts, LPR cuts, stabilisation funds)","Channel inventory cycle (accumulation at peaks, destocking at troughs)","Anti-corruption and banquet suppression policy waves"],"drivers_zh":["沪综指流动性周期（宽基市场贝塔放大器，双向均有效）","中国消费信心体制（清零周期、重启、房产财富效应）","成长-价值风格周期（AI/科技 vs 品质品牌溢价）","人民银行与财政政策冲击时机（降准、LPR降息、平准基金）","渠道库存周期（峰值积累，底部去化）","反腐与压制宴请政策波浪"],"median_cycle_months":7,"summary":"Baijiu is the quintessential Chinese consumption-confidence cycle amplifier: it delivers outsized beta to every SHCOMP liquidity inflection, rallying hardest when zero-COVID lifted (+50% in Oct-22), PBOC fired a bazooka (+50% in Sep-24), or national-team support stabilised the floor (+26% in Jan-24). It sells off most violently when macro confidence collapses (property mortgage boycott 2022, deflation 2023, fiscal disappointment 2024). The recurring causal engine is the interplay between the SHCOMP broad liquidity cycle and China's domestic consumption-confidence regime: high franchise multiples give baijiu outsized beta in both directions. The second recurring driver is style rotation: baijiu underperforms severely whenever growth-tech themes (AI chips, defence, green energy) command a 10pp+ style premium over value, as was true in mid-2021, mid-2022, and most acutely in 2025-2026. Bottom formations consistently coincide with maximum pessimism on consumption after a major macro shock has already been absorbed by price.","summary_zh":"白酒是中国消费信心周期的典型放大器，对沪综指每次流动性拐点均有超额贝塔响应：清零解封时领涨（+50%，2022年10月）、央行重磅放水时领涨（+50%，2024年9月）、国家队托底时领涨（+26%，2024年1月），宏观信心崩塌时（2022年停贷潮、2023年通缩、2024年财政落空）则跌幅同样最为惨烈。循环因果引擎在于沪综指流动性周期与中国国内消费信心体制的共振：高品牌溢价估值赋予其双向超额贝塔。第二个循环驱动力为风格轮动：只要成长/科技主题（AI芯片、军工、绿能）形成10pp以上的风格溢价，白酒就会严重跑输，2021年中、2022年中及2025-2026年尤为明显。底部形成规律是：主要宏观冲击被价格消化后，消费悲观情绪达到极值之际，下一轮急速重估随即蓄势待发。","top_signals":["Baijiu outperforms SHCOMP by 20pp+ during a broad liquidity rally (euphoric beta overshoot)","Food & Bev becomes the #1 or #2 Shenwan sector in a consumption re-rating window with defensives outperforming cyclicals","Growth-minus-value style spread collapses to flat or negative while SHCOMP rallies — consumption/defensive plays dominate flows","Zero-COVID exit, major RRR/LPR cut, or national-team intervention announced — front-running drives rapid overshoot past fundamental value"],"top_signals_zh":["白酒在宽基流动性行情中跑赢沪综指20pp以上（欣快贝塔超涨）","食品饮料跃居申万第一或第二大行业，出现消费重估窗口且防御跑赢周期","成长-价值利差在沪综指上涨时塌缩至平或负——消费/防御标的主导资金流","清零退出、重大降准/LPR降息或国家队干预公告——提前布局引发超越基本面的快速超涨"]},"b-cn_banks":{"analog":"Closest analog is the 2014-2015 China bank rally: same extreme PB compression (big-four at 0.4-0.6x), same asset-famine logic as short-end rates were cut and WMP yields fell, same state-directed credit expansion narrative, and same eventual peak when the broader market liquidity surge reversed and growth/tech (2015 ChiNext bubble) absorbed all incremental flows. The current post-peak setup - banks lagging a growth/tech tape by 18pp while sitting -7% off peak - rhymes directly with mid-2015 when the ChiNext mania crowded out the dividend trade before the eventual August 2015 crash restored the defensive bid.","analog_zh":"最相近的历史情景为2014-2015年银行行情：同为极端低市净率（四大行0.4-0.6倍）、同为资产荒逻辑（短端利率下调、理财产品收益率下行）、同为国家主导信贷扩张叙事，最终同样在更广泛的流动性行情逆转、成长/科技（2015年创业板泡沫）吸干边际资金后见顶。当前峰后格局——银行落后成长/科技板块18个百分点、较峰值回调7%——与2015年中创业板狂热令高股息交易被挤出如出一辙，彼时最终以2015年8月大跌收场并重燃防御买盘。","bottom_signals":["A-share bank PB at 0.4-0.5x with dividend yield at 7-9%","PBOC RRR cut or LPR reduction signal following credit slowdown","CGB 10yr yield at historical lows (sub-2%) widening spread","SHCOMP in sustained bear phase while Telecoms/Utilities lead defensively"],"bottom_signals_zh":["A股银行市净率跌至0.4-0.5倍，股息率升至7-9%","信贷增速放缓后人民银行降准或下调LPR信号","10年期国债收益率跌至历史低位（低于2%）推升利差","上证综指持续熊市而通信/公用事业领跑防御格局"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["CGB yield level vs bank dividend yield spread (asset-famine driver)","PBOC RRR/LPR policy cycle and state capital injection","Property sector health (NPL risk and credit demand)","SHCOMP macro regime: risk-on growth vs risk-off value rotation","Beijing directed lending mandates and NIM compression cycles"],"drivers_zh":["国债收益率与银行股息率价差（资产荒驱动）","人民银行降准/降息政策周期及国家注资","房地产行业健康度（不良贷款风险与信贷需求）","上证综指宏观情景：风险偏好成长轮动vs防御价值轮动","北京定向信贷指令与净息差压缩周期"],"median_cycle_months":49,"summary":"China Banks cycle structurally on the tension between two forces: the SHCOMP macro regime (risk-on liquidity surges rotate money into growth/tech, leaving banks as laggards; risk-off or bond-yield compression rotates money into the high-dividend value play) and Beijing policy cycles (RRR/LPR cuts, capital injections, and directed lending mandates directly alter NIMs, credit volume, and dividend capacity). Peaks occur when the dividend-yield spread over CGB narrows - either because bond yields rise or bank stocks have fully re-rated. Troughs occur when PB falls to extreme lows (0.4-0.5x), dividend yields reach 7-9%, and the PBOC pivots to easing. The sector consistently outperforms in weak-SHCOMP / asset-famine environments and sharply underperforms when growth/tech themes command liquidity.","summary_zh":"中国银行板块的周期性本质由两股力量的张力决定：一是上证综指宏观情景（流动性驱动成长/科技行情时资金撤离银行，风险规避或债券收益率下压时资金重返高股息价值标的）；二是北京政策周期（降准/降息、注资及定向信贷指令直接影响净息差、信贷规模与分红能力）。顶部出现于银行股息率与国债利差收窄之时（债券利率上行或股价充分重估）；底部出现于市净率极端低估（0.4-0.5倍）、股息率高达7-9%、人民银行转向宽松之时。该板块在上证弱势/资产荒环境下持续跑赢，而成长/科技主题占主导时则明显跑输。","top_signals":["Bank dividend yield spread over 10yr CGB narrows below 200bp","PB ratio re-rates above 0.7-0.8x as value-buyers exhaust","Growth/tech sectors command 15pp+ style premium - rotation risk peaks","PBOC signals rate hike cycle or liquidity withdrawal"],"top_signals_zh":["银行股息率与10年期国债利差收窄至200bp以下","市净率回升至0.7-0.8倍以上，价值型买盘趋于饱和","成长/科技板块风格溢价超15个百分点，轮动风险升至峰值","人民银行释放加息或流动性收紧信号"]},"b-cn_battery":{"analog":"Closest analog to the Oct 2024-Apr 2025 selloff-then-bottom: the Nov 2021-Apr 2022 leg — both are macro-shock-driven (Fed rate hike then, Trump tariff escalation now), both saw a 25% drawdown with defensives outperforming cyclicals, and both bottomed on a specific external-shock capitulation date that preceded a >60% recovery. The current Jun 2026 bottoming phase, post the May 2026 peak, most closely rhymes with the Jul 2022 early-stage of the 2022-2024 structural bear — same lithium carbonate price-rollover setup, same inventory accumulation signal, same defensive/telecom rotation — though the current cycle's upstream pricing (still above 150,000 yuan/tonne vs sub-80,000 in 2023-2024) and policy support (energy storage mandates, solid-state battery commercialization roadmap) argue for a shallower and shorter correction than the 19-month 65% bear of 2022-2024.","analog_zh":"当前2026年5月见顶后的磨底阶段，与2024年11月至2025年4月的下跌腿最为相似——同为宏观冲击（彼时特朗普关税升级、当前碳酸锂价格高位回落），同样出现约25%的回调且防御股跑赢周期股，随后均有一个明确外部冲击资本投降日触发强力反弹。但也需与2022年7月初的熊市起点相比较：碳酸锂价格见顶回落、库存积压上升、通信/防御轮动——结构相似。不过当前锂价（仍在15万元/吨以上，远高于2023-2024年底部8万元/吨）以及政策支撑（储能强制配套、固态电池商业化路线图）表明，本轮调整深度和持续时间应显著小于2022-2024年那轮19个月65%的结构性熊市。","bottom_signals":["Lithium carbonate price below 80,000 yuan/tonne with evidence of marginal-cost floor (mine shutdowns)","Battery & Lithium at 10th-or-below percentile position, below 200-day MA, rs_rank bottom-quartile","Defensive sectors (Banks, Utilities) sole positive Shenwan industry while cyclicals broadly negative","Government policy catalyst: sovereign-fund ETF buying, RRR cut, or NEV subsidy/tax extension announcement"],"bottom_signals_zh":["碳酸锂价格跌至8万元/吨以下，出现边际成本底（矿山关停信号）","锂电池板块位置处于10百分位以下，低于200日均线，强度排名处于末四分位","银行、公用事业等防御板块是申万唯一正收益行业，周期股全面下跌","政策催化剂：国家队增持ETF、央行降准，或新能源车补贴/购置税减免政策出台"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["lithium carbonate commodity price cycle (supply glut vs deficit)","Beijing NEV/energy-storage industrial policy (subsidies, tax breaks, mandates)","A-share growth-style liquidity beta (SHCOMP risk-on/off rotation)","US-China trade and tariff policy (EV/battery export access)","battery technology step-change catalysts (solid-state, sodium-ion threat)"],"drivers_zh":["碳酸锂大宗商品价格周期（供给过剩与短缺轮动）","北京新能源/储能产业政策（补贴、税收减免、强制指标）","A股成长风格流动性贝塔（上证风险偏好轮动）","中美贸易与关税政策（新能源车/电池出口准入）","电池技术突破性催化（固态电池、钠离子电池替代威胁）"],"median_cycle_months":13,"summary":"Battery & Lithium cycles in A-shares are primarily driven by the INTERSECTION of three forces: (1) the lithium carbonate commodity supercycle (supply glut vs deficit swings spanning 18-24 months), (2) Beijing's industrial and EV policy calendar (subsidies, dual-carbon directives, purchase-tax incentives, energy storage plans), and (3) A-share growth-style beta — when SHCOMP is in a risk-on/liquidity-driven growth tape (electronics/计算机/电新 in the lead), Battery & Lithium amplifies the index move by 3-5x; when the tape shifts to value/defensives, it underperforms by the same magnitude. The result is extreme amplitude cycles: the six rally legs average +75% and the four selloff legs average -41%, with a secular arc from clean-energy-driven re-rating (2021-2022) to structural oversupply bear (2022-2024) to tariff-shock reset and re-accelereration (2025-2026). The sector's dual nature — commodity upstream (lithium price) plus manufacturing downstream (cell margins) — means tops form when BOTH prices AND volumes are simultaneously elevated (the 2021 and 2022 peaks), while troughs form when lithium prices are depressed AND macro risk is off simultaneously.","summary_zh":"A股锂电池板块的周期运行根本上由三力交叉驱动：(1)碳酸锂大宗商品超级周期（供给过剩与短缺轮动，周期18-24个月）；(2)北京产业与新能源政策日历（补贴、双碳目标、购置税减免、储能规划）；(3)A股成长风格贝塔——当上证指数处于流动性驱动的成长主导行情（电子/计算机/电新领涨）时，锂电对指数涨跌的放大倍数达3-5倍；风格切向价值/防御时同幅度跑输。这导致振幅极大的周期：6轮上涨腿平均涨幅+75%，4轮下跌腿平均跌幅-41%，整体呈现从清洁能源重估（2021-2022）到结构性过剩熊市（2022-2024）再到关税冲击重置与再加速（2025-2026）的长期弧线。板块兼具上游资源（锂价）与中下游制造（电池利润率）双重属性，意味着顶部出现在价格与出货量双双高位之时（2021、2022年峰值），底部则出现在锂价低迷与宏观风险规避双重共振之际。","top_signals":["Lithium carbonate price at multi-year highs (>400,000 yuan/tonne) with rising exchange inventories","Battery & Lithium at 90th-plus percentile position vs 200-day MA after a 60%+ rally leg","Shenwan Power Equipment and Metals simultaneously at 52-week highs, growth-value spread >20pp","NDRC/Ministry of Finance policy announcements disappoint consensus expectations (stimulus fatigue)"],"top_signals_zh":["碳酸锂价格处于多年高位（逾40万元/吨）且期货交易所库存持续攀升","锂电池板块相对200日均线位置超90百分位，且经历60%以上涨幅腿","申万电力设备和有色金属同步处于52周高位，成长/价值利差超20pp","发改委/财政部政策表态低于市场一致预期（刺激疲劳）"]},"b-cn_brokers":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the Oct-2022 trough leg (start 2022-10-10): same post-peak de-rating (brokers were punished in a flight-to-safety selloff), same early recovery phase where growth/tech led first before financial-beta joined, and the inflection came from a policy pivot rather than an organic earnings recovery. In that cycle, brokers lagged the initial AI/reopening-led growth surge for 2-3 months before catching up as turnover broadened; the current setup mirrors that delay, with Electronics and Telecoms leading while brokers consolidate below the 200-day.","analog_zh":"与当前形势最接近的历史类比是2022年10月低点腿（起始2022-10-10）：同为高峰后估值重置（避险抛售中券商深度跑输）、同为成长/科技率先领涨而金融贝塔滞后的早期修复阶段，且拐点均源自政策转向而非盈利有机复苏。彼时券商滞后AI/复苏主导的成长行情2-3个月后才随成交量扩散而补涨；当前格局镜像了这一滞后特征，电子和通信领涨，而券商在200日均线下方整固。","bottom_signals":["Politburo or State Council issues explicit market-stabilisation statement during a >15% SHCOMP drawdown","PBOC announces RRR cut plus direct equity market support facility (swap facility, re-lending)","A-share daily turnover collapses below RMB 500bn for multiple sessions — forced de-leveraging exhaustion signal"],"bottom_signals_zh":["政治局或国务院在上证综指跌幅超15%时发布明确的市场托底声明","央行宣布降准并推出直接入市支持工具（互换便利、再贷款）","A股日均成交量连续多日萎缩至5000亿元以下——强制去杠杆衰竭信号"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC policy easing (RRR/rate cuts, direct equity support facilities)","A-share daily turnover and margin balance cycle","Politburo growth floor / pro-market signal","US-China trade-war / tariff escalation risk","Commodity/growth style rotation (sector competes with or benefits from index beta)"],"drivers_zh":["央行政策放松（降准/降息/直接入市工具）","A股日均成交量及融资余额周期","政治局政策底/利市信号","中美贸易战/关税升级风险","商品/成长风格轮动（与指数贝塔竞争或协同）"],"median_cycle_months":12,"summary":"Brokers & Securities are the highest-beta proxy on A-share market health: their revenues (commissions, margin interest, underwriting, proprietary trading) all scale directly with SHCOMP turnover and index level. The sector cycles in lockstep with broad A-share bull/bear regimes, amplifying index moves by roughly 2-4x during major legs. The recurring engine is a four-force feedback loop: policy easing unlocks liquidity and risk appetite, retail investors lever up via margin, turnover explodes, and broker earnings surge — then the mirror-image de-leveraging on the way down. Beijing policy pivots (Politburo statements, PBOC RRR/rate cuts, direct market support facilities) are the single most reliable trigger for major turns. External shocks (Fed tightening, trade-war escalation) are the dominant bear catalysts, compressing both the volume and risk-appetite channels simultaneously.","summary_zh":"券商板块是A股市场健康状况的最高贝塔代理：佣金、融资利息、承销及自营收入均与上证成交量和指数点位直接挂钩，在重大行情中对指数涨跌的放大倍数约为2-4倍。板块与A股牛熊周期高度同步，其核心驱动是四力反馈循环：政策放松释放流动性与风险偏好、散户加杠杆、成交量爆发、券商盈利飙升，反之亦然。政治局表态、央行降准/降息、直接入市工具是引发重大转折最可靠的信号。外部冲击（美联储加息、贸易战升级）是熊市的主导催化剂，同步压缩成交量与风险偏好两个传导渠道。","top_signals":["SHCOMP daily turnover exceeds RMB 1-1.5tn and broker revenues begin beating expectations — sentiment/capacity ceiling","Margin balance as % of A-share float reaches prior-cycle highs (2015, 2024 peaks ~RMB 1.8-2tn)","Broker sector outpaces SHCOMP by 3x+ in a single quarter — historically precedes mean reversion within 1-3 months"],"top_signals_zh":["A股日均成交量超1-1.5万亿人民币且券商收入开始超预期——情绪/容量天花板","融资余额占A股流通市值比例触及前周期高点（2015/2024高峰约1.8-2万亿元）","券商单季涨幅超越上证综指3倍以上——历史上1-3个月内往往触发均值回归"]},"b-cn_coal":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the Sep-2022 peak (Leg 4 start, 2022-09-22): coal had just completed a major commodity-driven rally that diverged from the rest of the market, and capital then rotated violently into growth/AI themes (ChatGPT) for a full year. Today's June-2026 peak mirrors that dynamic almost exactly -- coal's Apr-2025 to Jun-2026 rally was driven by index beta in a growth-led tape (Telecoms +259%, Electronics +148%), and coal is now rolling over as the 15th FYP energy-transition narrative and AI/new-energy capital rotation accelerate, just as the Nov-2021 to Sep-2022 leg was sustained by a commodity shock that ended when the global energy crisis normalized and growth stocks reasserted. The key difference is that in 2022-23 the value rotation lasted 12 months; this time structural long-term headwinds (renewables displacement, FYP coal-peak target) may compress the next trough-to-peak recovery.","analog_zh":"与当前形态最相近的历史阶段是2022年9月的见顶（第4浪起点，2022-09-22）：彼时煤炭刚完成一轮背离大盘的大宗商品驱动上涨，随后资本全面轮动至成长/AI主题（ChatGPT），持续整整一年。当前2026年6月顶部几乎完全复制该动态——煤炭2025年4月至2026年6月的上涨由成长主导行情中的指数贝塔驱动（通信+259%、电子+148%），煤炭现已开始回落，正如2022-23年大宗商品冲击消退后成长股重新主导。最大差异在于：彼时价值轮动持续了约12个月，而此次结构性逆风（可再生能源替代、十五五煤炭达峰目标）可能压缩下次从低点到高点的复苏时间。","bottom_signals":["Domestic coal spot (Qinhuangdao 5,500 kcal) falls to or below NDRC long-term contract floor (~570-770 yuan/tonne range established 2022): production-cut motivation emerges, capex collapses","Coal dividend yield reaches 8%+ vs China 10Y bond below 2.5%: relative yield spread historically associated with accumulation by insurance/pension funds","Shenwan growth-over-value spread hits +25pp or wider (AI/tech mania peak): mean-reversion sets up for value re-rating"],"bottom_signals_zh":["国内煤炭现货（秦皇岛5500大卡）跌至或接近发改委长协价下限（2022年确立的570-770元/吨区间）：减产动力出现，资本开支大幅萎缩","煤炭股息率升至8%以上而中国10年期国债收益率低于2.5%：历史上该相对收益利差吸引保险/养老金资金建仓","申万成长相对价值利差达+25pp或更宽（AI/科技炒作顶部）：价值均值回归重估条件成熟"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["domestic thermal/coking coal price (Qinhuangdao spot / NYMEX comparable)","NDRC supply & price policy (production quotas, price caps, energy security campaigns)","A-share style regime: value vs growth rotation (key cross-Shenwan signal)","SOE dividend and buyback mandate cycles (SASAC / CSRC policy)","global energy shocks (Ukraine war, LNG disruptions) feeding into Chinese import parity"],"drivers_zh":["国内动力煤/焦煤价格（秦皇岛现货/郑商所期货）","发改委供给与价格政策（产能核定、限价、能源保供专项行动）","A股风格制度：价值与成长的轮动（申万行业关键截面信号）","国企分红与回购政策周期（国资委/证监会政策周期）","全球能源冲击（乌克兰战争、LNG中断）传导至中国进口平价"],"median_cycle_months":14,"summary":"Coal A-shares cycle on three interlocking engines: (1) physical coal prices, which are set by China's power-demand seasonality, domestic mine-output policy (safety curbs, capacity additions), and imported-coal substitution (Russia, Ukraine war); (2) the Shenwan style regime -- coal is a deep-value/high-dividend sector that surges when SHCOMP is soft but value beats growth, and collapses whenever growth/AI themes dominate; (3) Beijing regulatory and energy-security signals (NDRC price caps, SOE dividend mandates, Five-Year Plan carbon targets). Full cycles run roughly 12-20 months peak-to-peak. The asset delivers outsized alpha only in narrow commodity-crisis or SOE-reform windows; outside those windows it underperforms in risk-on tapes because capital rotates into growth.","summary_zh":"煤炭A股围绕三大相互咬合的驱动引擎循环：（1）实物煤价，受中国电力需求季节性、国内矿山产能政策（安全巡查、产能核增）及进口煤替代（俄罗斯、乌克兰战争）共同影响；（2）申万风格制度——煤炭是深度价值/高股息板块，上证综指走弱但价值跑赢成长时大幅上涨，AI/成长主题主导时则大幅回落；（3）北京监管与能源安全信号（发改委价格干预、国企分红政策、五年规划碳排放目标）。完整周期约12-20个月峰峰相距。该资产仅在商品危机或国企改革窗口期才能实现超额收益；在风险偏好行情中，资金因轮动至成长板块而导致其持续跑输。","top_signals":["Coal futures (Zhengzhou ZC) diverge above NDRC 'reasonable range' threshold (~1,500 yuan/tonne benchmark 5,500 kcal): triggers price-cap regulatory risk within 2-4 weeks","Coal is Shenwan rank #1-2 with cyclicals outpacing defensives by >20pp AND value beating growth by >8pp: exhaustion signal as peak value-rotation","SHCOMP has already rallied >15% off a trough without coal participating proportionally: signals late-cycle relative underperformance and imminent rotation to growth"],"top_signals_zh":["郑商所动力煤期货突破发改委'合理区间'上限（约5500大卡基准1500元/吨）：2-4周内触发限价监管风险","煤炭在申万排名第1-2位，周期板块跑赢防御板块超20pp且价值跑赢成长超8pp：价值轮动顶部衰竭信号","上证综指已从低点反弹超15%而煤炭未能同步跟涨：预示周期末段相对跑输并即将发生向成长板块的轮动"]},"b-cn_consumer_elec":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2022 trough-to-Nov-2023 peak leg (+42.3%, 13 months): same AI-narrative-driven pure growth style dominance (+17.4pp) with SHCOMP only modestly positive (+2.6%), confirming sector-specific rather than index-beta leadership. The current leg (Apr 2025 onwards, +171.5%) dwarfs it in magnitude -- the tariff-truce and AI-phone cycle are a compounded binary catalyst amplifier. The Oct-2022 analog warns that once the narrative catalyst (then: zero-COVID pivot + ChatGPT; now: Geneva tariff truce + DeepSeek AI-phone) is fully priced, the basket corrects sharply on the first growth disappointment -- in late 2023 that was China deflation and property stress; the analogous risk in 2026 is tariff re-escalation post-truce expiry or AI-phone upgrade demand underwhelming consensus.","analog_zh":"与2022年10月底部至2023年11月峰值的上涨腿（+42.3%，历时13个月）最为相似：同为AI叙事驱动的纯成长风格主导（+17.4pp），沪综指同期涨幅有限（+2.6%），确认为板块主导而非指数贝塔行情。当前腿（2025年4月至今，+171.5%）幅度远超前者——关税休战与AI手机周期构成复合二元催化剂放大效应。2022年10月的类比警示：当叙事催化剂（彼时：动态清零逆转+ChatGPT；今时：日内瓦关税休战+DeepSeek AI手机）被充分定价后，篮子往往在首次利空信号出现时急速回调——2023年底的打击是通缩加深与房地产压力；2026年的类比风险是休战到期后关税再升级，或AI手机换机需求不及市场共识。","bottom_signals":["Value sectors (Coal, Banks) are the only positive Shenwan industries while SHCOMP falls >10%: flight-to-safety confirmed, defensives leading suggests risk-off near exhaustion","PBOC policy pivot: LPR cut announcement or confirmed national team ETF purchase escalation","US-China tariff de-escalation or direct technology/semiconductor exemption announcement","Growth-minus-value spread collapses to -10pp or below after a >25% drawdown: style washout marks capitulation"],"bottom_signals_zh":["煤炭、银行成为沪综指跌幅>10%时仅有的正收益申万行业：避险确认，防御领涨意味着风险规避接近尾声","央行政策转向：LPR降息公告或国家队ETF增持规模确认升级","中美关税降级或直接科技/半导体豁免公告","超过25%回撤后成长-价值利差收窄至-10pp以下：风格杀跌式出清，标志性底部"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["China liquidity cycle (PBOC LPR/RRR cuts, national team buying)","US-China tech trade policy (tariffs, export controls, semiconductor exemptions)","AI hardware narrative cycle (ChatGPT, DeepSeek, on-device AI phone refresh)","Global rate/USD regime (Fed tightening = discount rate headwind for long-duration growth)","Beijing regulatory posture (tech crackdown vs policy support inflection)","Smartphone upgrade cadence (Huawei/Apple new-product cycles)"],"drivers_zh":["中国流动性周期（央行降息降准、国家队增持）","中美科技贸易政策（关税、出口管制、半导体豁免）","AI硬件叙事周期（ChatGPT、DeepSeek、端侧AI换机潮）","全球利率/美元体制（美联储收紧=长久期成长资产折现率压制）","北京监管立场（科技整治vs政策支持拐点）","智能手机换机周期（华为/苹果新品节奏）"],"median_cycle_months":13,"summary":"Consumer Electronics (the Apple/Android supply chain: precision assembly, acoustics, glass, display, PCB) cycles on the intersection of the global smartphone upgrade cadence, Beijing's periodic liquidity injections, and US-China technology trade policy shocks. When SHCOMP is in a broad beta rally and the growth-over-value premium is positive, Consumer Electronics amplifies the move 2-4x versus the index (beta >2 in up-legs); when risk-off strikes -- whether from Fed rate shocks, Beijing regulatory crackdowns, or tariff escalations -- it is among the fastest and deepest fallers, with value/defensive sectors rotating to the front. The series shows no mean-reverting equilibrium: it oscillates between multi-month AI-theme explosions and sharp correction episodes, driven primarily by China's policy cycle and global rate/dollar dynamics rather than smartphone demand fundamentals alone.","summary_zh":"消费电子（果链/AI手机供应链：精密组装、声学、玻璃、显示、PCB）的周期取决于全球智能手机升级节奏、北京周期性流动性注入与中美科技贸易政策冲击三者的交叉点。当沪综指处于宽基贝塔上行、成长-价值利差为正时，消费电子的涨幅为指数的2-4倍；而一旦风险规避来袭——无论是美联储加息冲击、北京监管整治还是关税升级——它往往是跌幅最深、反应最快的板块之一，价值/防御风格迅速切换至前台。该系列不存在均值回复的均衡，而是在AI主题爆发式上涨与急速修正之间交替，主要驱动力来自中国政策周期与全球利率/美元动态，而非单纯的手机需求基本面。","top_signals":["Growth-minus-value spread exceeds +35pp with Consumer Electronics at rs_rank 1-3: extreme leadership historically marks exhaustion","SHCOMP cycle position above 95th percentile with sector up >80% in the current leg: prior peaks occurred at similar readings","AI/hardware theme narratives peaking in media coverage without new major model releases to sustain momentum","USD strengthening and US 10Y yields rising: historical leading indicator of growth-style reversal for A-share tech"],"top_signals_zh":["成长-价值利差超+35pp且消费电子相对强度排名前3：极端领涨即历史性超买信号","沪综指周期位置超95百分位且本轮板块涨幅>80%：历史峰值均出现于类似读数","AI/硬件叙事主题媒体覆盖达峰但缺乏重大新模型发布支撑动能","美元走强+美债10Y利率上升：A股科技成长风格逆转的历史领先指标"]},"b-cn_defense":{"analog":"Closest to the Jan-2026 peak/correction: the Mar-2023 peak setup — in both cases the basket had just completed a massive multi-quarter rally (+62% / +72%), the trigger for reversal was earnings/delivery disappointment rather than a macro shock, Defense rotated from co-leader to laggard within the growth complex, and the broader SHCOMP did not collapse (both corrections occurred with SHCOMP down only mid-single digits at onset). The key difference is that the 2023 correction deepened to -35% over 12 months as the PLA corruption purge added a sector-specific overhang; the current (2026) correction has so far stayed at -19.6% in 5 months with no equivalent governance shock, suggesting a shallower, shorter cycle.","analog_zh":"与当前最近似的是2023年3月高点行情：两次均在多季度大涨（+62%/+72%）后因业绩/交付落差触发回调，而非宏观冲击；军工均由领涨转为成长板块内部落后者；上证综指均仅小幅下跌（初期均为中个位数）。关键差异在于2023年回调因火箭军腐败案引发板块特定利空，最终跌幅扩大至35%历时12个月；当前（2026年）回调已持续5个月、跌幅19.6%，暂无同等治理层面冲击，提示本轮调整更浅、更短。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP broad capitulation / national team ETF buying intervention","Value-over-growth rotation at extremes (growth-minus-value deeply negative for 2+ months)","Defense ranked in worst 5 of 31 Shenwan sectors with cycle position below 10","NPC session approaching with multi-year defense budget re-rating expected"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指整体恐慌/国家队ETF入场托市","价值大幅跑赢成长（成长-价值利差连续2个月以上深度负值）","军工在申万31行业中排名后五且周期位置低于10","临近全国两会，市场预期国防预算多年重估"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Annual NPC defense budget announcement (Mar) — order-book re-rating catalyst","SHCOMP growth/liquidity cycle — growth-minus-value factor drives beta amplification","Geopolitical event risk — live battlefield tests of Chinese weapons (India-Pak 2025) create sudden re-rating","PLA modernization milestone years (2027 centenary target) — periodic policy intensity","Earnings delivery cycle — sector rallies on procurement expectations, corrects on actual P&L delivery gap","AI/dual-use technology fusion — military-civil fusion links defense to semiconductor/AI cycles"],"drivers_zh":["全国两会国防预算公告（每年3月）——订单重估核心催化","上证综指成长/流动性周期——成长-价值因子主导板块贝塔放大","地缘事件风险——中国武器实战表现（如印巴冲突）触发突然重估","解放军现代化里程碑年份（2027百年目标）——政策强度周期","业绩交付周期——板块在采购预期阶段上涨，在实际利润兑现落差后回调","AI/两用技术融合——军民融合将军工与半导体/AI周期挂钩"],"median_cycle_months":15,"summary":"China Defense & Aerospace cycles as a high-beta growth theme within the A-share market, amplified by two recurring structural mechanisms: (1) Beijing's defense budget cycle — announced annually at the National People's Congress (March), the 6-7% consistent annual increases provide a durable order-book re-rating floor, but rarely single-handedly drive a major rally; (2) systemic SHCOMP growth/liquidity cycles — the sector's correlation with Electronics and Computers means it surges when domestic liquidity loosens and the growth factor dominates (growth-minus-value +18pp or more), and collapses when the market switches into value/defensive mode. Peaks historically coincide with valuation exhaustion and earnings delivery gaps after a big re-rating; troughs align with broad market capitulation. The sector is NOT a true defensive safe-haven — when SHCOMP falls on risk-off rotation, Defense falls at least as much as cyclicals.","summary_zh":"中国国防航天板块本质上是A股高贝塔成长主题，受两大结构性机制周期驱动：（1）北京国防预算周期——每年全国两会（3月）公布，连续多年6-7%增长为订单重估提供长期地基，但通常不单独触发主升浪；（2）上证综指成长/流动性大周期——板块与电子、计算机高度联动，在国内流动性宽松、成长-价值利差扩大（+18pp以上）时大涨，市场切换至价值/防御模式时深跌。历史上顶部对应估值透支与业绩兑现缺口，底部对应市场整体性恐慌低点。该板块并非真正的防御避险品种——每当上证综指因避险情绪下跌，军工的跌幅至少与周期股相当。","top_signals":["Growth-minus-value spread compressed or reversing after multi-month expansion (liquidity exhaustion)","Defense earnings pre-announcements flagging delivery shortfalls versus procurement order backlog","Sector cycle position above 80 with Defense ranked in top 3 of 31 Shenwan industries","Post-parade / post-geopolitical-event sentiment peak with no new fundamental catalyst"],"top_signals_zh":["成长-价值利差在多月扩张后收窄或反转（流动性动能衰竭）","军工企业业绩预告显示实际交付低于采购订单积压预期","周期位置高于80且军工在申万31行业中排名前三","阅兵/地缘事件情绪高峰后缺乏新增基本面催化"]},"b-cn_food_bev":{"analog":"Closest to the Jun-2022 peak (Leg 4 start, 2022-06-30): the current setup shares the same trough-after-failed-rebound structure. In Jun-2022, the sector had just led a 25% post-lockdown rally then immediately cratered 31% as zero-COVID was reaffirmed and the property crisis deepened; today, after leading the Oct-2022 reopening rally (+38%), the sector has spent over two years as a structural laggard while the market was dominated by AI and tech, analogous to how policy-favored cyclicals dominated in H2 2022. The key difference is that the 2022 selloff had an identifiable hard catalyst (Xi Congress plus zero-COVID reaffirmation) while the current trough is driven by structural demand deflation and style rotation -- suggesting the bottom may be stickier and require an explicit consumption-stimulus pivot rather than a policy-regime-change event to reverse.","analog_zh":"与2022年6月触顶（第4轮起点，2022-06-30）最为相似：当前走势同样呈现\"反弹后二次探底\"结构——2022年6月，板块刚刚完成解封后25%的领涨行情，随即因二十大清零重申与房产危机深化急跌31%；本轮类似，板块在2022年10月复苏行情中领涨38%后，已连续两年多结构性落后，期间市场被AI/科技主导，与2022年下半年政策周期股占优的背景异曲同工。核心差异在于：2022年下跌有明确的硬催化剂（二十大+清零重申），而当前低谷由结构性消费通缩与风格轮动驱动，底部可能更具粘性，需要明确的消费刺激政策转向而非单纯制度性变化方可逆转。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP broad policy-pivot rally with domestic-demand or consumption stimulus as explicit Politburo target","Baijiu wholesale price (Feitian Moutai) stabilizing after 25-35% decline from peak indicating channel destocking near completion","Sector P/E compressed to 20-30x range and fund ownership at multi-year lows (de-crowded)","Zero-COVID pivot or major consumption-support package announcement (vouchers, property floor)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指在政治局明确提出内需/消费刺激目标背景下政策驱动反弹","飞天茅台批价从高点下跌25-35%后企稳，渠道去库存接近尾声","板块PE压缩至20-30倍区间，公募基金持仓降至多年低位（去拥挤完成）","防疫政策重大转向或大规模消费支持政策出台（消费券、地产托底）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["property-wealth-effect driving premium baijiu gifting and dining demand","domestic fund crowding and huddling cycles in brand-moat staples","zero-COVID and reopening pivots creating violent demand-unlock events","baijiu channel inventory and distributor destocking cycles","growth-vs-value style rotation (sector lags in tech/AI tapes)","PBOC/LPR macro regime driving P/E multiple expansion or compression"],"drivers_zh":["房地产财富效应驱动高端白酒礼赠与餐饮需求","国内公募基金抱团消费品牌龙头形成的持仓周期","防疫政策转向引发的消费需求解锁冲击","白酒渠道库存与经销商去库存周期","成长/价值风格轮动（科技/AI行情中板块落后）","央行/LPR宏观政策驱动的估值扩张或收缩"],"median_cycle_months":7.5,"summary":"Food & Beverage on China A-shares cycles primarily on the intersection of three recurring forces: (1) consumer spending confidence tied to the property-wealth effect and household income expectations, which determine premium baijiu gifting budgets and dining frequency; (2) crowded-positioning cycles driven by domestic mutual fund huddling in brand-moat staples that peak when sector P/E reaches 60-80x and reverse violently on any negative catalyst; and (3) macro-regime beta, where the sector outperforms sharply in reopening and reflation pivots but is crushed in risk-off or AI/tech-dominated tapes because its defensive label provides no shelter when the whole index falls. The SHCOMP's broad direction is a necessary but insufficient condition -- what matters is whether the catalyst is consumption-specific (reopening, stimulus vouchers) versus cyclical or tech rotation, which determines whether Food & Bev leads or lags the index.","summary_zh":"食品饮料A股周期由三大周期性力量交织驱动：（1）消费信心受房地产财富效应与居民收入预期支撑，决定高端白酒礼赠预算与餐饮频次；（2）国内公募基金抱团品牌护城河消费龙头形成的拥挤仓位周期，板块PE达60-80倍时触顶，任何负面催化剂均引发剧烈瓦解；（3）宏观制度Beta，板块在复苏/再通胀转折点大幅领涨，但在风险规避或AI/科技主导行情中因防御标签而遭深度压制。上证综指走势是必要而非充分条件，关键在于催化剂属性：消费专属（解封、消费券）还是周期/科技轮动，决定食饮领涨还是领跌。","top_signals":["Shenwan F&B P/E approaching 60-80x with domestic fund ownership at crowding highs","Baijiu wholesale price (Feitian Moutai spot) running well above suggested retail indicating speculative inventory build","Food & Bev in top-3 Shenwan sectors for 3+ consecutive months in a broad risk-on rally (over-extension signal)","Regulatory attention to baijiu price or speculation via SAMR symposia or price-cap headlines"],"top_signals_zh":["申万食饮PE接近60-80倍，公募基金持仓比例达历史高位（抱团极值）","飞天茅台批价大幅高于建议零售价，经销商投机性囤货明显","食品饮料连续3个月以上位列申万前三（普涨行情中过度延伸信号）","市监总局召开白酒价格/炒作专题座谈会或限价媒体报道密集出现"]},"b-cn_gold":{"analog":"Closest analog is the Apr-2023-to-Jan-2024 selloff leg: same risk-off rotation into defensive/value names, gold miners falling roughly double the SHCOMP decline, driven by loss of a structural demand catalyst (then: China macro disappointment overwhelming safe-haven bid; now: PBOC buying pause and gold price parabolic unwind). The current leg is deeper (-48% vs -23%) because it follows a far larger preceding rally (+199% vs +61%), consistent with the sector's asymmetric beta pattern. The prior trough (Jan 2024) resolved via the next synchronized PBOC-and-dollar-cycle catalyst; a similar resolution here would require either renewed PBOC gold purchase disclosures or a decisive DXY breakdown below 98 triggering the next bullion leg.","analog_zh":"最相近的历史类比为2023年4月至2024年1月的下跌阶段：同样为防御/价值风格主导的风险规避轮动，黄金矿业跌幅约为上证综指的两倍，均因结构性需求催化剂消退所致（彼时：中国宏观数据持续低于预期压过黄金避险吸引力；此次：央行购金暂停与金价抛物线式回调）。当前跌幅更深（-48%对比-23%），因前期涨幅远大（+199%对比+61%），符合该板块非对称贝塔规律。前次低点（2024年1月）由下一轮央行购金与美元周期协同催化化解；本轮类似的化解路径需央行重新披露黄金增持，或美元指数决定性跌破98触发下一轮金价上行。","bottom_signals":["PBOC announcing resumption of gold buying after a pause of 3+ months","DXY peaking and reversing lower confirmed by Fed pivot signal or fiscal dominance","Beijing unleashing a multi-tool stimulus package (RRR + rate + property simultaneously)","Shenwan Metals underperforming SHCOMP by >20pp over 6 months signaling washout exhaustion"],"bottom_signals_zh":["央行宣布暂停购金3个月以上后重启增持","美元指数见顶反转，美联储政策转向或财政主导信号确认","北京推出多工具一揽子刺激政策（降准+降息+房地产政策同步落地）","申万有色金属板块6个月内跑输上证综指超20个百分点，洗盘筋疲力尽"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["USD / DXY cycle (inverse to gold price)","PBOC official gold reserve accumulation","Beijing macro stimulus (RRR/LPR cuts, fiscal pledges)","China property sector health (risk appetite driver)","A-share growth-vs-value rotation (tech vs commodity flow)"],"drivers_zh":["美元/美元指数周期（与金价反向）","中国央行官方黄金储备增持","北京宏观刺激政策（降准/LPR调降/财政承诺）","中国房地产行业健康程度（风险偏好指引）","A股成长与价值轮动（科技与商品资金流向）"],"median_cycle_months":18,"summary":"China Gold Miners cycle as a double-leveraged expression of (1) the global gold price cycle, which is itself driven by the USD/real-yield cycle and central-bank reserve-diversification demand, and (2) the A-share risk-appetite cycle anchored to PBOC policy and Beijing macro stimulus cadence. When both levers align -- dollar falling, PBOC buying gold, and Beijing unleashing domestic stimulus -- miners deliver multi-hundred-percent moves. When either reverses -- dollar rises, PBOC pauses, or Beijing stimulus fades and the SHCOMP de-rates -- miners correct 23-48% even as SHCOMP may be flat or up slightly. The sector has near-zero idiosyncratic earnings driver; it is a pure bullion-price proxy with 2-3x beta to the gold price move in A-share form, amplified further by the periodic de-dollarization/safe-haven narrative and compressed further by A-share tech-rotation episodes that drain liquidity from commodity names.","summary_zh":"中国黄金矿业板块的运行逻辑是双重杠杆的叠加：其一为全球金价周期（由美元/实际利率周期与央行储备多元化需求共同驱动）；其二为A股风险偏好周期（锚定于中国央行货币政策与北京宏观刺激节奏）。当两大杠杆共振向好——美元走弱、央行增持黄金、北京大规模放松政策——矿业股可实现数倍涨幅。一旦任一因素逆转——美元走强、央行购金暂停，或北京刺激政策边际退潮导致上证综指估值收缩——矿业股即下跌23%至48%，即便上证综指可能仅小幅下跌甚至走平。该板块几乎不存在个股基本面驱动，本质上是黄金价格的纯粹代理，对金价涨跌具有2-3倍贝塔效应，在去美元化/避险叙事期间被进一步放大，在A股科技轮动阶段则被资金出逃压制。","top_signals":["Gold price reaching parabolic acceleration (>50% in 6 months) concurrent with PBOC buying pause","A-share growth style leading value by >40pp with Telecoms/Electronics dominating Shenwan leaderboard","Chinese banks restricting retail gold trading access on Shanghai Gold Exchange","DXY reversing upward after a multi-month decline, pushing back on Fed cut expectations"],"top_signals_zh":["金价出现抛物线加速（6个月内涨幅超50%），同期央行购金暂停","A股成长风格跑赢价值风格超40个百分点，通信/电子主导申万涨幅榜","中国银行限制个人投资者通过上海黄金交易所参与黄金交易","美元指数在持续多月下跌后触底反弹，市场压缩美联储降息预期"]},"b-cn_insurers":{"analog":"Closest to the May-2023 peak and subsequent 8-month selloff: the Jan-2026 to June-2026 leg similarly started from a peak following a major stimulus-driven rally, with the SHCOMP nearly flat while insurers fell 30%+. The 2023 analog featured property contagion plus yield collapse as the dual catalyst; the current analog is DeepSeek AI style rotation plus ongoing yield compression. Both produced sector-specific underperformance roughly 2x the index drawdown, and both set up a recovery when an external macro catalyst created a re-entry window -- PBOC's September 2024 mega-stimulus for the prior cycle, and a potential growth/AI consolidation or policy yield floor for the current one.","analog_zh":"当前格局与2023年5月高点后的8个月杀跌腿最为相似：彼时亦从重大政策刺激驱动的大涨高点回落，上证综指几乎平收，而保险暴跌30%以上。2023年的核心催化剂是房地产传染叠加收益率下行；当前类比则是DeepSeek AI风格轮动叠加持续的收益率压缩。两轮行情均产生了约为指数跌幅2倍的行业特异性超额杀跌，且均在外部宏观催化剂出现时形成阶段性再入场窗口——前一周期为央行2024年9月的超级宽松刺激，当前周期则有待成长/AI行情收敛或政策性国债收益率底部确立。","bottom_signals":["CGB 10-year yield at record or multi-decade lows with PBOC signalling a floor or reversal","Insurers down 25%+ relative to SHCOMP in a non-bear-market tape -- style-rotation washout","Growth-over-value spread above 15pp extreme AND insurance rs_rank in bottom quartile of Shenwan","Major property developer liquidation or restructuring completing -- contagion peak passing"],"bottom_signals_zh":["10年期国债收益率处于历史或数十年低位，央行释放利率底部或逆转信号","在非熊市行情中，保险相对上证综指下跌超25%——风格轮动超卖洗盘","成长股溢价超15个百分点且保险相对强弱排名跌入申万行业后四分之一","大型房地产开发商清盘/重组完成——传染风险高峰过去"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["CGB 10-year yield level and direction determining NBV discount rates and investment spreads","A-share equity market regime driving investment portfolio mark-to-market","PBOC policy tools directly targeting insurer equity mandates (2024 swap facility)","property sector contagion via fixed-income developer bond exposure","growth-vs-value style rotation determining relative capital flows","new-business-value growth rate and guaranteed-return liability repricing cycle"],"drivers_zh":["10年期国债收益率水平与走向决定新业务价值折现率及投资利差","A股权益市场状态驱动投资组合盯市估值","央行定向政策工具（如2024年互换便利）决定险资入市节奏","通过固收组合开发商债券敞口形成的房地产传染风险","成长/价值风格轮动决定相对资金流向","新业务价值增速与保证收益率负债重新定价周期"],"median_cycle_months":16,"summary":"Chinese listed insurers cycle on two structural levers that move in tandem: the CGB long-bond yield, which directly sets new-business-value discount rates and determines whether the investment spread on guaranteed-return liabilities is positive or negative; and the A-share equity market regime, since insurer investment portfolios carry 10-20% equity exposure whose mark-to-market swings drive reported profits. When both levers are favourable -- PBOC easing, bond yields stabilising, SHCOMP in a risk-on bull -- insurers tend to outperform broad financials dramatically as seen in 2024. When yields fall to record lows and equity flows rotate into growth/tech themes, insurers suffer double compression: shrinking spreads AND capital outflows to higher-momentum sectors. The sector also carries episodic property contagion risk, as fixed-income portfolios hold developer bonds; and is highly sensitive to Beijing's direct policy mandates targeting insurer equity deployment.","summary_zh":"中国上市险企（以平安、国寿、人保、新华、太保为代表）的周期运行受两大结构性杠杆共同驱动：(1)长期国债收益率，直接决定新业务价值折现率及保证收益率负债的投资利差正负；(2)A股权益市场状态，险企投资组合通常配置10-20%的权益资产，其盯市波动直接影响报告利润。当两大杠杆同时有利——央行宽松、债券收益率企稳、上证综指处于风险偏好上升的牛市格局——险企往往大幅跑赢宽基金融板块（如2024年）。当收益率跌至历史低位且权益资金轮动至成长/科技主题时，险企遭受双重压缩：利差收窄与资金外流并发。此外，该板块还面临阶段性房地产传染风险（固收组合持有开发商债券），同时对北京直接政策指令（如险资入市工具）高度敏感。","top_signals":["CGB 10-year yield approaching cycle highs near 3% signalling compression relief ahead","PBOC equity-support policy tools targeting insurers directly such as swap facilities","Insurance sector trailing the SHCOMP rally for 3+ consecutive months -- relative momentum exhaustion","A-share growth/value gap extremely wide then starting to narrow signalling imminent style rotation"],"top_signals_zh":["10年期国债收益率接近周期高点（约3%），预示利差压缩压力将缓解","央行推出直接针对险企的权益入市政策工具（如互换便利）","保险板块连续3个月以上明显跑输上证综指——相对动量衰竭信号","A股成长/价值利差极度拉大后开始收窄——风格轮动逆转在即"]},"b-cn_med_devices":{"analog":"Closest analog to today is the late-2023 trough phase of Leg 6 (Feb 2023 - Sep 2024): the same configuration of extreme relative underperformance vs SHCOMP, record-low valuation compression, and a growth-versus-healthcare rotation drove a 30.7% drawdown over 19 months before the Sep-2024 PBOC mega-package triggered a 48% recovery. The current Leg 8 (-37.9%) has now exceeded that drawdown with the same structural driver — domestic capital concentrated in one dominant theme (then: property/macro defensives; now: AI hardware) — suggesting the reversal will again require either a major exogenous policy catalyst (PBOC easing cycle, VBP policy pause, anti-corruption campaign conclusion) or a rotation out of the dominant growth theme.","analog_zh":"与当前格局最为接近的历史案例是第六段行情末期（2023年2月至2024年9月）：同样是相对大盘极端跑输、估值压缩创历史新低，以及成长股对医疗的压倒性轮动，在19个月内累计下跌30.7%，直至2024年9月央行超级宽松一揽子政策触发板块48%的反弹。当前第八段（-37.9%）跌幅已超越彼时，且结构驱动一脉相承——国内资金高度集中于单一主导主题（彼时为房地产防御资产，当前为AI硬件）——历史经验表明，板块反转同样需要重大外生性政策催化剂（央行宽松周期启动、集采政策阶段性暂停或反腐整治收官），抑或主导成长主题的轮动结束。","bottom_signals":["Healthcare P/B drops below 3x (record-low absolute valuation)","VBP implementation completes for a major category and next tender round has not been announced","PBOC announces RRR or 5Y LPR cut alongside Politburo economic support signal","A-share healthcare stocks underperform SHCOMP by >20pp over 6 months on no new fundamental negative"],"bottom_signals_zh":["医疗板块市净率跌破3倍（绝对低估历史极端）","重大集采品类落地完毕且下一轮招标尚未公告","央行降准或下调5年期LPR并伴随政治局稳经济表态","在无重大新利空情况下医疗板块6个月内跑输大盘逾20个百分点"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBOC liquidity cycles (LPR/RRR easing drives re-rating)","VBP national procurement rounds (pricing shock every 12-24 months)","Beijing regulatory campaigns (anti-corruption, data security)","Fed tightening / global risk-off (growth-beta amplifier)","epidemic/antiviral demand spikes (TCM-specific catalyst)","domestic device substitution policy momentum"],"drivers_zh":["央行流动性周期（LPR/降准宽松驱动估值重估）","国家集采轮次（每12-24个月一次定价冲击）","北京监管整治运动（反腐、数据安全等）","美联储紧缩/全球风险规避（成长贝塔放大器）","疫情防病毒需求激增（中药特有催化剂）","医疗器械国产替代政策动能"],"median_cycle_months":33,"summary":"Medical Devices & TCM cycles on the collision between two structural forces: Beijing's recurring policy intervention — principally VBP procurement rounds that compress device pricing by 80-95% — and macro-liquidity regimes (PBOC easing vs Fed tightening) that govern risk appetite across all China growth sectors. The sector amplifies broad SHCOMP moves with a bias toward underperformance in defensive rotations, because despite healthcare-sector labeling, the basket's device-maker and domestic-substitution theme gives it substantial growth-beta. Peaks have historically coincided with the exhaustion of post-VBP relief trades or the onset of new Beijing regulatory campaigns; troughs follow extreme de-rating from dual shocks (global rate cycle + domestic procurement). TCM franchises add a unique catalyst layer: antiviral demand spikes during epidemic waves have twice produced outsized rallies (2022 Shanghai lockdown; 2022 COVID reopening).","summary_zh":"医疗器械与中药板块的周期性波动，根植于两股结构性力量的持续博弈：一是北京政府的周期性政策干预（尤以集采为核心，历次价格降幅达80-95%）；二是宏观流动性周期（央行宽松与美联储紧缩交替主导），决定全市场风险偏好高低。该板块对上证综指的涨跌具有明显放大效应，且在防御轮动中倾向跑输——尽管名义上归属医疗行业，但其器械国产化替代主题赋予板块显著的成长股贝塔属性。历史上，峰值往往出现在集采后修复行情耗尽或北京新一轮监管整治启动之际；底部则通常形成于全球加息周期与国内集采双重冲击叠加后的极度低估阶段。中药品牌另具独特催化逻辑：疫情抗病毒需求飙升曾两度引发板块超额涨幅（2022年上海封控期间及新冠放开后）。","top_signals":["New VBP national tender announcement for a major device category (signals 12-18 months of earnings downgrade cycle)","NHC or CCDI launching a new healthcare industry rectification campaign","SHCOMP growth-minus-value spread compressing from >15pp (late-cycle thematic rotation exhaustion)","Medical devices outperforming SHCOMP by >15pp over 3 months (post-stimulus euphoria top)"],"top_signals_zh":["国家集采新一轮重大品类招标公告（预示未来12-18个月盈利下修周期）","卫健委或中纪委启动新一轮医疗行业整治行动","上证综指成长-价值利差从>15百分点收窄（主题轮动末期特征）","医疗器械3个月内跑赢上证综指逾15个百分点（刺激后情绪顶）"]},"b-cn_metals":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current (2026-01-29) peak is the March 2022 peak: both followed a record copper price (Mar 2022: $10,845/ton; Jan 2026: $13,387/ton), both came after a PBoC-stimulus-driven rally, and both saw the peak coincide with an inflection in global macro (Fed hikes in 2022; tariff escalation and USD pressure in 2026). The Mar 2022 selloff lasted 8 months and was -29%; the current selloff is already -32% with tariff uncertainty still unresolved. Key difference: the 2022 trough was catalyzed by zero-COVID end; the 2026 trough catalyst is likely tariff de-escalation or a fresh PBoC package. The current setup also rhymes with the Sep-Nov 2021 episode (energy crisis + policy crackdown ending a commodity run), where the selloff lasted ~2 months before policy re-engaged.","analog_zh":"与当前（2026年1月29日）高点最相似的历史时期是2022年3月的峰值：两者均发生在铜价创历史新高之后（2022年3月10,845美元/吨；2026年1月13,387美元/吨），均处于央行刺激驱动上涨之后，且两次峰值均与全球宏观拐点同步（2022年美联储启动加息；2026年关税升级与美元压力）。2022年3月的回调持续8个月，跌幅-29%；当前回调已达-32%且关税不确定性尚未消除。关键差异：2022年触底由清零政策终结催化；2026年触底的催化剂可能是关税缓和或新一轮央行政策组合拳。当前局面亦与2021年9-11月的行情（能源危机+政策打压终结商品行情）颇为相似，彼时回调历时约两个月后政策再度介入。","bottom_signals":["PBoC announces RRR or LPR cut (especially 50bp+ combined package)","LME copper stabilizes or bounces after >20% drawdown from cycle high","A-share value/cyclical rotation returns (growth-minus-value spread turns negative)","China property support measures published (or construction activity data bottoms)"],"bottom_signals_zh":["人民银行宣布降准或降LPR（尤其是50bp以上的组合拳）","LME铜价从周期高点回调20%以上后企稳或反弹","A股价值/周期风格回归（成长-价值利差转负）","中国房地产支持措施出台（或建筑业活动数据触底）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["PBoC monetary easing (RRR/LPR cuts) repricing growth discount","LME copper and aluminum spot price as primary returns anchor","China property sector construction demand (steel/copper end-use)","USD cycle: strong dollar = commodity headwind; weak dollar = tailwind","A-share style rotation: value/cyclical vs growth/tech determines capital availability","Green capex and AI infrastructure as secular demand amplifiers"],"drivers_zh":["人民银行货币宽松（降准/降LPR）重新定价增长折现率","LME铜铝现货价格作为主要收益锚","中国房地产建筑需求（钢铁/铜终端用途）","美元周期：美元走强=商品逆风；美元走弱=顺风","A股风格轮动：价值/周期与成长/科技决定资金可得性","新能源资本开支与AI基础设施作为长期需求放大器"],"median_cycle_months":20,"summary":"Industrial Metals (有色金属) cycles are driven by three interlocking engines: global commodity price levels (copper and aluminum as the price anchor), China's macro policy stance (PBoC RRR/LPR cuts that reprice the growth discount and reflate construction demand), and the style rotation between value/cyclical and growth/tech within the A-share universe. The series behaves as a high-beta proxy on the commodity supercycle and on Beijing's policy impulse — it rallies hardest when PBoC eases aggressively AND global metals prices are rising, and it de-rates most sharply when the Fed tightens (USD strengthens), China's property sector fails to absorb metals demand, or capital rotates to growth/tech. The recurring pattern: a policy catalyst (RRR cut, stimulus bazooka) triggers the entry, a commodity price record or structural demand story (EV, AI data centers) sustains the up-leg, and exhaustion arrives when either the global macro turns (rate hikes, USD) or A-share style rotates back to growth.","summary_zh":"有色金属板块的周期由三大核心引擎共同驱动：全球大宗商品价格水平（铜铝作为价格锚）、中国宏观政策立场（降准/降LPR重新定价增长折现率并提振建筑需求），以及A股内部价值/周期与成长/科技之间的风格轮动。该板块表现为大宗商品超级周期和北京政策冲动的高Beta代理——当人民银行大力宽松且全球金属价格上涨时涨幅最大，当美联储收紧（美元走强）、中国地产无法消化金属需求，或资金轮动至成长/科技时跌幅最深。周期规律：政策催化剂（降准、刺激一揽子）触发入场，大宗商品价格创历史新高或结构性需求故事（新能源车、AI数据中心）维持上行，当全球宏观转向（加息、美元）或A股风格切回成长时行情结束。","top_signals":["LME copper at or near all-time highs / multi-year highs with momentum exhaustion","A-share style rotates from value/cyclical back to growth (growth-minus-value spread turns sharply positive)","USD index bottoms and begins to recover (DXY trough)","Policy stimulus already fully priced; Politburo language shifts from 'stabilize' to 'quality'"],"top_signals_zh":["LME铜价触及历史/多年高位且动能衰竭","A股风格从价值/周期切回成长（成长-价值利差急剧转正）","美元指数触底并开始反弹（DXY见底）","政策刺激已充分定价；政治局表述从\"稳\"转向\"质\""]},"b-cn_pharma_cxo":{"analog":"Closest to the Oct-2022 trough leg (2022-10-11): same structure of a sector-specific overhang (then: zero-COVID lockdown operational disruption; now: Trump 100% pharma tariff) lifting as macro policy pivots to support growth. Both troughs were accompanied by extreme Shenwan underperformance (pharma among worst laggards), a fundamental catalyst still intact (then: record CXO order books; now: record out-licensing pipeline), and a subsequent growth/liquidity re-rating. The key difference is today's geopolitical tariff risk is more structural than zero-COVID was, suggesting a slower and shallower initial bounce unless a clear tariff rollback or exemption is announced.","analog_zh":"与2022年10月低点（2022-10-11）最为相似：彼时板块特异性压制（新冠封控导致运营中断）随着宏观政策转向支持成长而消散；当前同样是板块特异性压制（特朗普100%药品关税）叠加宏观成长支撑逻辑。两次筑底期间医药均为申万最差行业之列，但基本面催化剂均保持完整（彼时：CXO订单簿创纪录；当前：授权出口管线创历史新高）。关键差异在于当前地缘政治关税风险比新冠防控更具结构性，除非有明确的关税豁免或回调公告，否则初期反弹或更为缓慢且幅度较浅。","bottom_signals":["Record cross-border out-licensing deal announcements (landmark upfront payments)","PBOC easing cycle / LPR cuts driving broad growth style re-rating","China policy designation of biopharma as strategic/pillar industry","VBP cycle pause or negotiated drug list expansion improving pricing visibility"],"bottom_signals_zh":["创纪录的跨境授权出口公告（标志性大额首付款）","央行宽松周期/LPR降息驱动成长风格大规模重估","政策将生物医药列为战略性/支柱性产业","集采周期暂停或谈判药品目录扩展改善定价能见度"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["China VBP/NMPA domestic pricing and regulatory cycle","Global biotech funding cycle and cross-border out-licensing deal flow","SHCOMP growth/value style rotation and liquidity regime","Zero-COVID policy and reopening demand shocks","US geopolitical risk: Biosecure Act + pharma tariffs"],"drivers_zh":["国内集采/NMPA定价与监管周期","全球生物科技融资周期与跨境授权出口交易流","上证成长/价值风格轮动与流动性环境","新冠防控政策与重新开放需求冲击","美国地缘政治风险：《生物安全法案》+药品关税"],"median_cycle_months":9,"summary":"Innovative Pharma & CXO cycles through three recurring structural engines: (1) China's domestic regulatory/pricing cycle — VBP procurement rounds and NMPA policy shifts compress margins and sentiment, while favorable policy designations (pillar industry status) trigger re-ratings; (2) the global biotech funding and out-licensing wave — China CXO order books and innovative-drug valuations track US/global biotech capital cycles and cross-border licensing deal flow, creating beta to global risk appetite; (3) SHCOMP growth/value style rotation — the basket sits firmly in the high-beta growth bucket, surging when liquidity is ample and growth stocks are favored, and underperforming severely when defensives or commodity-value sectors rotate in. Geopolitical regulatory risk (US Biosecure Act, pharma tariffs) adds an asymmetric sector-specific overlay that can override the macro direction.","summary_zh":"创新药与CXO板块的循环由三大结构性引擎驱动：（1）国内监管/定价周期——集采轮次与NMPA政策收紧压缩利润与情绪，而有利的政策认定（支柱产业地位）触发重估；（2）全球生物科技融资与授权出口浪潮——中国CXO订单簿和创新药估值与美国/全球生物科技资本周期及跨境许可交易流量高度联动，承接全球风险偏好的Beta；（3）上证成长/价值风格轮动——板块坚定位于高Beta成长阵营，流动性充裕时大幅跑赢，防御或大宗商品价值板块轮动时严重落后。地缘政治监管风险（美国《生物安全法案》、药品关税）则构成可覆盖宏观方向的行业特异性不对称压制。","top_signals":["China out-licensing deal pace decelerates or deal size shrinks significantly","NMPA VBP new round expansion into innovative drug categories","US legislative action tightening CXO/biotech links (Biosecure inclusion in NDAA)","Valuation stretched (CXO leaders >50-60x P/E) with global biotech funding slowing"],"top_signals_zh":["中国授权出口交易节奏放缓或单笔金额明显收窄","NMPA集采新一轮扩围至创新药类别","美国立法收紧CXO/生物科技合作（《生物安全法案》纳入NDAA）","估值偏高（CXO龙头市盈率>50-60倍）叠加全球生物科技融资放缓"]},"b-cn_rare_earth":{"analog":"Closest to the April-August 2022 trough-to-peak (+73.4%): same growth-cyclical tape leadership structure (Power Equipment and Autos in 2022; Electronics and Telecoms now), same post-risk-off-flush recovery dynamic, and the same Beijing policy unlock as the ignition catalyst (NEV subsidies plus green stimulus in 2022; MIIT enforcement plus export controls in 2026). The critical difference is that today backdrop includes an active export-control licensing regime that did not exist in 2022, giving the current rally a stronger structural floor. If the analog holds, the basket may be in mid-leg with further upside available before the next supply-guidance event or US-China truce expiry in November 2026 triggers the next peak-and-reversion.","analog_zh":"与2022年4-8月触底反弹阶段（+73.4%）最为相似：两次均呈现成长/周期主线领涨格局（2022年电力设备/汽车，当前电子/通信），同属风险规避抛售后的政策驱动修复，北京政策解锁均为点火催化剂（2022年新能源车补贴+绿色刺激；2026年工信部执法+出口管制）。关键差异在于当前宏观背景叠加了2022年所不具备的有效出口管制许可证体系，为本轮行情提供了更强的结构性底部支撑。若类比成立，板块当前可能处于腿中段，仍有上行空间，直至下一轮供给引导事件或2026年11月中美贸易休战到期触发阶段性见顶和回落。","bottom_signals":["NdPr oxide price sustains below $70/kg for 2+ quarters as in late 2023 through early 2024","SHCOMP broad down-leg with defensive rotation marking cycle lows with Banks and Utilities outperforming cyclicals","State intervention signals: National Team ETF purchases or CSRC selling restrictions triggering basket bounces from oversold levels","Policy supply-tightening action such as output breach enforcement or SOE merger announcements after a prolonged price decline"],"bottom_signals_zh":["NdPr氧化物价格持续低于70美元/千克超过两个季度（如2023年底至2024年初）","上证整体下行伴随防御性轮动（银行/公用事业跑赢周期）标志周期低点","国家干预信号：国家队ETF买入或证监会限售措施触发板块从超卖水平反弹","经历长期价格下跌后的政策收紧行动（超产执法、央企并购公告）"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["NdPr oxide price cycle driven by EV and wind turbine build rates","Beijing mining quota and export control policy decisions","SHCOMP growth-cyclical beta amplification","SOE consolidation and industrial policy events","US-China trade tension and geopolitical weaponization of RE supply","Downstream technology demand: EV, wind, robotics, AI humanoid"],"drivers_zh":["NdPr氧化物价格周期受新能源车/风机建设速率驱动","北京采矿配额与出口管制政策决策","上证成长/周期贝塔放大效应","央企整合与产业政策事件","中美贸易紧张与稀土供应地缘政治武器化","下游科技需求：新能源车、风电、机器人、AI人形机器人"],"median_cycle_months":10,"summary":"Rare Earth and Magnets is a dual-engine cyclical: it gyrates with NdPr oxide price cycles driven by EV and wind turbine build rates, Chinese mining quota decisions, and inventory cycles, and it spikes on Beijing policy events including MIIT regulations, state SOE consolidation, and export controls. It amplifies the SHCOMP growth-cyclical beta on the upside but bleeds worse than peers in risk-off episodes because of its high-multiple growth narrative. The structural driver is China chokehold over 85%+ of global REE separation capacity: any government action restricting supply — quotas, export controls, or SOE mergers — re-rates the basket upward; any relaxation or price-guidance directive deflates it sharply. Peaks have historically coincided with NdPr price spikes above $130-150/kg and policy-excitement tops; troughs with price capitulation near $60-70/kg and broad market risk-off.","summary_zh":"稀土永磁板块受双引擎驱动：其波动与NdPr氧化物价格周期高度同步（后者本身追踪新能源车/风机建设速率、中国采矿配额决策及库存周期），同时对北京政策事件高度敏感（工信部新规、央企整合、出口管制）。该板块在上行时放大上证成长/周期贝塔，在风险规避阶段跌幅往往超过同类，原因在于其高估值成长叙事更为脆弱。结构性驱动力在于中国对全球85%以上稀土分离产能的绝对控制权：任何限制供给的政府行动——无论是配额、出口管制还是央企并购——都会推动板块重估上行；而任何松动或价格引导举措则会使其迅速估值收缩。历史上，峰值往往出现在NdPr价格涨破130-150美元/千克和政策利好炒作见顶之时，谷底则对应价格在60-70美元/千克附近恐慌性下跌与大盘整体风险规避。","top_signals":["NdPr oxide price spikes above $130-150/kg coinciding with basket peaks in Sep 2021 and Aug 2022","Rapid +70-90% single-leg gains in under 90 days that reversed within weeks of completion","Growth-cyclical tape leadership exhaustion when SHCOMP stalls or reverses from multi-month highs","Policy excitement top: MIIT regulation passage or export-control announcement fully priced within 1-2 months"],"top_signals_zh":["NdPr氧化物价格飙破130-150美元/千克与板块见顶同步（2021年9月及2022年8月）","90天内单腿涨幅70-90%完成后数周内反转","上证从多月高位滞涨或反转时成长/周期主线动能耗竭","政策炒作见顶：工信部法规落地或出口管制公告发布后1-2个月内消化完毕"]},"b-cn_robotics":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current setup is the August 2022 -- December 2022 topping-to-trough sequence following the 2022 V-rebound peak (Leg 3 peak at Aug 1, 2022): both followed a +100%+ rebound leg from a policy-driven capitulation trough, both saw growth-over-value spreads widen to extreme levels (12.5pp in 2022, now 58.8pp), and both had narrow leadership concentrating in Electronics and Power Equipment. The 2022 case resolved with a -28.1% drawdown when the macro catalyst (Fed Jackson Hole shock, zero-COVID persistence) overrode the policy narrative. Today the analog risk is an exogenous shock -- renewed tariff escalation, a US semiconductor export-control tightening, or a Fed-driven global growth scare -- that similarly deflates the AI/humanoid narrative premium when the basket is priced for perfection. One key difference: the current policy mandate (15th FYP embodied intelligence, 90% global humanoid share) is more structurally grounded than 2022's stimulus bounce, which may extend the topping process rather than cause an immediate reversal.","analog_zh":"最接近当前形态的历史类比是2022年8月至2022年12月的顶部至低谷阶段（第三腿高点，2022年8月1日）：两者均发生在政策驱动恐慌性低点后的100%+反弹腿之后，均出现成长超额价值利差扩张至极端水平（2022年为12.5pp，当前为58.8pp），均以电子和强势板块领涨集中化告终。2022年案例最终以-28.1%的回撤收场，外因是美联储杰克逊霍尔鹰派冲击叠加清零政策持续。当前类比风险同样来自外生冲击——中美关税再度升级、美国半导体出口管制收紧或美联储引发的全球增长恐慌——这些均可能在篮子已按完美剧本定价时压缩AI/人形机器人叙事溢价。关键差异在于：当前政策锚定（十五五规划具身智能、全球人形机器人约90%份额）远比2022年的刺激反弹更具结构支撑，顶部过程可能拉长而非立即逆转。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP drawdown exceeds 15% with defensives (Coal, Banks) in positive territory","growth-to-value spread below -15pp (value leads by 15pp+)","Beijing policy floor signal: Politburo explicit 'stable growth' / 'halt the decline' language","PBOC RRR cut or major liquidity event in context of oversold growth sectors"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指跌幅超15%而煤炭/银行等防御板块仍收正","成长相对价值利差低于-15pp（价值超额逾15pp）","北京政策底信号：政治局明确\"稳增长\"或\"止跌回稳\"表述","央行降准或重大流动性事件叠加成长板块超卖"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing Five-Year Plan / MIIT policy mandate re-rating cycles","PBOC RRR cuts / National Team liquidity injections as beta triggers","global AI tech theme waves (ChatGPT, DeepSeek, humanoid commercialization)","US-China trade/tariff regime as binary risk-on / risk-off switch","China industrial capex cycle correlated with property sector health","SHCOMP broad market beta amplification (3-6x in both directions)"],"drivers_zh":["北京五年规划/工信部政策指令驱动的重估周期","央行降准/国家队流动性注入作为贝塔触发器","全球AI科技主题浪潮（ChatGPT、DeepSeek、人形机器人商业化）","中美贸易/关税机制作为二元风险开关","中国工业资本开支周期与地产行业健康度高度相关","上证综指宽基贝塔放大（双向均约3-6倍）"],"median_cycle_months":14.5,"summary":"Robotics & Automation cycles structurally as a high-beta growth-theme proxy on the SHCOMP: it amplifies broad index moves by 3-6x in rallies and selloffs alike, while its specific re-rating episodes coincide with Beijing policy mandates (each successive Five-Year Plan iteration has been a major catalyst) and global tech-theme waves (ChatGPT, DeepSeek, humanoid supply-chain). The recurring cycle engine is: (1) a Beijing policy announcement elevating industrial automation / intelligent manufacturing / embodied AI to strategic priority creates a narrative floor; (2) broad SHCOMP liquidity influx (RRR cuts, National Team buying, Politburo pivot language) provides the beta lift; (3) global AI/tech theme waves (ChatGPT Dec 2022, DeepSeek Jan 2025, 15th FYP 2026) add a second-order multiple expansion; and (4) macro risk-off shocks (Fed rate hikes, US tariffs, property deflation) compress multiple and reset the cycle, with the basket underperforming the index in every selloff leg as growth rotates to value. The median full cycle is approximately 14-15 months peak-to-peak, but legs range from 43 days (+40.5%) to 14 months (+151.5%), making timing by calendar unreliable -- the policy-and-liquidity signal is the leading indicator, not elapsed time.","summary_zh":"机器人与自动化板块在结构上表现为上证综指的高贝塔成长主题代理：上涨期间对大盘涨幅的放大倍数为3-6倍，下跌期间亦然。历次显著重估均与北京政策指令（每轮五年规划迭代均为重大催化剂）及全球科技主题浪潮（ChatGPT、DeepSeek、人形机器人供应链）同步出现。周期驱动机制可归纳为四步：一是北京将工业自动化/智能制造/具身智能列为战略性优先产业，形成叙事底部；二是宽基流动性注入（降准、国家队买盘、政治局表态转向）提供贝塔动力；三是全球AI/科技主题浪潮（2022年12月ChatGPT、2025年1月DeepSeek、2026年十五五规划）带来估值乘数二次扩张；四是宏观风险冲击（美联储加息、美国关税、地产通缩）压缩估值并重置周期，每轮下跌期中篮子均跑输大盘，成长向价值轮动。中位峰峰周期约为14-15个月，但单腿时长从43天到14个月不等，纯粹依赖日历时间择时不可靠——政策与流动性信号才是领先指标。","top_signals":["growth-over-value spread exceeds 30pp with SHCOMP +15% or more over the leg","Telecoms and Electronics leadership narrowing to top-2 within basket","MIIT / Politburo policy documents extensively cited by sell-side as 'game-changing'","retail margin leverage surging in automation ETFs"],"top_signals_zh":["成长超额价值利差超30pp且上证综指本轮涨幅逾15%","通信与电子收窄至篮子前两大领涨品种","工信部/政治局政策文件被卖方大量引用为'历史性转折点'","自动化主题ETF中散户杠杆资金急剧攀升"]},"b-cn_semis":{"analog":"Closest to the July 2021 peak: same liquidity/theme-driven growth style stretch (growth-value spread +18.2pp now vs +4.1pp then, but now far more extreme after 400% gains), SHCOMP barely positive, and sector at record relative-strength rank after a policy-AI supercycle. The July 2021 top formed when 14th Five-Year Plan premium had been fully priced with no near-term revenue catalyst to sustain it — the current setup has DeepSeek/Ascend as the AI bridge, but at 93.7 cycle position and with leadership narrowing to Electronics/Telecoms only, the exhaustion pattern is structurally identical. Key difference: the 2021 selloff was triggered by a governance shock (Big Fund probe); the next turn catalyst here is more likely to be a US export-control escalation or a DeepSeek demand-disappointment.","analog_zh":"与2021年7月顶部最为相似：同样是流动性/主题驱动的成长风格极度拉伸（当前成长-价值利差+18.2pp，彼时+4.1pp，但经历400%涨幅后当前更为极端），上证综指几乎没有上涨，板块在政策-AI超级周期后相对强度高居榜首。2021年7月顶部形成时，「十四五」溢价已充分定价而缺乏近期收入催化剂支撑——当前DeepSeek/昇腾提供了AI桥梁，但在周期位置93.7、领涨品种收窄至电子/通信的情况下，衰竭形态在结构上如出一辙。关键区别：2021年下跌由治理冲击（大基金调查）触发；当前下一个拐点催化剂更可能是美国出口管制升级或DeepSeek需求不及预期。","bottom_signals":["Explicit National Team / Central Huijin ETF buying pledge or Politburo policy pivot language on tech","New Big Fund tranche announcement (restores state guarantee on sector capex)","SHCOMP at multi-year trough with defensives sharply outperforming (flight-to-safety exhaustion)","Major global AI model launch or US-China trade-war de-escalation signaling domestic chip demand"],"bottom_signals_zh":["国家队/中央汇金明确ETF增持承诺，或政治局科技政策措辞转向","新一期大基金宣布设立（恢复国家对行业资本支出的兜底担保）","上证综指处于多年低位，防御性板块大幅领跑（避险行情衰竭）","重大全球AI模型发布或中美贸易战降级信号驱动国产芯片需求"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing 国产替代 / IC Fund policy impulse (Big Fund I/II/III deployment)","US export control escalation (Oct-2022 BIS rules, entity list expansions)","A-share liquidity cycle: growth-value style rotation tied to PBOC easing/tightening","Global AI demand catalyst (ChatGPT, DeepSeek) driving domestic chip substitution theme","Big Fund governance events (corruption probes, executive arrests) removing state bid","China macro regime: property/deflation risk-off vs reopening/stimulus risk-on"],"drivers_zh":["北京国产替代/集成电路产业投资基金政策冲动（大基金一/二/三期部署）","美国出口管制升级（2022年10月BIS规则、实体清单扩容）","A股流动性周期：成长-价值风格轮动与央行宽松/收紧联动","全球AI需求催化剂（ChatGPT、DeepSeek）推动国产芯片替代主题","大基金治理事件（腐败调查、高管被捕）抽走国家托底资金","中国宏观制度：房地产/通缩风险规避 vs 重新开放/刺激政策风险偏好"],"median_cycle_months":14,"summary":"China semiconductors cycle on the intersection of three recurring engines: Beijing's 国产替代 (import substitution) policy impulse, the US-China tech-war escalation/de-escalation cycle, and China's broader A-share liquidity/growth-style rotation. Peaks form when policy-premium valuations stretch beyond demonstrable revenue, Big Fund governance events remove the state bid, or US export-control shocks reprice the technology access risk. Troughs form when Beijing intervenes directly (Big Fund capital deployment, National Team ETF buying, Politburo tech-policy language pivots) coinciding with a global growth/AI catalyst. The sector moves 2-4x the SHCOMP index in both directions because it is simultaneously a high-beta domestic theme play AND the purest expression of China's geopolitical technology sovereignty ambition — meaning it attracts both speculative flow and long-duration structural mandates.","summary_zh":"中国半导体板块受三大周期性引擎交替驱动：北京的国产替代政策冲动、中美科技战升级/降级周期，以及A股整体流动性与成长风格轮动。顶部形成时，政策溢价估值往往已超越可验证的收入兑现，大基金治理事件抽走国家托底资金，或美国出口管制冲击重新定价技术获取风险。底部形成时，北京通常直接出手干预（大基金注资、国家队ETF增持、政治局科技政策措辞转向），同时叠加全球成长/AI催化剂。该板块双向波幅均为上证综指的2-4倍，因为它同时是高贝塔的国内主题投机标的，也是中国科技主权雄心最纯粹的载体，吸引投机资金与长期结构性配置的双重叠加。","top_signals":["Policy-premium valuation stretch: sector P/E >80x without near-term revenue proof (as in July 2021 and April 2023 peaks)","Big Fund or state-patron governance shock (audit announcement, executive arrest)","US export control escalation announcement or credible congressional signal","Growth-value spread at extreme (>+20pp growth outperformance) with SHCOMP flattening"],"top_signals_zh":["政策溢价估值极度拉伸：板块市盈率超80倍而缺乏近期收入兑现（如2021年7月和2023年4月顶部）","大基金或国家担保机构治理冲击（审计公告、高管被捕）","美国出口管制升级公告或可信的国会信号","成长-价值利差极端扩张（成长跑赢>+20pp），同时上证综指走平"]},"b-cn_soe_value":{"analog":"Closest to the May-2023 peak setup reversed: the current leg most rhymes with the May-2023 to January-2024 selloff (Leg 2), where the SOE basket fell 23.8% alongside SHCOMP -18.4% as the initial policy re-rating catalyst faded and the market repriced disappointment. The present leg mirrors that pattern structurally — a peak following a multi-year outperformance run, then a sharp de-rating as the dominant market narrative shifts (then: reopening disappointment; now: AI/growth theme dominance) — but with a key difference: SHCOMP is nearly flat (-1.7%) this time versus -18.4% in Leg 2, meaning the current drawdown is almost entirely style-factor-driven rather than macro-beta, suggesting the floor may be shallower once value/yield re-asserts.","analog_zh":"当前腿与2023年5月至2024年1月的回调腿（第二腿）最为相似：彼时篮子下跌23.8%，上证综指跌18.4%，原因是政策重估催化效应消退、市场重新定价失望预期。本轮同样是在多年跑赢后见顶、主导叙事切换（彼时为重开预期落空，今时为AI/成长风格主导）。关键差异在于：此轮上证综指几近持平（-1.7%），而第二腿上证跌18.4%——说明本次回撤几乎完全是风格因子驱动而非宏观系统性风险，一旦价值/高息风格重新获得资金青睐，底部空间或相对有限。","bottom_signals":["SHCOMP hits multi-year lows with snowball/structured-product forced-selling cascade (Jan-2024 pattern)","SOE basket 20-day RS rank falls to bottom quartile (rank < 8 of 31) with SHCOMP also down","National-team / Central Huijin ETF buying publicly announced or confirmed by flow data","SASAC or CSRC issues new dividend/buyback directive or reiterates 中特估 mandate in policy documents"],"bottom_signals_zh":["上证综指创多年新低叠加雪球/结构性产品集中强制平仓（参考2024年1月形态）","央企篮子20日相对强度排名跌至末四分之一（31只中排名低于8）且上证同步下跌","国家队/汇金公开宣布或资金流数据确认大规模增购ETF","国资委或证监会发布新一轮分红/回购指引，或在政策文件中重申中特估方向"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["SASAC market-value management reform cycles (dividend mandates, ROE targets, buyback guidance)","中特估 re-rating campaigns: CSRC/SASAC policy signals on SOE valuation","A-share growth-vs-value style regime (tech crackdown → value; AI boom → growth)","SHCOMP-level beta driven by PBOC monetary easing or national-team stabilization buying","Property/credit cycle: SOE construction/financials highly sensitive to developer health","US-China tariff regime: escalation redirects capital toward AI self-sufficiency over SOE yield"],"drivers_zh":["国资委市值管理考核周期（分红指引、ROE目标、回购要求）","中特估重估运动：证监会/国资委的央企估值政策信号","A股成长/价值风格轮动（科技整顿→价值占优；AI热潮→成长占优）","上证综指beta：央行货币宽松或国家队托底驱动的市场整体涨跌","地产/信用周期：建筑类、金融类央企对开发商流动性高度敏感","中美关税格局：加征关税将资金推向AI自主可控而非央企高息股"],"median_cycle_months":24,"summary":"SOE Blue Chips cycle on the interplay of three structural forces: Beijing's policy posture toward state capital (SASAC reform mandates, 中特估 re-rating campaigns, dividend-payout directives), the growth-vs-value style regime on A-shares, and SHCOMP-level beta during broad risk-on or risk-off swings. The basket reliably outperforms when (a) regulators punish private-sector alternatives and redirect capital toward SOEs, or (b) 'national team' stabilization buying props the index from below. It reliably underperforms when growth/tech narratives dominate and investors chase AI or momentum themes. Because SOE dividends are structural — not earnings-cyclical — the basket's troughs tend to be policy-induced price dislocations rather than fundamental impairments, making sharp recoveries possible once the policy catalyst re-engages.","summary_zh":"中特估·央企篮子的周期由三大结构性力量交替主导：北京对国有资本的政策姿态（国资委改革考核、中特估重估运动、分红指引）、A股成长/价值风格轮动，以及上证综指层面的整体涨跌beta。当监管部门打压私营替代品、资金被迫转向央企，或「国家队」在宽基指数上托底时，该篮子往往系统性跑赢；而当成长/科技叙事主导市场、资金追逐AI或动量主题时，则系统性跑输。央企股息具有结构性而非周期性，因此篮子底部往往是政策性错杀而非基本面恶化，一旦新政策催化剂出现，往往能快速修复。","top_signals":["SOE outperformance vs SHCOMP exceeds 30–40pp over 12 months (中特估 froth exhaustion)","Policy re-rating narrative peaks: SOE market-cap milestones celebrated in state media (e.g. China Mobile surpassing Moutai in April 2023)","Construction and Telecoms lead Shenwan rankings for multiple consecutive months (late-cycle leadership)","Growth-vs-value spread turns sharply positive (growth starts to re-lead), marking style-regime reversal"],"top_signals_zh":["央企篮子过去12个月跑赢上证综指超过30—40个百分点（中特估行情过热信号）","政策重估叙事见顶：官媒大篇幅报道央企市值里程碑（如2023年4月中国移动市值超茅台）","建筑与通信板块连续多月蝉联申万行业涨幅榜首（周期末期补涨特征）","成长对价值溢价急剧转正（成长重新领跑），标志风格机制反转"]},"b-cn_software":{"analog":"Closest analog to the current bottoming setup is the Aug-2024 trough (leg starting 2024-08-27): same configuration of a post-AI-peak selloff of nearly identical magnitude (-33.9% then vs -33.6% now), same pivot from software into value/defensive rotation, and same positioning ahead of a potential dual catalyst (policy liquidity + AI product release). The Aug-2024 bottom resolved into the largest rally in the dataset (+124%) when the PBOC September 24 bazooka landed within weeks of the trough. The key risk this time is that the intra-growth rotation (software to hardware/telecoms) appears more structural -- driven by agentic AI disruption of subscription economics -- rather than purely macro-driven, which could delay or cap the recovery relative to the Aug-2024 template.","analog_zh":"与当前筑底形态最接近的历史对照是2024年8月低点（2024-08-27起始的行情腿）：同为AI高点后回调且幅度几乎相同（彼时-33.9%，此次-33.6%），同为资金从软件转向价值/防御板块，同为等候双重催化剂（政策流动性+AI新品发布）的持仓格局。2024年8月低点在央行9月24日大招落地后数周内演化为数据集中最大涨幅（+124%）。此次的关键风险在于，成长板块内部轮动（软件到硬件/通信）看起来更具结构性——由智能体AI冲击订阅经济模式驱动，而非单纯宏观因素——可能延迟或压低相对2024年8月模板的反弹空间。","bottom_signals":["Shenwan Computers among the bottom 3 performers for 8+ consecutive weeks","PBOC announces RRR or LPR cut with explicit capital market support language","growth-minus-value spread turns positive from deeply negative (above -15pp) readings","A global AI model release triggering fresh domestic AI theme buying"],"bottom_signals_zh":["申万计算机连续8周以上位居申万行业涨幅垫底前三","央行官宣降准或LPR并明确提及资本市场支持","成长跑赢价值从深度负值（低于-15pp）转正","全球AI新模型发布触发国内AI主题资金再度流入"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["xinchuang/IT-localization policy procurement cycles","global AI paradigm breakthroughs triggering sentiment spikes","PBOC RRR/LPR/liquidity injections lifting growth multiples","US-China tech decoupling and export-control shock risk-off","China property sector cycle affecting broader risk appetite and SHCOMP"],"drivers_zh":["信创/国产替代政策采购周期","全球AI范式突破触发情绪飙涨","央行降准/LPR/流动性注入抬升成长估值","中美科技脱钩和出口管制冲击引发风险规避","中国房地产周期影响整体风险偏好和上证综指"],"median_cycle_months":11.5,"summary":"China Software & AI Apps cycles on a repeating three-force engine: (1) Beijing policy shocks -- xinchuang/IT-localization mandates or PBOC liquidity injections directly lift earnings visibility and sentiment for domestic software vendors; (2) AI paradigm catalysts -- each global AI breakthrough (ChatGPT 2022, Sora 2024, DeepSeek 2025) triggers a 6-10 week frenzied rerating that overshoots and then reverses as application-layer monetization disappoints; (3) macro risk-off events -- US-China tech decoupling, property sector crises, and Fed tightening rotate capital from high-multiple growth into defensives or value, amplifying the drawdown relative to SHCOMP. The basket consistently outperforms in risk-on, growth-led tapes and underperforms badly when flight-to-safety or value rotations take hold, making its cycle highly correlated with the broader SHCOMP growth-value regime.","summary_zh":"中国软件与AI应用板块的周期由三力循环驱动：（1）北京政策冲击——信创/国产替代强制要求或央行流动性注入直接提升国内软件商的盈利能见度与市场情绪；（2）AI范式催化剂——每次全球AI技术突破（ChatGPT 2022年、Sora 2024年、DeepSeek 2025年）均触发6-10周的疯狂估值重评，随后因应用层商业化不及预期而过度修正；（3）宏观风险规避事件——中美科技脱钩、房地产危机及美联储紧缩将资金从高估值成长股轮动至防御或价值股，放大相对上证综指的跌幅。该篮子在风险偏好向上、成长主导的行情中持续跑赢，在避险或价值轮动时大幅落后，其周期走势与上证综指成长/价值风格切换高度相关。","top_signals":["AI theme ETF returns exceed 40% in under 8 weeks (froth signal)","Shenwan Computers becomes the top Shenwan performer for 3+ consecutive weeks","growth-minus-value spread widens beyond 30pp in a single leg","PBOC/government policy catalyst exhausted with no new announced measure"],"top_signals_zh":["AI主题ETF在8周内涨幅超40%（泡沫信号）","申万计算机连续3周以上位居申万行业涨幅榜首","单段行情成长跑赢价值超过30pp","政策催化剂耗尽，无新增政策公告"]},"b-cn_solar":{"analog":"Closest to the August 2022 peak: same exhaustion-of-policy-catalyst setup after a liquidity and policy-driven ~96.5% rally, with upstream prices now rolling back from the MIIT-driven polysilicon rebound and module capacity (~1,200 GW) still approximately double global demand. In August 2022 the market had just completed a near-identical surge on the post-lockdown 33-measures package, then rolled over into an 18-month -62.9% bear as overcapacity dynamics reasserted -- that peak was marked by Power Equipment reaching the top Shenwan sector rank just before fundamentals forced recognition. Today the MIIT supply-discipline narrative has been priced, upstream profitability remains fragile, and the tape leadership has rotated away from Power Equipment to Electronics and Telecoms.","analog_zh":"与2022年8月峰值最为相近：彼时光伏同样完成了一轮约96.5%的政策与流动性驱动反弹（解封+33条），随即进入长达18个月、跌幅62.9%的熊市——产能过剩逻辑重新主导，峰值恰好出现在电力设备跻身申万行业榜首不久之后。当前工信部供给侧纪律叙事已被市场充分定价，上游盈利能力仍然脆弱，行业领涨权已由电力设备转移至电子与通信。","bottom_signals":["polysilicon prices at multi-year lows below CNY 40/kg with producers suspending output -- supply discipline inflection signals","MIIT or NDRC convening capacity-restraint meetings with major producers plus explicit production-floor pricing announcements","Power Equipment ranked bottom-3 Shenwan sector in a prolonged defensive or value-led tape with SHCOMP down more than 15%","sector losses at combined multi-billion CNY level with major producers reporting negative gross margins indicating maximum pessimism"],"bottom_signals_zh":["多晶硅价格跌至多年低位、低于40元/公斤且企业停产减产——供给侧纪律拐点信号","工信部或国家发改委召集龙头企业开展产能自律会议并明确最低限价安排","电力设备连续位居申万末三行业，市场长期呈防御/价值主导且上证综指累计下跌超15%","行业合计亏损达数百亿元级别、龙头企业毛利率为负——悲观情绪极值"],"confidence":"medium","drivers":["Beijing dual-carbon/FYP policy shock resets demand outlook","polysilicon-to-module overcapacity cycle (capacity ratchets up irreversibly, prices collapse)","SHCOMP growth-vs-value risk regime (solar = high-beta growth proxy in risk-on)","global rates and USD (Fed tightening = multiple compression for high-P/E new energy names)","trade friction and export channel (US tariff escalations remove the export relief valve)"],"drivers_zh":["北京双碳/五年规划政策冲击重塑需求预期","从多晶硅到组件的产能过剩周期（产能只增不减，价格持续崩塌）","上证综指成长vs价值风险偏好机制（光伏=风险偏好时的高贝塔成长代理）","全球利率与美元走势（美联储收紧压缩高PE新能源估值）","贸易摩擦与出口通道（美国加征关税封堵出口减压阀）"],"median_cycle_months":14,"summary":"China Solar/PV cycles on three interlocking drivers: (1) Beijing policy shock -- dual-carbon mandates, FYP capacity targets, supply-discipline interventions -- that periodically reset the demand or supply-side equation; (2) the overcapacity/margin cycle, where polysilicon and module prices oscillate between shortage-premium and severe below-cost oversupply as capacity ratchets up irreversibly with each policy boom; and (3) the SHCOMP liquidity/growth-risk regime, which determines whether solar rallies as a high-beta growth proxy or sells off as the hardest-hit growth sector in a risk-off rotation. Peak-to-trough moves of 40-63% and trough-to-peak moves of 28-115% reflect the brutal intersection of a structurally growing but chronically over-supplied manufacturing industry with China's binary risk-on/risk-off A-share market cycle.","summary_zh":"中国光伏板块的周期由三组相互咬合的驱动因素决定：（1）北京政策冲击——双碳指令、五年规划装机目标、供给侧自律干预——定期重塑供需方程式；（2）产能/利润周期，多晶硅与组件价格在每轮政策性扩产后，于供应紧张溢价与严重低于成本的过剩之间剧烈震荡；（3）上证综指流动性与成长风险偏好机制，决定光伏在风险偏好修复时以高贝塔成长代理的身份上涨，还是在风险规避切换时成为跌幅最深的成长板块。40%至63%的峰谷回撤与28%至115%的谷峰反弹，映射出一个结构性增长却长期供过于求的制造业与A股二元风险偏好市场周期叠加后的极端波动特征。","top_signals":["polysilicon price spike above $25-30/kg signals upstream shortage and impending capacity overbuild -- watch for peaks 6-12 months later","Power Equipment reaching top-3 Shenwan sector rank in a SHCOMP up-cycle with growth-vs-value spread exceeding +15pp","major FYP or dual-carbon capacity target announcements followed by immediate and outsized stock price follow-through","growth-over-value A-share tape with SHCOMP surging +10% or more lifting all high-beta sectors indiscriminately"],"top_signals_zh":["多晶硅价格涨破25至30美元/公斤——预示上游供应紧张及后续产能过度扩张，峰值往往滞后6至12个月出现","电力设备跻身申万前三行业且上证综指上行、成长跑赢价值超15个百分点","五年规划或双碳装机大目标发布后股价即时大幅跟涨","A股成长偏好行情中上证综指涨幅超10%带动所有高贝塔板块无差别上涨"]}};
